', '2025-03-11 13:12:58.919809+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, 'completed', 'Let''s try another match for you both!', '2025-03-26 22:55:48.697+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('7e3f4e54-778d-4740-858d-5e4666b23a6f', 'ea155ac4-eb3a-4e24-a4be-84f0143f4348', 'f79ffe36-4f02-4ba8-a359-b9bd8963cbd1', 'In order to complete Erica''s first sideby match. ', '2025-03-23 21:37:26.617853+00', 'ea155ac4-eb3a-4e24-a4be-84f0143f4348', NULL, 'completed', 'Erica Crane and Mike Mendelson explore more than AI—they surface rich reflections on embodied learning, trust, identity, and the role of educators in a tech-shifting world. Erica’s metaphor of moving from water to bike captures the transfer of confidence across domains, while Mike’s childhood memories and AI skepticism ground the conversation in lived experience and ethical questioning. Together, they model the kind of honest, relational dialogue that honors uncertainty, treats resistance as reflection, and foregrounds agency—offering a powerful glimpse into the human side of professional growth in the age of AI.', '2025-03-26 23:04:23.116+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('a24ce612-d1f9-4f67-8ee2-2e180a422b57', '43812edc-e7fd-4226-bb9c-cd9bd174e0b0', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Hi Mike and Jeff! You’re both incredible tech leaders with rich insights into learning–especially professional learning. Once you find a time to meet, use Upduo (in your toolbox) to connect. ', '2025-03-26 18:31:37.268421+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-26 18:31:38.744+00', 'completed', 'In this conversation, you both surfaced the powerful ways AI is becoming not just a tool but a co-thinker—supporting reflection, focus, and creative dreaming. From project GPTs and Pomodoro prototypes to voice journaling and building bespoke assistants, you''re each designing workflows that extend your agency and imagination. What emerged most clearly is your shared belief that learners—of any age—need to become dreamers, problem seekers, and project managers in a world where intelligence is abundant and connection is everything.', '2025-04-17 22:22:27.575+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
