	('bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'You two geeks should meet! You''re both amazing community leaders and have a ton to share. ', '2025-03-28 16:09:51.712211+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-03-28 16:09:55.147+00', 'completed', 'Cass and Jeff explored a draft lesson together while reflecting on learner agency, attention, and the emotional tone of instruction. Cass emphasized that learners need curiosity frameworks, not memorization, and voiced concerns about surveillance-driven teaching. Together, they named a shift in mindset—toward asking better questions, staying open, and designing AI tools that reflect human values.', '2025-04-18 17:42:28.683+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
