	('00e37ce2-5765-4a6f-b15f-cc44df906036', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '482f5330-4f63-4232-ab68-d138579256ab', 'testing', '2025-04-07 19:35:13.254756+00', 'ea155ac4-eb3a-4e24-a4be-84f0143f4348', '2025-04-07 19:35:15.159+00', 'completed', 'test complete', '2025-04-18 22:36:28.415+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('e8f99693-7f2a-4f86-852d-170b0ecdb04f', '4bb175fe-ebd9-4641-9edc-593037b6152d', '59e9f386-0ecc-4201-99dd-802f7f8e7b33', 'You two incredible educators should chat! You''re both close in time zones and pedagogical stances. :-)', '2025-04-21 18:02:34.22128+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-04-21 18:02:37.639+00', 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('3d0c979f-f010-4ea0-b6c4-90f46901b055', '45a4fa1a-ba74-4b76-b607-072b45ea750b', '4bb175fe-ebd9-4641-9edc-593037b6152d', 'You two should chat! You both are teachers with a bent for creating & supporting quality professional learning.', '2025-04-21 23:09:55.028817+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-04-21 23:09:56.267+00', 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('4844e5bf-edbd-4410-98f3-757ca223f212', 'cd985910-e971-4907-988f-d311b2adb4d1', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Connect! ;-)', '2025-04-18 01:24:53.096741+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-04-18 01:24:56.437+00', 'completed', 'Rob and Jeff connected around mastery-based learning and the power of shared educator insight. Rob’s “shared brain” vision resonated as they imagined sideby as a space for collective growth. Both left inspired by the idea that every educator has something worth sharing.', '2025-04-22 16:14:04.987+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('af08693a-693c-4c20-936f-5d4220330d4d', 'cd985910-e971-4907-988f-d311b2adb4d1', '45a4fa1a-ba74-4b76-b607-072b45ea750b', 'You two should chat! You''re both amazing teachers with a keen eye for using tech in the classroom and helping teachers at the same time.', '2025-04-22 16:16:58.437302+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-04-22 16:17:02.056+00', 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	('e16823ac-2fd9-4892-baeb-da75481f9692', '59e9f386-0ecc-4201-99dd-802f7f8e7b33', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'You two should reconnect! It''s been a while. ', '2025-04-18 22:34:03.878155+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-04-18 22:34:09.83+00', 'completed', 'Nova and Jeff connected around their shared commitment to purposeful work, co-thinking, and the evolving role of AI in education. Nova described how she’s using ChatGPT as a creative collaborator—for designing family learning experiences and solving complex logistical challenges like tent assignments for 100+ students. Together, they reflected on how AI is pushing them to be clearer thinkers, more strategic leaders, and more attuned to the ways students—true AI natives—will shape the future of learning.', '2025-04-24 18:21:18.439+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('765b8cf9-3d59-4387-b038-5c44d750a488', '1e39285c-a332-4528-9b84-5b399b1863a8', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'You two should chat! You''re both incredible education leaders with a bent towards system thinking. ', '2025-04-10 23:09:49.752942+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-04-10 23:09:53.291+00', 'completed', 'Jeff and Dox explored how AI is reshaping education—not by replacing teachers, but by revealing what’s most human about the work. Dox shared his vision of a “pedagogy of presence,” where the real value lies in how educators show up, respond, and build meaning in the moment. Together, they imagined AI not as a tool for efficiency, but as a mirror that helps us understand ourselves and each other more deeply.', '2025-04-24 18:23:06.888+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', NULL, NULL),
	('abb94bfc-94b4-43de-a50e-e78e7c88404c', 'e703c834-b010-4c88-9b89-e310df8ad353', '1e39285c-a332-4528-9b84-5b399b1863a8', 'You two should chat! You''re both deep into AI tools and pushing the wild frontier.', '2025-04-25 19:46:22.632101+00', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', '2025-04-25 19:46:23.73+00', 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
