	('f2923b78-452d-4dc3-8728-286f126ff463', 'debdb922-2ac0-4e2f-aed8-14c66e16bcea', 'Hi, I''m testing this idea-capture setup. Give me a wave if you get this 🤙🏼', 'text', '2025-02-14 22:42:47.640528+00', '2025-02-14 22:42:47.640528+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('8b6d7bc2-9f7a-431d-9d83-7775780273b5', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', 'Hello fellow friends! My name is Brittany, and I am excited to introduce myself as a Special Education Teacher in the Lake Washington School District. My teaching philosophy is all students can learn and achieve high standards when given the appropriate tools. I am particularly eager to use Sideby, as it will help facilitate awesome discussions and provide opportunity for collaboration to enhance my practice and support my community.  I have a keen interest in technology integration, artificial intelligence, differentiated instruction, and applied behavior science. I look forward to yapping, collaboration, and sharing ideas with fellow educators in our community. ', 'text', '2025-02-17 20:00:48.981786+00', '2025-02-17 20:00:48.981786+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('f3524e97-6dbc-4387-a136-42b581333b36', '35695ec4-28b8-4afd-877e-566aeda234fe', 'Hey!', 'text', '2025-02-18 04:55:33.757677+00', '2025-02-18 04:55:33.757677+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('3ce26871-ca4d-4b03-97ec-f4c3b00801de', '39116d29-cb0e-4f04-b7de-3dd273a92057', 'What did Lorri and I chat about? Highlights?', 'text', '2025-02-18 18:49:32.373889+00', '2025-02-18 18:49:32.373889+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('4842604c-faff-4606-8039-a0d2dfa6fdc8', '39116d29-cb0e-4f04-b7de-3dd273a92057', 'Given that the text to translate is identical to the example provided, there is no alteration needed. The text is already in the desired style.', 'ai_trick', '2025-02-19 19:50:28.633593+00', '2025-02-19 19:50:28.633593+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('f0c1500b-6434-42e3-abd6-ff320914c67c', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', 'Brittany Stevens Special Education Teacher | Advocate for Differentiation & AI Integration in Education | Lifelong Learner & Collaborator  Passionate about creating inclusive and engaging learning environments, I am a dedicated special education teacher supporting 2nd and 4th-grade students in reading, writing, math, adaptive skills, and social-emotional learning. With four years of experience and a background serving diverse caseloads, I specialize in differentiation and leveraging technology, including AI tools, to meet individual student needs.  After attending the 2025 AI in Education Conference in Seattle, I am excited to integrate innovative tech solutions that enhance student growth and streamline educational practices. I thrive on collaborating with fellow educators, exchanging effective strategies, and continuously evolving as an educator. My mission is to build supportive, adaptable learning spaces where all students can thrive.  Let’s connect—I’m always eager to share ideas and grow my professional network!', 'text', '2025-02-19 21:51:02.269485+00', '2025-02-19 21:51:02.269485+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('9a92a685-cfe1-4e7d-b992-d998d7086357', '86f608d8-be4a-47b2-9c8a-b0b3fb52dabb', 'Here’s a draft LinkedIn post based on Michael''s reflection. Let me know if you’d like adjustments or if you’d prefer a more in-depth newsletter spotlight instead.   ---  LinkedIn Post Draft:  “Never stop learning—there’s always something new you can discover.”  Meet Michael, a Digital Learning Coordinator in North Carolina who embodies the spirit of lifelong learning. His mission? Empowering teachers and students, K-12, by integrating technology in ways that are practical and impactful—from leveraging AI in the classroom to sparking student engagement with tech-centered activities.  Michael’s stance on teaching and learning is refreshingly simple yet powerful: Don’t stop. Learning opportunities are everywhere—whether you’re leading a classroom or sitting in one. His work is all about creating experiences that teachers can quickly apply to their practice, fostering a culture of curiosity and growth.  When he’s not supporting educators, you can find him immersed in his flow activities—cheering on Pittsburgh sports teams, painting, or getting his hands dirty with gardening and landscaping.  What drives your approach to lifelong learning? Drop your thoughts below!  #LifelongLearning #EdTech #DigitalLearning #GrowthMindset #EducationLeadership   ', 'text', '2025-02-21 15:52:12.636794+00', '2025-02-21 15:52:12.636794+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('90e843e0-bb52-402c-86d2-61582c212823', 'f66f1077-2f65-43f4-95bd-cbf9f328b38b', 'Reader''s writing style example 1: Greetings! Thrilled to be part of this grand venture. Could you kindly enlighten me on the subsequent phases of this journey?

Reader''s writing style example 2: Salutations! It is with great excitement that I find myself amidst such esteemed company. Pray tell, what actions am I to undertake henceforth?

Translation to match the reader''s writing style:

Salutations and felicitations! I find myself at the commencement of this illustrious endeavour. Would you be so kind as to guide me through the ensuing stages of this adventure?', 'ai_trick', '2025-02-22 00:15:26.688519+00', '2025-02-22 00:15:26.688519+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('78d04dcc-6607-4317-9204-3f43692d742b', 'ea155ac4-eb3a-4e24-a4be-84f0143f4348', 'Hi Ed Leaders, 

I''m so glad you''re here. We''ve got a lot of important conversations to have. Balancing access with equity, systems that scale, new things becoming possible, and that''s just the beginning. 

Whether you''re a district or regional level leader, or a school movement propagator, or a toolmaker -- we''re all on the same team. Let''s get better together.', 'text', '2025-02-22 00:29:48.060222+00', '2025-02-22 00:29:48.060222+00', NULL, '{"song_link": "https://youtu.be/mqF7RdYfTBY"}', NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('05670337-7a80-4e3c-8893-8c97221da1d8', '6ba21501-22c2-4705-850f-d07844f4dffd', 'Salutations! It is with profound exhilaration that I enter this august pursuit. Could you, with your indulgence, illumine the path that lies ahead in this odyssey?', 'ai_trick', '2025-03-06 15:39:32.741309+00', '2025-03-06 15:39:32.741309+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
	('2765cf8c-12c2-492d-91b9-0d95eeaf4f36', 'f79ffe36-4f02-4ba8-a359-b9bd8963cbd1', 'Heeeeeeyyyy', 'ai_trick', '2025-02-11 19:54:26.132149+00', '2025-02-11 19:54:26.132149+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'deleted', NULL),
	('29f1b8aa-4854-4c75-b2d1-68a5c208f672', '0f7c3788-844d-4c6e-9a7e-2856a7dbc54d', 'does this work?', 'text', '2025-03-06 23:55:26.585137+00', '2025-03-06 23:55:26.585137+00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'active', NULL),
