	('56dfd164-cc3b-4d41-bb7b-5e85c64299d9', '872b5e58-d5b3-4570-92b5-2e5114fe82dd', 'The conversation transcript does not contain any statements that reveal the participants'' teaching stance or educational philosophy. It is a brief exchange about scheduling a meeting. Therefore, there are no relevant quotes to provide.

