	('368633a5-2081-40cb-b369-d993c602671f', 'e16823ac-2fd9-4892-baeb-da75481f9692', '59e9f386-0ecc-4201-99dd-802f7f8e7b33', 'Would Thurs work for you?', '2025-04-22 05:40:01.327029+00', '2025-04-22 05:40:01.327029+00', 'user', NULL),
	('4e56738a-745e-4bb9-9a59-5b73f9013ca3', '3d0c979f-f010-4ea0-b6c4-90f46901b055', '4bb175fe-ebd9-4641-9edc-593037b6152d', 'Hi Tiana! I''m happy to see we''ve been matched. Would you like to find a time to connect?', '2025-04-22 07:23:40.841714+00', '2025-04-22 07:23:40.841714+00', 'user', NULL),
	('b5eafd91-47e2-4c2a-9a7a-a0685bb59f2e', '623cfb70-c697-406a-a58e-2cdbb9945f08', '11e8adeb-72d2-4cb4-ae26-24d4d1e7565a', 'Hi Samuel. I just wanted to reach out to see if you want to collaborate around our work.  No pressure. I am just really trying to see how this system works.', '2025-04-08 21:31:11.908251+00', '2025-04-08 21:31:11.908251+00', 'user', NULL),
	('b82ba36e-89bd-444d-9b3a-a3015fa184fc', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', 'Haha, okay - I can totally see how this is tough for people. Without notifications for when you''ve responded, I totally forget to check in. So sorry. Obviously I missed this window!', '2025-04-09 00:04:40.153426+00', '2025-04-09 00:04:40.153426+00', 'user', NULL),
	('5d727120-54f2-4666-921f-170d070947ab', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', 'Can we try something for Thursday?', '2025-04-09 00:04:51.312278+00', '2025-04-09 00:04:51.312278+00', 'user', NULL),
	('d028eed3-9004-4c61-9de7-8477246637a4', '6eb86849-eab9-4801-a435-9059c41a6106', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Hi Maria, I''m pretty flexible weekdays 7-5 pacific. When''s good for you?', '2025-04-09 17:21:25.712405+00', '2025-04-09 17:21:25.712405+00', 'user', NULL),
	('bc980ede-f078-4493-a1fb-e17f5923a5b5', '6eb86849-eab9-4801-a435-9059c41a6106', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'I''d love to catch up and hear more about what you''ve been doing!', '2025-04-09 17:21:45.58623+00', '2025-04-09 17:21:45.58623+00', 'user', NULL),
	('294a6e50-5d23-4eee-8c48-78e20b32e284', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Yes! That''s been the rub for sure. Supposedly the notifications are working (or will be soon) haha.', '2025-04-09 17:23:01.172649+00', '2025-04-09 17:23:01.172649+00', 'user', NULL),
	('a4f742c9-d5a1-4bdd-8579-5ef22782a798', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '4e8fa647-0aad-4962-a879-826b7edc6dd4', 'Invite sent for Thursday! (Still says Robot even though "Sideby Robot" is the google account first name...weird)', '2025-04-09 17:26:44.356923+00', '2025-04-09 17:26:44.356923+00', 'user', NULL),
	('2913d1ca-a4de-4deb-ae5b-cf41e3ab549d', 'bd369223-cda5-4c61-800e-94a36f61cb1f', '0da1de28-4910-465c-a5f3-0e6d3f975b5e', 'Can we do Thurs afternoon versus morning? The early times kill me a bit haha', '2025-04-09 17:35:40.707493+00', '2025-04-09 17:35:40.707493+00', 'user', NULL),
