	('e2890f04-32b5-4b06-bdcd-554572556ccc', '86f608d8-be4a-47b2-9c8a-b0b3fb52dabb', NULL, 'Michael M.: My stance on learning and teaching, I would say, is to never stop, always continue learning.', 'idea', '2025-02-21 15:28:22.800476+00', '2025-02-21 15:28:22.800476+00', NULL, NULL),
	('b295737a-5b6b-4c0d-9768-c3967bb88c4c', 'f66f1077-2f65-43f4-95bd-cbf9f328b38b', '8bb32e7a-2026-40c6-8057-b513f1f14441', 'Reader''s writing style example 1: Greetings! Thrilled to be part of this grand venture. Could you kindly enlighten me on the subsequent phases of this journey?

