	('ca1ba02a-5257-41ac-94ac-8d88b183e90b', '45a4fa1a-ba74-4b76-b607-072b45ea750b', '138391', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"My name is Tana Bourne, I''m a secondary educator. UMM. Currently, I''m working \",\"startTime\":1746019270,\"endTime\":1746019275},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"with the district to curate professional developments, integrating AI in the classrooms. In the next 90 days, it is my goal to see teachers use AI, and if \",\"startTime\":1746019275,\"endTime\":1746019284},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"I serve, not only to help themselves, but to also support students. In the next \",\"startTime\":1746019284,\"endTime\":1746019289},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"10 years, I hope to start my own instructional coaching. \",\"startTime\":1746019289,\"endTime\":1746019294},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"My stance when it comes to teaching and learning is that everyone deserves to learn. I also believe that. \",\"startTime\":1746019325,\"endTime\":1746019332},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"Teachers are pivotal in making sure that all their students get exactly what they need in their classroom. \",\"startTime\":1746019332,\"endTime\":1746019339},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"Umm as a teacher, I always perfect my try to perfect my practice to give students exactly what they need to be supported in the classroom to meet the goals they need to be successful not only in my class but in the rural Rd. So in my classes \",\"startTime\":1746019341,\"endTime\":1746019352},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"I implement like UMM. \",\"startTime\":1746019352,\"endTime\":1746019355},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"Business Fridays or like what do I call it? I call it sorry, but basically I \",\"startTime\":1746019358,\"endTime\":1746019363},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"have a segment where the students I give like a real life lesson of like there''s a budget. \",\"startTime\":1746019363,\"endTime\":1746019372},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"You have to cook for the whole entire week here. The prices for groceries these \",\"startTime\":1746019374,\"endTime\":1746019379},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"days, shoes for groceries you''re gonna buy to create your meals for the week. \",\"startTime\":1746019379,\"endTime\":1746019383},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"Things like that. So I try to integrate things like that in my everyday curriculum \",\"startTime\":1746019385,\"endTime\":1746019390},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"because that''s what kids really need to learn these days. \",\"startTime\":1746019390,\"endTime\":1746019395},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"That makes me lose the time when it''s watching TV.\",\"startTime\":1746019421,\"endTime\":1746019424},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"I know it''s a really bad hap hobby to have but that''s my hobby. I like watch. \",\"startTime\":1746019424,\"endTime\":1746019429},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"I like been to watching shows, I like watching movies. I can get lost in time \",\"startTime\":1746019429,\"endTime\":1746019434},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"watching watching the show I''m recently I binge watched. \",\"startTime\":1746019434,\"endTime\":1746019438},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"The sequel, $1,000,000. It was. It''s like a, umm, reality TV game show, Uh.\",\"startTime\":1746019443,\"endTime\":1746019451},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"Oh, the secret millionaire or $1,000,000 secret? Yeah, that''s what''s called \",\"startTime\":1746019452,\"endTime\":1746019455},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"$1,000,000 secret. Umm, that was really good. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1746019455,\"endTime\":1746019458},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"There''s only one season so then take me long to get through, maybe like 2 to 3 days. \",\"startTime\":1746019459,\"endTime\":1746019464},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"And I can''t wait for to come out in this season. I''m gonna binge watch that \",\"startTime\":1746019466,\"endTime\":1746019468},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"in like 2 days. \",\"startTime\":1746019468,\"endTime\":1746019470},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"And I''m currently watching Equalizer and Watson. Those are like the new shows \",\"startTime\":1746019472,\"endTime\":1746019477},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"that I''m watching. I also like to rewatch seasons. Recently watched all of Pretty \",\"startTime\":1746019477,\"endTime\":1746019481},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"Little Liars. \",\"startTime\":1746019481,\"endTime\":1746019485},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"Just because it was nostalgic and right now I''m watching $1,000,000 Matchmaker. \",\"startTime\":1746019486,\"endTime\":1746019490},{\"speaker\":\"12003\",\"text\":\"It''s like a fun thing to watch. \",\"startTime\":1746019490,\"endTime\":1746019494}]"', '2025-04-30 17:35:16.247125+00', '2025-04-30 17:35:16.247125+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 187, "created_at": "2025-04-30T17:35:16.228Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('d1e31515-6f63-4cca-aa53-bee5a39969a8', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '137781', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Yeah, my I, I am a teacher of.\",\"startTime\":1742589233,\"endTime\":1742589237},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Mathematics.\",\"startTime\":1742589237,\"endTime\":1742589238},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"And I''m a teacher of video production, and right now I''m teaching storytelling and video production, and that''s kind of fun. \",\"startTime\":1742589238,\"endTime\":1742589245},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"What else should I say about it? Oh, school was awesome today. There''s a rally \",\"startTime\":1742589247,\"endTime\":1742589251},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"and I was in the dance for Dancing Queen with all of my fellow teachers, and then we played basketball. \",\"startTime\":1742589251,\"endTime\":1742589258},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"And man, I was feeling like people who think that school is not something they should send their kids to. \",\"startTime\":1742589258,\"endTime\":1742589266},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"Really surprises me. Like there man, there''s so much fun to be had. People who \",\"startTime\":1742589267,\"endTime\":1742589271},{\"speaker\":\"11955\",\"text\":\"care a lot, like make cool stuff happen for your kids. \",\"startTime\":1742589271,\"endTime\":1742589275}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.012773+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.012773+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 54, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:07.977Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
