as of for some reason really recently. \",\"startTime\":1739896307,\"endTime\":1739896311},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"So I''ve just I''ve just been like playing more playing more basketball. Like \",\"startTime\":1739896311,\"endTime\":1739896315},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, yeah, I''m working on.\",\"startTime\":1739896314,\"endTime\":1739896316},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I notice I I don''t type things correctly all the time or I''m like missing characters on average by about like. \",\"startTime\":1739896315,\"endTime\":1739896323},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"3rd of a centimeter. And so I need to like, I don''t know, adjust like mentally. \",\"startTime\":1739896323,\"endTime\":1739896328},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"How about you?\",\"startTime\":1739896332,\"endTime\":1739896334},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I''m working on bike skills because I grew up riding a bike but then was in New York City, was in places I wasn''t going to ride in the city, did some mountain biking but now I''ve been doing gravel biking so I can bike for like 70 miles. \",\"startTime\":1739896334,\"endTime\":1739896345},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"But the actual technical skills. \",\"startTime\":1739896345,\"endTime\":1739896348},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739896348,\"endTime\":1739896348},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I''m like starting and stopping, just feeling really comfortable jumping a curb, like just while being clipped in. That''s what I need to keep working on. It''s \",\"startTime\":1739896349,\"endTime\":1739896356},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Oh. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739896355,\"endTime\":1739896357},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like I built the endurance, but now just those little. So it''s like, you know, \",\"startTime\":1739896356,\"endTime\":1739896359},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"practicing like leaning down off the bike in the yard, like I''m like playing my bikes in my yard to try to build those skills right now, Well, right now it''s snowy, but. \",\"startTime\":1739896359,\"endTime\":1739896369},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"When it''s not snowing, I''m doing that. Yeah. Yeah. All right.\",\"startTime\":1739896370,\"endTime\":1739896374},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Nice, cool.\",\"startTime\":1739896374,\"endTime\":1739896376},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"How has AI changed your work as an educator or leader of educators so far?\",\"startTime\":1739896376,\"endTime\":1739896381},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"OK so AI has changed my work as an educator in that I now have to.\",\"startTime\":1739896383,\"endTime\":1739896392},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Set an expectation, a different expectation with my students. And I also feel \",\"startTime\":1739896396,\"endTime\":1739896402},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"very compelled to let others know that other educators know how I set expectations and inform and request that like request kind of that information from them. \",\"startTime\":1739896402,\"endTime\":1739896414},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Like, you know, I feel compelled to ask people how they adjust for knowing for that expectation of students using AI in their classroom, in other words. \",\"startTime\":1739896414,\"endTime\":1739896426},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"They know that I know that they''re gonna use AI, right? OK, I''m, I have to say, \",\"startTime\":1739896431,\"endTime\":1739896436},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739896435,\"endTime\":1739896441},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"we we cannot address that. I''m gonna, I, I address it. I set a new expectation. \",\"startTime\":1739896436,\"endTime\":1739896442},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"But that''s the way that looks in my classroom. How does it look with other people? \",\"startTime\":1739896445,\"endTime\":1739896449},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Are they just ignoring it? Am I doing the right thing? And that new dimension \",\"startTime\":1739896449,\"endTime\":1739896453},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"of expectation setting, almost at like a meta level, is how it''s influencing my my work. \",\"startTime\":1739896453,\"endTime\":1739896461},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"And as like a regular educator, and then I guess what I can call myself as such a leader of educators in a way. \",\"startTime\":1739896463,\"endTime\":1739896470},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896469,\"endTime\":1739896469},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think that''s super interesting. That''s similarly I met a, I''m at ASU \",\"startTime\":1739896471,\"endTime\":1739896475},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"How are you?\",\"startTime\":1739896471,\"endTime\":1739896472},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"as a principal coach and then I''m also at Edgewood College, which is a local university, but in there like global Ed leadership development program, so in their masters and doctorate level. \",\"startTime\":1739896475,\"endTime\":1739896488},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And their default is ban AI And I''ve, I''ve allowed to not ban AI, but like I have made a policy and it''s really, and I talk about it openly, but I can tell \",\"startTime\":1739896490,\"endTime\":1739896497},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"A sick.\",\"startTime\":1739896490,\"endTime\":1739896490},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"students are like worry that then they''ll be known for using it if they admit to using it and they''re worried another class because the majority of their \",\"startTime\":1739896497,\"endTime\":1739896505},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"other classes ban it like, And so it''s this tricky thing where I''m like, I know you''re using it because I''m, I use these tools so I can tell what you''re doing here, but you''re using it poorly. I''d rather you just be open and then we can \",\"startTime\":1739896505,\"endTime\":1739896516},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"talk about how. \",\"startTime\":1739896516,\"endTime\":1739896520},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896519,\"endTime\":1739896520},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I can clearly tell you didn''t check these sources. I can clearly tell you didn''t \",\"startTime\":1739896520,\"endTime\":1739896524},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"reread this part. I can clearly tell this isn''t related to your specific context \",\"startTime\":1739896524,\"endTime\":1739896528},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"because you just contradicted yourself and the the only way you do that is if you''re using these tools. So that''s been an interesting one to try to. I also \",\"startTime\":1739896528,\"endTime\":1739896536},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"respect that they''re worried because that could be used against them in an educational hearing where the academic integrity office is not clear on how they like persecute AI infractions and places that it''s not allowed. \",\"startTime\":1739896536,\"endTime\":1739896547},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Because could it be used in other classes? They see they used it in this class \",\"startTime\":1739896548,\"endTime\":1739896551},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Right. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739896549,\"endTime\":1739896551},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like I, I don''t know the answer. So I I can kind of respect when students are \",\"startTime\":1739896551,\"endTime\":1739896554},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like, we''re not sure here so. \",\"startTime\":1739896554,\"endTime\":1739896557},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I''m trying it in my own sphere of influence to say like, this is my college, this is, I think it''s great. I think it pushes all of us to be better. How can \",\"startTime\":1739896558,\"endTime\":1739896564},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896560,\"endTime\":1739896560},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"we use emerging technology? It''s it''s not just AI, it''s everything. So yeah, \",\"startTime\":1739896564,\"endTime\":1739896568},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"it''s definitely thinking similarly. And like, how do we model it for other professors \",\"startTime\":1739896568,\"endTime\":1739896571},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"or work with other professors so that we can work with students as openly as possible? \",\"startTime\":1739896571,\"endTime\":1739896577},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah. Any first, any strong first movers will set a precedent no matter \",\"startTime\":1739896581,\"endTime\":1739896585},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896582,\"endTime\":1739896582},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"what. It''s no longer, it''s not something where you can just run. You can de \",\"startTime\":1739896585,\"endTime\":1739896589},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"facto just run things the way you want and expect others to not really care. \",\"startTime\":1739896589,\"endTime\":1739896594},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I think it''s, it has, there''s such novelty and urgency to relieve ourselves of the confusion surrounding how to use it in the classroom that I think as soon as someone sees it working at one place, I would, I have a strong punch. \",\"startTime\":1739896594,\"endTime\":1739896606},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896601,\"endTime\":1739896601},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I''ll just try to, you know, copy that. \",\"startTime\":1739896606,\"endTime\":1739896610},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and then wanting them to get better. I could like one student.\",\"startTime\":1739896611,\"endTime\":1739896615},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, just the stories of like these quotes don''t exist.\",\"startTime\":1739896616,\"endTime\":1739896619},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896618,\"endTime\":1739896618},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"You know, like, like the idea exists and the quote doesn''t exist. And now you''ve \",\"startTime\":1739896621,\"endTime\":1739896625},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"quoted this and then you''re fighting me on it. And then it was like, oh, realizing \",\"startTime\":1739896625,\"endTime\":1739896629},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"what they''ve done. But I I wasn''t trying to get them expelled. I was just like, \",\"startTime\":1739896629,\"endTime\":1739896633},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896630,\"endTime\":1739896632},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"hey, hey, hey, you don''t want to do this like this. So. So how do we, how do \",\"startTime\":1739896633,\"endTime\":1739896637},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"you actually prompt well enough to be able to get those quotes if you uploaded an article and you''re trying to pull an idea, like, I''d rather us talk about that than just throw the book. Yeah, yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739896637,\"endTime\":1739896648},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739896646,\"endTime\":1739896647},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah, give them good pro my my my solution is giving them better prompts or something but. \",\"startTime\":1739896648,\"endTime\":1739896653},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Alright, you''re ready.\",\"startTime\":1739896654,\"endTime\":1739896656},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Take turns. How do you think AI will change the role of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1739896657,\"endTime\":1739896662},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Umm, the role of learners. OK.\",\"startTime\":1739896664,\"endTime\":1739896665},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"The role, I mean, I actually don''t think it will change the role of learners that much. Umm, I think they will. If if for the the question their role is \",\"startTime\":1739896670,\"endTime\":1739896678},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. MMM. MMM MMM.\",\"startTime\":1739896670,\"endTime\":1739896671},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"that of a learner, then umm. \",\"startTime\":1739896678,\"endTime\":1739896682},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I think they''re like what is a role, right? It''s like a set of things that you \",\"startTime\":1739896685,\"endTime\":1739896688},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"are like assigned to do, like for a period like as well as like set of responsibilities that they have. \",\"startTime\":1739896688,\"endTime\":1739896696},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. MMM, mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739896689,\"endTime\":1739896693},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I think that remains largely the same. It''s the way they it will change the \",\"startTime\":1739896699,\"endTime\":1739896703},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"the way they accomplish their role, but the role itself I think will remain largely fundamentally the same. \",\"startTime\":1739896703,\"endTime\":1739896711},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739896708,\"endTime\":1739896709},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, I think about like.\",\"startTime\":1739896713,\"endTime\":1739896715},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Utilization of tools in ways that fulfills.\",\"startTime\":1739896716,\"endTime\":1739896720},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Where you''re trying to go like role as learner is like and and the one piece that I I. \",\"startTime\":1739896722,\"endTime\":1739896727},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Uh oh, I think I''m breaking up.\",\"startTime\":1739896728,\"endTime\":1739896729},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Oh, I can hear you. Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1739896729,\"endTime\":1739896731},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I can still hear you. Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1739896734,\"endTime\":1739896736},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. Wait. Give me one. I''m going to move. Maybe. I think the wife will \",\"startTime\":1739896740,\"endTime\":1739896743},