 it can do some good as well as like be sustainable and be profitable so that we''re not worried or going through that like layoff, halftime, layoff half time, like I ''cause that. \",\"startTime\":1739897192,\"endTime\":1739897205},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Wellness wise is hard to.\",\"startTime\":1739897205,\"endTime\":1739897207},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"MMM, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739897205,\"endTime\":1739897208},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Justifying.\",\"startTime\":1739897209,\"endTime\":1739897210},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"It''s hard, yeah, but that''s a that''s a very much an economic question. Like \",\"startTime\":1739897211,\"endTime\":1739897215},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"you have to make some decisions, make some sacrifices. Like I need to do this \",\"startTime\":1739897215,\"endTime\":1739897218},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739897216,\"endTime\":1739897217},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"now, that way that doesn''t happen later. And you know, it''s, it''s hard. \",\"startTime\":1739897218,\"endTime\":1739897222},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739897224,\"endTime\":1739897226},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Is there? Yeah. What''s the problem with practice?\",\"startTime\":1739897226,\"endTime\":1739897230},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Challenge 2 is to solve a problem.\",\"startTime\":1739897227,\"endTime\":1739897229},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"What''s a problem of?\",\"startTime\":1739897230,\"endTime\":1739897231},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"That you may be able to help me with.\",\"startTime\":1739897232,\"endTime\":1739897234},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Where''s the?\",\"startTime\":1739897234,\"endTime\":1739897235},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Well, we''re talking about.\",\"startTime\":1739897235,\"endTime\":1739897237},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"The problem with practice, uh, like the practice of teaching.\",\"startTime\":1739897240,\"endTime\":1739897244},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Is there something in? Yeah. Well, and it could be like in the app immediately \",\"startTime\":1739897242,\"endTime\":1739897245},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"knowing that, oh, she''s clunky, but is there something immediately that''s sticking out to you? Especially seeing like you''ve made a bartender matching app, you''ve \",\"startTime\":1739897245,\"endTime\":1739897253},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"made that like thinking about what we''re trying to do and what currently exists, knowing there''s a long list, but is there something jumping out to you right away that you''re like, oh, I, I feel like I would bring this expertise in there. \",\"startTime\":1739897253,\"endTime\":1739897264},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739897260,\"endTime\":1739897260},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Yeah, like design or like fundamental kind of like like human design as much as I don''t know, like I, I. \",\"startTime\":1739897266,\"endTime\":1739897273},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"Umm, but I mean this in like the least literal way. Umm, I''m like moderately \",\"startTime\":1739897277,\"endTime\":1739897281},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"lazy in terms of, in terms of my thought process. Like I don''t like thinking. \",\"startTime\":1739897281,\"endTime\":1739897285},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yep. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739897283,\"endTime\":1739897283},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"I, I reserve my thinking for work. And then like after that, I don''t really \",\"startTime\":1739897285,\"endTime\":1739897289},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"want to think like I, I don''t know, like I gotta, I have to like do math. I \",\"startTime\":1739897289,\"endTime\":1739897293},{\"speaker\":\"11885\",\"text\":\"like the grocery store and figure things out. Like I don''t want to do that. \",\"startTime\":1739897293,\"endTime\":173989729