 and professional learning and I ended up doing a bunch of work across the state and connecting with this super cool teacher out of Seattle, WA and we met with some other people. \",\"startTime\":1745354691,\"endTime\":1745354708},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"To solve her problem because my problem or my work was really about serving people in communities and districts and helping them to problem solve and make it happen and bring professional learning or. \",\"startTime\":1745354710,\"endTime\":1745354720},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The resources to their districts help them do what they want to do, and we ended up using Updua with Mike Mendelsohn because he had been doing. \",\"startTime\":1745354721,\"endTime\":1745354731},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The same work that originally as a teacher and he wanted to bring it back to the classroom because his first ten years of using the tool, this tool was with business like AT&T people. So anyways, I got to play with this with him as an \",\"startTime\":1745354731,\"endTime\":1745354743},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"entrepreneur. \",\"startTime\":1745354743,\"endTime\":1745354747},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"With teachers across Washington state and we saw real growth and we had real impact and ended up doing some cool stuff. And so I''m like. \",\"startTime\":1745354748,\"endTime\":1745354755},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, I want to do this more. So I quit my coordinator job last summer and started \",\"startTime\":1745354755,\"endTime\":1745354759},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"focusing on on this kind of work. And we''ve been figuring out what we want to \",\"startTime\":1745354759,\"endTime\":1745354763},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"do and now finally got funding and moving forward. And we''re still doing contracts \",\"startTime\":1745354763,\"endTime\":1745354767},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and lots of consulting. And I get to be in classrooms a lot and it''s just fun. \",\"startTime\":1745354767,\"endTime\":1745354772},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. It''s like instructional coach, but I get to meet people like you and connect \",\"startTime\":1745354772,\"endTime\":1745354776},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"you with other cool people across the world and. \",\"startTime\":1745354776,\"endTime\":1745354780},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''m just like.\",\"startTime\":1745354783,\"endTime\":1745354784},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So fun, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745354785,\"endTime\":1745354786},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"See, I met Mike through LinkedIn.\",\"startTime\":1745354788,\"endTime\":1745354791},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I went and checked out like side by cause there''s actually some post of his about skiing. I live in a small mountain town. \",\"startTime\":1745354792,\"endTime\":1745354800},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How cool.\",\"startTime\":1745354801,\"endTime\":1745354802},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"In Colorado, so.\",\"startTime\":1745354801,\"endTime\":1745354804},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh really? Where at?\",\"startTime\":1745354803,\"endTime\":1745354804},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Pagosa Springs.\",\"startTime\":1745354805,\"endTime\":1745354807},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So right by Wolf Creek, just in the southwest corner of the state.\",\"startTime\":1745354808,\"endTime\":1745354812},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Nice. Oh, I love it. I love it. That''s so cool.\",\"startTime\":1745354812,\"endTime\":1745354816},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Umm.\",\"startTime\":1745354817,\"endTime\":1745354817},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"What kind of skis do you have? Just going to geek out with you ''cause like I''m, \",\"startTime\":1745354817,\"endTime\":1745354820},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I''m a fellow skier with Mike. \",\"startTime\":1745354820,\"endTime\":1745354822},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I want