ears. \",\"startTime\":1744725171,\"endTime\":1744725178},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Maybe even the student is within the next couple of years. Umm, and that''s the \",\"startTime\":1744725178,\"endTime\":1744725183},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"kind of world we have to be sort of planning for is like the post kind of post like knowledge work world. What does it mean when? \",\"startTime\":1744725183,\"endTime\":1744725192},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Intelligence is abundant and accessible and.\",\"startTime\":1744725194,\"endTime\":1744725198},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"You know, a lot of the, you know, traditional knowledge work jobs that we''ve had. \",\"startTime\":1744725199,\"endTime\":1744725202},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Are are no longer the norm and I think, umm, understanding how we can use AI to augment our capabilities as humans, I think is really an important part for us to impart on our learners, even in in high school, like they''re they''re gonna see that too. It says we don''t start at kindergarten necessarily right away, \",\"startTime\":1744725203,\"endTime\":1744725220},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"but we need to start thinking about people who are entering the workforce now. \",\"startTime\":1744725220,\"endTime\":1744725224},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So that''s my that''s. \",\"startTime\":1744725224,\"endTime\":1744725228},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Tell me more about the role like like with all of those things like with the API and I I love your your. \",\"startTime\":1744725228,\"endTime\":1744725234},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Real clear words around augmenting who we are.\",\"startTime\":1744725236,\"endTime\":1744725239},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So what role would the learner have in your in your vision of the future then? \",\"startTime\":1744725240,\"endTime\":1744725246},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1744725258,\"endTime\":1744725259},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725295,\"endTime\":1744725295},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think we do a really terrible job of fostering sort of like creativity and dreaming and play in our schools, and I think those are really, really important. \",\"startTime\":1744725307,\"endTime\":1744725307},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Your characteristics or skills that we, we need to like, uh, sort of repatriate for lack of better word and and sort of center education around, I think. \",\"startTime\":1744725307,\"endTime\":1744725308},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, we need learners to adopt the role of problem seeker. Umm, find problems \",\"startTime\":1744725308,\"endTime\":1744725313},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"in your life, in your community, in your world, and use these tools to solve those problems. Dream up new things that don''t exist. \",\"startTime\":1744725313,\"endTime\":1744725320},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And, and not just dream them up, but I think, you know, we, we, we''re going to AI is, is, is rapidly changing our digital world. It''s, I don''t think long \",\"startTime\":1744725320,\"endTime\":1744725329},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"In in terms of the role of the learner, umm, it''s it''s like solving problems both in the digital and physical world, but also then dreaming up new things. \",\"startTime\":1744725321,\"endTime\":1744725329},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"You know, I think and and sort of learning to play with these technologies in a way that. \",\"startTime\":1744725324,\"endTime\":1744725328},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"You know you can. You can build anything bespoke for yourself, like personal \",\"startTime\":1744725325,\"endTime\":1744725328},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Etsy store. \",\"startTime\":1744725328,\"endTime\":1744725329},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"before we can start manifesting those ideas in, in the physical world either through 3D printing and robotics and that kind of stuff. So. \",\"startTime\":1744725329,\"endTime\":1744725339},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh I''m totally with you, I love that focus on dreaming. Umm, we should do some \",\"startTime\":1744725332,\"endTime\":1744725336},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"dream dream camps. Uh, I''m all for doing a dream camp. I got to do one last \",\"startTime\":1744725336,\"endTime\":1744725340},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"year in 2020. \",\"startTime\":1744725340,\"endTime\":1744725344},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What is it? Yeah, 2024. It was last spring, last March.\",\"startTime\":1744725345,\"endTime\":1744725348},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It was amazing and got some grant funding to do that, but it was exactly like what you''re saying. \",\"startTime\":1744725349,\"endTime\":1744725354},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I didn''t know how important that was, but I''ll say the same thing. We have \",\"startTime\":1744725354,\"endTime\":1744725360},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725357,\"endTime\":1744725361},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to become dreamers to think more about what''s impossible. And I think also our \",\"startTime\":1744725360,\"endTime\":1744725365},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"role has to change to project managers, like you said. \",\"startTime\":1744725365,\"endTime\":1744725370},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725366,\"endTime\":1744725367},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Because there''s so much to do that we''re inundated with it. I think we have \",\"startTime\":1744725371,\"endTime\":1744725375},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725374,\"endTime\":1744725374},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"to really become more managers of our own learning and with the AI assistance, the API tools, all these different things that we will be getting and students have today or learners. I''m a learner too. \",\"startTime\":1744725375,\"endTime\":1744725387},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"MMM MMM.\",\"startTime\":1744725382,\"endTime\":1744725388},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What we have today as learners, those things, we, we have so many of them. What''s \",\"startTime\":1744725387,\"endTime\":1744725391},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that? What''s the, the path that we''re gonna do? \",\"startTime\":1744725391,\"endTime\":1744725395},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I want, I need to spend time with my 2 year old. I need to spend time with my \",\"startTime\":1744725397,\"endTime\":1744725401},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1744725401,\"endTime\":1744725403},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"own self. Jeff, you need to sleep. Jeff, you need to do this, this and this. \",\"startTime\":1744725401,\"endTime\":1744725405},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So I think that role of being a manager of our own learning because I might not be able to dream my cool Etsy store like you were saying. \",\"startTime\":1744725405,\"endTime\":1744725413},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But I might be needing to now manage even my dreams and my my time about my dreams. \",\"startTime\":1744725414,\"endTime\":1744725420},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And how many of those dreams are going to be able to pursue Jeff? What''s realistic? \",\"startTime\":1744725421,\"endTime\":1744725424},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What''s worth your time to do that all? \",\"startTime\":1744725424,\"endTime\":1744725428},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744725424,\"endTime\":1744725425},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"All of those kind of things, much like I would say we''ve seen today in the last decade, the management, a learner or a user of technology. \",\"startTime\":1744725428,\"endTime\":1744725438},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Right. MMM.\",\"startTime\":1744725429,\"endTime\":1744725432},