o it''s it''s like you''re creating.\",\"startTime\":1741902940,\"endTime\":1741902945},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"An AI bot that''s specific for your directions around things like my wife and I, I created a. \",\"startTime\":1741902946,\"endTime\":1741902955},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wanda the Wanderlust GPT ChatGPT to help us to do our adventures for travel. \",\"startTime\":1741902956,\"endTime\":1741902961},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"We put it in our things like what the things that we like to do and what we want to do, and then it helps us to search and figure out travel plans. \",\"startTime\":1741902961,\"endTime\":1741902970},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Cortana, you can like say like, oh, I wanna, I wanna travel in April and I wanna go somewhere warm and not fly more than 12 hours. \",\"startTime\":1741902970,\"endTime\":1741902979},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But I noticed.\",\"startTime\":1741902971,\"endTime\":1741902972},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yep, that even better than that. It just knows already the different kind of \",\"startTime\":1741902979,\"endTime\":1741902982},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"things like what we might want to do. So it refines already. And I know that \",\"startTime\":1741902982,\"endTime\":1741902986},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"in creating the space, I haven''t played enough in here to be like, I''m like level 2 out of four. Like not this noob, but I played around and I see I have \",\"startTime\":1741902986,\"endTime\":1741902994},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a number of spaces, but you can give a description of it and then even specific instructions around it. So like it''s much like if you''ve ever created any AI \",\"startTime\":1741902994,\"endTime\":1741903001},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"assistance in ChatGPT. \",\"startTime\":1741903001,\"endTime\":1741903004},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Much like that for what I''ve seen, but you can also pick whic