\",\"text\":\"Yeah, making it better. Well, I know it was the 80s. Yeah. I mean, who could \",\"startTime\":1741903184,\"endTime\":1741903189},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Yeah, she''s never better, but.\",\"startTime\":1741903184,\"endTime\":1741903187},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"make the A-Team any better than the original A-Team, I mean. \",\"startTime\":1741903189,\"endTime\":1741903193},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I guess that was the TV show. Hey, thanks, Jeff. I appreciate the time. And \",\"startTime\":1741903197,\"endTime\":1741903201},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"just for FYI, in the back end, when you go to your Myspace, not Myspace, that''s an old one, you go to my sidebuy dot AI, your dashboard in there where we were chatting. I will be putting some artifacts in there for you soon and you can \",\"startTime\":1741903201,\"endTime\":1741903215},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"post and I''ll match you up with somebody else so that you can have another conversation like this in Abdul. And as the cadence goes, you can set your availability. \",\"startTime\":1741903215,\"endTime\":1741903224},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So you can go in there and you can change your availability as things go. We''ll \",\"startTime\":1741903225,\"endTime\":1741903229},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"hopefully automate that process and connect you or right now by manual, I''ll go through and and see who has time and space. And if it''s a Thursday afternoon \",\"startTime\":1741903229,\"endTime\":1741903236},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"at this time that you want in your regular cadence, then we''ll try to match you up with people who are like minded or trying to move forward in similar passions and similar fashions. So that works for you. And then and then the \",\"startTime\":1741903236,\"endTime\":1741903246},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"next part is getting matched will match you and then get that calendar invite like today. \",\"s