\",\"text\":\"If we are building a house and we don''t.\",\"startTime\":1745273189,\"endTime\":1745273192},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Put a good foundation in and we only get 70% of that foundation created and then we try to build on top of that house. Maybe a brick wall is a better example. \",\"startTime\":1745273194,\"endTime\":1745273204},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"You, you do layer by layer, brick walls, brick walls, brick walls. If you don''t \",\"startTime\":1745273204,\"endTime\":1745273209},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"have every brick on the bottom layer, then as you go up the, the wall becomes less and less complete. But if you can guarantee that every single student has \",\"startTime\":1745273209,\"endTime\":1745273219},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"the, the base layer of blocks and then you start building on top of that. \",\"startTime\":1745273219,\"endTime\":1745273223},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Basically layer until the second layer is done, then all kids will get access to all the learning. And then the kids who have their layer of blocks, they \",\"startTime\":1745273226,\"endTime\":1745273234},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"can start building on top of that in areas that are they''re interested in. So \",\"startTime\":1745273234,\"endTime\":1745273238},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"they kind of like, I don''t know if that made sense at all. \",\"startTime\":1745273238,\"endTime\":1745273243},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, yeah, yeah, it totally does. Totally does. Yeah. Oh, that''s way cool.\",\"startTime\":1745273245,\"endTime\":1745273251},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"And what about you? Well, how, what, what, what''s the thing that you do great \",\"startTime\":1745273249,\"endTime\":1745273255},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"that you want to share with all of the people who you work with? \",\"startTime\":1745273255,\"endTime\":1745273261},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think one of the things th