o show them all in front of the class and whoever has the best poster or will vote on it. \",\"startTime\":1745273865,\"endTime\":1745273884},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"So thanks for that.\",\"startTime\":1745273866,\"endTime\":1745273866},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"They they did such an awesome job. I didn''t even really have to do my lesson \",\"startTime\":1745273887,\"endTime\":1745273891},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"because all the kids went and found all the stuff that I was going to teach and they all were paying attention to the posters because they wanted to vote on one of them And the kids got like 50 crypto for it and it was totally worth it. So it it worked good that the competition and and just. \",\"startTime\":1745273891,\"endTime\":1745273907},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"The passive learning is really, really fun.\",\"startTime\":1745273910,\"endTime\":1745273912},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. That''s super cool. Way to position them as capable. Rob, I''m \",\"startTime\":1745273913,\"endTime\":1745273917},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"going to try to connect you with a lady who''s just hopped on even today. She''s \",\"startTime\":1745273917,\"endTime\":1745273921},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"a teacher over in Baltimore. I think you 2 would be awesome for conversation. \",\"startTime\":1745273921,\"endTime\":1745273925},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"She''s working on supporting AI for teachers in her district and a bunch of other cool stuff. And she''s passionate and getting after it, So I''m going to connect \",\"startTime\":1745273925,\"endTime\":1745273933},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you with her. So yeah, you look on your dashboard. That should be coming soon. \",\"startTime\":1745273933,\"endTime\":1745273937},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"S s Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745273935,\"endTime\":1745273939},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, man. \",\"startTime\":1745273937,\"endTime\":1745273941},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Sounds good.\",\"startTime\":1745273939,\"endTime\":1745273940},{\"speaker\":\"8163\",\"text\":\"Perfect. Hey, good to see you. Take care, man.\",\"startTime\":1745273941,\"endTime\":1745273942},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You too. See you, Rob. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1745273943,\"endTime\":1745273945}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.754982+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.754982+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1684, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.728Z", "session_title": "#learning_to_human", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "33", "name": "#learning_to_human", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "Inclusion"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('bbc836f5-8e6a-4d2a-bfb9-d85adea86a07', 'bd47a56c-b275-4972-987f-30b0cd993f17', '137152', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Hi, Tom Thorpe, I am the Director.\",\"startTime\":1739981721,\"endTime\":1739981723},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Co founder.\",\"startTime\":1739981723,\"endTime\":1739981724},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Lead faculty of the Reading Lab in Denver, Co.\",\"startTime\":1739981725,\"endTime\":1739981728},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I teach humans.\",\"startTime\":1739981729,\"endTime\":1739981730},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That''s what I do. Teach humans. Taught them English or taught them history.\",\"startTime\":1739981731,\"endTime\":1739981734},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And I teach them how to think.\",\"startTime\":1739981736,\"endTime\":1739981738},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"About the world around them, how to make sense of it, how to identify what stories they want to tell, what stories they''re told. \",\"startTime\":1739981739,\"endTime\":1739981745},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That''s, uh, that''s me and we do it at an Independent School, but we also do it in a community with as many. \",\"startTime\":1739981748,\"endTime\":1739981754},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Folks as are free and able to join us.\",\"startTime\":1739981754,\"endTime\":1739981757},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Dance when it.\",\"startTime\":1739981827,\"endTime\":1739981828},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"To teaching and learning is pretty simple educators and students.\",\"startTime\":1739981828,\"endTime\":1739981833},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Need to live side by one another.\",\"startTime\":1739981835,\"endTime\":1739981837},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Alongside each other, the the original sort of understanding of.\",\"startTime\":1739981837,\"endTime\":1739981840},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know what assessments were to to name one thing is.\",\"startTime\":1739981840,\"endTime\":1739981843},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, teachers sitting alongside learners or educators and and learners sitting alongside one another. \",\"startTime\":1739981845,\"endTime\":1739981850},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm coupled with this is when teachers tell students stories what hap which happens incredibly umm. \",\"startTime\":1739981851,\"endTime\":1739981858},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know, at an incredibly high rate, way too often. This needs to stop. Let \",\"startTime\":1739981860,\"endTime\":1739981864},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"students tell their stories. Let them identify a little bit more about. \",\"startTime\":1739981864,\"endTime\":1739981868},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What they know, what they want to know, what they want to bring to the endeavor. \",\"startTime\":1739981868,\"endTime\":1739981872},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So yeah, it''s, it''s, it''s pretty simple. Teachers, educators and students sitting \",\"startTime\":1739981873,\"endTime\":1739981877},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"alongside one another. Educators, stop telling students stories. \",\"startTime\":1739981877,\"endTime\":1739981881},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Is love cooking? Love cooking for people. I love serving, being in service kind \",\"startTime\":1739981912,\"endTime\":1739981917},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"of for other people, especially when it comes to food and gathering. \",\"startTime\":1739981917,\"endTime\":1739981921},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Love walking?\",\"startTime\":1739981922,\"endTime\":1739981923},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Being both out like in a neighborhood or out in the woods walking and seeing nature. Biking is, is a piece of that too, but kind of like being out and, and \",\"startTime\":1739981926,\"endTime\":1739981934},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"noticing and and listening and, and hearing what''s going on. \",\"startTime\":1739981934,\"endTime\":1739981939},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, those are, those are it.\",\"startTime\":1739981941,\"endTime\":1739981943},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Also anything that has to do with like reading movies, stories.\",\"startTime\":1739981944,\"endTime\":1739981947},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Love collecting stories?\",\"startTime\":1739981947,\"endTime\":1739981949},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That''s my flow.\",\"startTime\":1739981950,\"endTime\":1739981951}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.880048+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.880048+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 147, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.855Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('48f1439c-5953-4d87-9300-58d70db5aa4e', '44d8b840-888f-4849-9111-b52ada8f4599', '137349', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Happy Friday, good to see you.\",\"startTime\":1740787535,\"endTime\":1740787537},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You too. How are things?\",\"startTime\":1740787535,\"endTime\":1740787537},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Oh my gosh, it''s actually been such a busy week for me. I''ve had so many IEP \",\"startTime\":1740787537,\"endTime\":1740787539},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"meetings and follow up work, but I''m so glad it''s sunny out and it''s Friday again. \",\"startTime\":1740787539,\"endTime\":1740787545},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I am so glad it''s sunny. There''s a little bit of.\",\"startTime\":1740787545,\"endTime\":1740787548},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wispy clouds getting in the way, but it''s been wonderful today, and it''s Friday. \",\"startTime\":1740787549,\"endTime\":1740787554},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. No, not a bit. And nice job making it through the week. It''s been \",\"startTime\":1740787555,\"endTime\":1740787558},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, can''t be upset when it''s Friday.\",\"startTime\":1740787555,\"endTime\":1740787558},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"just crazy. I don''t know what the deal is. We''re all back. January got us awake \",\"startTime\":1740787558,\"endTime\":1740787561},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and then February we''re like, we have to do all the things. I don''t know what, \",\"startTime\":1740787561,\"endTime\":1740787565},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"but it feels like that. \",\"startTime\":1740787565,\"endTime\":1740787568},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"We''re feeling the same thing over here, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787569,\"endTime\":1740787571},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. OK, I''m going to press more and see what this has got. This is your \",\"startTime\":1740787572,\"endTime\":1740787575},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"first, by the way. Welcome to your first one-on-one. This is the magic where \",\"startTime\":1740787575,\"endTime\":1740787579},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it happens, where we hopefully get you in the cadence and matched up with people so that whatever time works for you, you just go, yeah, this works for me this week and you can get regular time with other peeps, so. \",\"startTime\":1740787579,\"endTime\":1740787589},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Beautiful. Yeah, Yeah. Thanks for having me for my first one.\",\"startTime\":1740787590,\"endTime\":1740787593},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no worries.\",\"startTime\":1740787593,\"endTime\":1740787594},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"What''s the skill I hit? I hit the more here. What''s a skill besides AI fluency \",\"startTime\":1740787595,\"endTime\":1740787599},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that you''re working to improve? \",\"startTime\":1740787599,\"endTime\":1740787602},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I think one of the skills that I''m working on as it relates to AI is automation. \",\"startTime\":1740787603,\"endTime\":1740787607},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So really learning to automate some of the processes like sending emails or turning content into different kinds of contact like PDFs into scripture or videos or PowerPoints. So I''m working on my. \",\"startTime\":1740787607,\"endTime\":1740787620},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Automation piece of AI.\",\"startTime\":1740787621,\"endTime\":1740787623},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1740787624,\"endTime\":1740787625},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s funny. 01 That''s really interesting. I''ve got questions about that.\",\"startTime\":1740787625,\"endTime\":1740787630},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787626,\"endTime\":1740787627},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"What tools are you using to help you with your automation? That''s my first question. \",\"startTime\":1740787630,\"endTime\":1740787635},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"One of the tools that I really like right now is called Text Blaze and I learned it at our conference that we recently went to. That has really saved me so much \",\"startTime\":1740787635,\"endTime\":1740787643},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"time and felt like I''m like cheating my way through my task because it''s so quick at inputting lines that I''ve already given it specifically for my Ieps and scheduling needs. \",\"startTime\":1740787643,\"endTime\":1740787655},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787647,\"endTime\":1740787648},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So in this text, Blaze TEXTBLAZE, Yeah, I remember you telling me about that and then I wrote it on some note, but I couldn''t find it. Like, what was that \",\"startTime\":1740787656,\"endTime\":1740787664},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yes, Texbay is one word.\",\"startTime\":1740787660,\"endTime\":1740787662},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"thing? So thank you for telling me again. And that''s again, like it''s like a \",\"startTime\":1740787664,\"endTime\":1740787668},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"macro, like you press a keystroke and then it does an an action. That''s so cool. \",\"startTime\":1740787668,\"endTime\":1740787672},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s really cool. \",\"startTime\":1740787672,\"endTime\":1740787675},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s like a keyboard shortcut for, umm, lengthy text or certain things you send all the time through words. \",\"startTime\":1740787676,\"endTime\":1740787684},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wait, wait. Sweet. That''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1740787684,\"endTime\":1740787686},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah. What is something, what is the skill besides a fluency that you''re working \",\"startTime\":1740787686,\"endTime\":1740787688},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"on to improve right now? \",\"startTime\":1740787688,\"endTime\":1740787690},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Now it''s funny, you went with AI stuff and I went to human things. I was like, \",\"startTime\":1740787691,\"endTime\":1740787697},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m trying to focus and not have so many things on my mind or my plate. \",\"startTime\":1740787697,\"endTime\":1740787702},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Which means saying no to more things and and being present.\",\"startTime\":1740787703,\"endTime\":1740787707},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And so that''s a skill that I was thinking with, which is nothing to do with AI, but it helps me to be better at using AI. And I think it does have a huge \",\"startTime\":1740787707,\"endTime\":1740787715},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"relevancy to my use with AI because. \",\"startTime\":1740787715,\"endTime\":1740787718},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Text please ChatGPT.\",\"startTime\":1740787720,\"endTime\":1740787722},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"There''s like 20 different things I could just list out that are on my oh, I should probably look at that. I should look at that. I should look at that. \",\"startTime\":1740787724,\"endTime\":1740787732},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And from my last chat I had with somebody, they said keep it limit at 5, Jeff, like just work on five things. As a matter of fact, it was Eric out of London. \",\"startTime\":1740787732,\"endTime\":1740787740},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah, OK.\",\"startTime\":1740787740,\"endTime\":1740787744},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"He does a lot of tech stuff. I love to see you 2 get connected. \",\"startTime\":1740787740,\"endTime\":1740787744},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But he''s using AI and he says, Jeff, uh, I''m trying to keep it. Maybe you could \",\"startTime\":1740787744,\"endTime\":1740787747},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"keep it at 5 tools that you''re trying to get good at that work for your thing, like textplays. So, umm. \",\"startTime\":1740787747,\"endTime\":1740787753},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787753,\"endTime\":1740787753},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I guess that''s the skill I''m trying to do. Long roundabout story, OK.\",\"startTime\":1740787754,\"endTime\":1740787757},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"So what I heard you say is say no to some things.\",\"startTime\":1740787757,\"endTime\":1740787760},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Umm and focusing.\",\"startTime\":1740787761,\"endTime\":1740787763},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right. OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787764,\"endTime\":1740787766},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. Skill that Jeff needs, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787765,\"endTime\":1740787768},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Me too.\",\"startTime\":1740787768,\"endTime\":1740787769},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. OK. I found this out. When you press next, mine says partner ready. And \",\"startTime\":1740787768,\"endTime\":1740787773},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"if you press, if I press next before you then it will say partner ready on yours. \",\"startTime\":1740787773,\"endTime\":1740787778},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And somebody showed me the other day that you can click back and we can go back. \",\"startTime\":1740787778,\"endTime\":1740787782},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"If you''re like, oh, what did it say in there more? We didn''t even look at that \",\"startTime\":1740787783,\"endTime\":1740787786},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"or did we answer? We can hit back like I''ll do it right now just for fun. \",\"startTime\":1740787786,\"endTime\":1740787789},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then it will say waiting for partner. So if we were going forward, it looks \",\"startTime\":1740787790,\"endTime\":1740787795},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740787791,\"endTime\":1740787792},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"like almost the same. But the arrow, I think it helps us. So. All right. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740787795,\"endTime\":1740787799},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Good to know.\",\"startTime\":1740787799,\"endTime\":1740787800},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh oh.\",\"startTime\":1740787802,\"endTime\":1740787803},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"It says OK.\",\"startTime\":1740787803,\"endTime\":1740787804},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"How has AI changed your work as an educator or leader of educators so far?\",\"startTime\":1740787804,\"endTime\":1740787810},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hmm ''cause mine says share, so does yours say ask? I''m just curious. Oh cool. \",\"startTime\":1740787813,\"endTime\":1740787819},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, mine says Ask Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1740787818,\"endTime\":1740787819},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Nice, how has AI changed my work as an educator?\",\"startTime\":1740787820,\"endTime\":1740787826},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"One, I think I''ve had assistance now like in particular last year in a couple weeks we we did, it was March 13th, 14th Pi Day for those mathletes. We did \",\"startTime\":1740787826,\"endTime\":1740787837},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a dream camp and I was part of the team and actually end up writing it. \",\"startTime\":1740787837,\"endTime\":1740787843},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Uh, ''cause my partner, she got off the team and so I end up being in the lead. \",\"startTime\":1740787844,\"endTime\":1740787849},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Oh wow, nice.\",\"startTime\":1740787849,\"endTime\":1740787851},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m like, I have to write the grant. So I''m writing a grant, but I had notes, \",\"startTime\":1740787849,\"endTime\":1740787853},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"so we had ideas that were already taking. So I created a ChatGPT out of notes \",\"startTime\":1740787853,\"endTime\":1740787857},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and I used another ChatGPT to help. \",\"startTime\":1740787857,\"endTime\":1740787861},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That accumulate our ideas and write through things like, OK, I think this is the grant and I had all of the stuff that notes with Tammy and other people that we had talked about and in particular her ideas and my ideas. \",\"startTime\":1740787862,\"endTime\":1740787875},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But then I built a a GPT assistant called Dreamcamp Helper and the first thing I did is I put in there all of the specifics about what the grant said for the grant page and application. It was really easy too. You just copied and pasted \",\"startTime\":1740787875,\"endTime\":1740787886},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it all in and then or put it in APDF and uploaded it to the knowledge base and then. \",\"startTime\":1740787886,\"endTime\":1740787893},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Took things like Tammy''s ideas and put that in and my ideas and put it in as part of the knowledge base and then put our guiding principles in in the, I call it the the key educational frameworks. \",\"startTime\":1740787894,\"endTime\":1740787905},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, your framework.\",\"startTime\":1740787906,\"endTime\":1740787907},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"There''s four of them, yeah, yeah. So those frameworks like UDL and what are \",\"startTime\":1740787907,\"endTime\":1740787910},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"the effective and equitable teaching practices and. \",\"startTime\":1740787910,\"endTime\":1740787913},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I''m like, OK, so the AI assistant then helped me and I said, let''s write the grant. What could we do? And so let''s write for the grant. And so I used \",\"startTime\":1740787914,\"endTime\":1740787922},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1740787917,\"endTime\":1740787917},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it specifically to help me write the language. \",\"startTime\":1740787922,\"endTime\":1740787927},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"From what we had for our language and then once I''ve finished that and we read through it and I got the OK and we''re good and we sent it off, then we got our approval then the way that we had that, well, this was last year, a year ago. \",\"startTime\":1740787927,\"endTime\":1740787941},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Congrats.\",\"startTime\":1740787937,\"endTime\":1740787938},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"We we pulled it off. So it was 2N''s or October''s ago, I guess. \",\"startTime\":1740787941,\"endTime\":1740787945},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And when we did that, when we got the approval back.\",\"startTime\":1740787945,\"endTime\":1740787949},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"They even send you back your approval package. It says this is what we approved \",\"startTime\":1740787950,\"endTime\":1740787954},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"with all of their language. So then I took those stocks and updated the knowledge \",\"startTime\":1740787954,\"endTime\":1740787958},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"base of the AI assistant, Dreamcamp Helper, got an upgrade. And then I started \",\"startTime\":1740787958,\"endTime\":1740787962},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"using it for all the different things like project management. Like what kind \",\"startTime\":1740787962,\"endTime\":1740787967},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of areas should we have for project management so I can track and have somebody like a Brittany be in charge of marketing or film development or a group like Mike''s group at Upduo. We should do a contract with them and then. \",\"startTime\":1740787967,\"endTime\":1740787979},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"The specifications.\",\"startTime\":1740787980,\"endTime\":1740787981},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And it was really great to have an assistant help me to talk through the things. \",\"startTime\":1740787981,\"endTime\":1740787985},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then as soon as I had what I called, I guess it''s an artifact. \",\"startTime\":1740787985,\"endTime\":1740787989},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Maybe you would know the word like when you bring together something and you have synthesis and you have a piece of of well, yeah. So once I decided on this \",\"startTime\":1740787990,\"endTime\":1740787999},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740787990,\"endTime\":1740787992},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"An artifact works well here.\",\"startTime\":1740787996,\"endTime\":1740787997},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"is our project management or we got the the grant language back that it was approved. Whenever I got to a place where it was together and finalized, I could \",\"startTime\":1740787999,\"endTime\":1740788008},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"take that document and put it into the assistant and it''s knowledge base updated. \",\"startTime\":1740788008,\"endTime\":1740788013},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So then every time I talk to about what we''re doing, it knew that project management. \",\"startTime\":1740788013,\"endTime\":1740788017},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Into detail ''cause I had put it into like a a Google doc like 18 pages long or a spreadsheet with all of the language which each role was supposed to be and what it was gonna do for tasks. \",\"startTime\":1740788019,\"endTime\":1740788029},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Then I didn''t have to remember where it was all going and it was just like.\",\"startTime\":1740788029,\"endTime\":1740788032},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It is compacting and getting, it''s like growing and growing. And it was so cool \",\"startTime\":1740788034,\"endTime\":1740788038},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s so phenomenal.\",\"startTime\":1740788038,\"endTime\":1740788041},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"that yeah, that was something that''s totally revolutionized my work because it kept record of it. And then was my assistant and remember the stuff that \",\"startTime\":1740788038,\"endTime\":1740788046},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788043,\"endTime\":1740788043},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"we said or I could ask it later, like intentionally I put in there just educators, 20 educators could join, but it didn''t say anything about our our region. But \",\"startTime\":1740788046,\"endTime\":1740788054},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"they had to be out of the region even though I knew the grant. \",\"startTime\":1740788054,\"endTime\":1740788059},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Foundation wanted it out of our region.\",\"startTime\":1740788061,\"endTime\":1740788063},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I was like, I''m not gonna say that yet. Umm. So we had flexibility later and \",\"startTime\":1740788064,\"endTime\":1740788068},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"so, but I could ask the, the the chat bot, what did we decide ''cause it was already in the language. OK, I babbled way too much. Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740788068,\"endTime\":1740788077},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"That''s not phenomenal. No, that''s really phenomenal.\",\"startTime\":1740788074,\"endTime\":1740788077},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"And thank you for sharing that. I love how it became such a like, like you could \",\"startTime\":1740788077,\"endTime\":1740788080},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"have paid someone to do that or even multiple people do that. And the fact that \",\"startTime\":1740788080,\"endTime\":1740788083},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"we can do it now, we''ll do some programming and AI. \",\"startTime\":1740788083,\"endTime\":1740788086},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788088,\"endTime\":1740788089},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, exactly right. All right. Umm