to just ask it all the questions that I wasn''t able to ask my mentor who wasn''t even on site at the time or even I didn''t have any other special Ed teachers in my building. So \",\"startTime\":1740788141,\"endTime\":1740788153},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"it really became like my partner in my growth and my development. And I just \",\"startTime\":1740788153,\"endTime\":1740788156},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"really like how I''m able to do things a lot quicker and I''m able to reach far more than my students, but also help my community a lot easier too. \",\"startTime\":1740788156,\"endTime\":1740788164},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Awesome way to go.\",\"startTime\":1740788165,\"endTime\":1740788167},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thanks.\",\"startTime\":1740788167,\"endTime\":1740788168},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"There it goes. OK, next one I beat you to it.\",\"startTime\":1740788169,\"endTime\":1740788171},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, you beat me ''cause mine''s a partner maybe, Dang it.\",\"startTime\":1740788171,\"endTime\":1740788173},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Take turns chatting with Brittany. How do you think AI will change the the role \",\"startTime\":1740788175,\"endTime\":1740788178},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1740788178,\"endTime\":1740788181},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I think learners still have the same job. I do think that there are like really \",\"startTime\":1740788188,\"endTime\":1740788193},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"two big views here. I do think it can be very beneficial in curating individualized \",\"startTime\":1740788193,\"endTime\":1740788199},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"assessments and activities for students to help them grow and it''s really great data collection as well. I do know that there is some research that is showing \",\"startTime\":1740788199,\"endTime\":1740788211},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"that i