get her this time, but no. OK, read the \",\"startTime\":1740788522,\"endTime\":1740788525},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"challenges under more and choose one. Take turns with Brittany and look for \",\"startTime\":1740788525,\"endTime\":1740788528},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"common threads. \",\"startTime\":1740788528,\"endTime\":1740788531},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Share your story. We''re all here for different reasons. In your own word, what''s \",\"startTime\":1740788534,\"endTime\":1740788536},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"yours? \",\"startTime\":1740788536,\"endTime\":1740788538},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Resolve a problem. What''s the problem of practice that Brittany may be able \",\"startTime\":1740788539,\"endTime\":1740788542},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to help you with? Think together and share wisdom, experience. \",\"startTime\":1740788542,\"endTime\":1740788545},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I kind of like challenge one.\",\"startTime\":1740788544,\"endTime\":1740788546},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, go for it. Share your story.\",\"startTime\":1740788548,\"endTime\":1740788550},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK, so why I''m here?\",\"startTime\":1740788551,\"endTime\":1740788553},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK so I''m currently in my classroom. It''s Friday and my fourth year of teaching \",\"startTime\":1740788555,\"endTime\":1740788559},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"and I''m currently here. I''m. I''m gratefully here because this is my dream job. \",\"startTime\":1740788559,\"endTime\":1740788563},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1740788560,\"endTime\":1740788561},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I have been dreaming about this job since I was 15 in high school. So it''s almost \",\"startTime\":1740788563,\"endTime\":1740788567},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"been 10 years and. \",\"startTime\":1740788567,\"endTime\":1740788571},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I just love what I do and I''m really grateful to be here today. I''m healthy, \",\"startTime\":1740788573,\"endTime\":1740788577},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I''m able to get to work because I''m under a good contract. And I''m really here \",\"startTime\":1740788577,\"endTime\":1740788581},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"talking about this conversation with you because we met at a conference. I loved \",\"startTime\":1740788581,\"endTime\":1740788585},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"your energy. I love how you brought people together who should know one another \",\"startTime\":1740788585,\"endTime\":1740788589},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"to just advance in this profession and in our knowledge base and. \",\"startTime\":1740788589,\"endTime\":1740788594},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I''m here because I value your input, I respect you as an individual, and I''m just really excited to continue learning from you and other great individuals and professionals around me. \",\"startTime\":1740788594,\"endTime\":1740788603},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow, you have such a wonderful stance about learning. It''s magical to be around \",\"startTime\":1740788605,\"endTime\":1740788607},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1740788607,\"endTime\":1740788610},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You bring a great energy to the crew and to the people around you and.\",\"startTime\":1740788610,\"endTime\":1740788614},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s amazing because you''re wanting to learn so much and you engage with the people around you and it''s wonderful. \",\"startTime\":1740788615,\"endTime\":1740788622},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1740788623,\"endTime\":1740788624},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I I''m here in doing the work that I''m doing because I enjoy working with people. \",\"startTime\":1740788623,\"endTime\":1740788628},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And at some point, like 10 years ago, the NCTM published Principles to actions and then they have their effective, effective mathematics teaching practices. \",\"startTime\":1740788628,\"endTime\":1740788637},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And one of them said facilitate meaningful mathematical discourse where we know that facilitating meaningful discourse is just the. \",\"startTime\":1740788637,\"endTime\":1740788646},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Most important thing probably to do at any level for any learner in any content. \",\"startTime\":1740788648,\"endTime\":1740788652},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"But it really challenged me and I took it on. I''m like, yeah, I''ll work on that \",\"startTime\":1740788653,\"endTime\":1740788656},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"one for there''s eight of them. I''ll work on that one for a little bit, maybe \",\"startTime\":1740788656,\"endTime\":1740788660},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a year or I don''t know. I was, I had no idea that I would be. \",\"startTime\":1740788660,\"endTime\":1740788664},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Thinking so in depth about how do I facilitate meaningful discourse because the teachers that I work with or the people that I work with? \",\"startTime\":1740788664,\"endTime\":1740788671},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"We don''t get to come together very often. And if you''re doing a Zoom call or \",\"startTime\":1740788672,\"endTime\":1740788676},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"remote classes to help professionals learn more about what they''re doing. \",\"startTime\":1740788676,\"endTime\":1740788680},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You like, how do you facilitate meaningful discourse ''cause that''s, that''s a key. How do I embed that fact? I can do it in the classroom. And I was getting \",\"startTime\":1740788680,\"endTime\":1740788687},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"better at the classroom and I was stoked about that. But over the last 10 years, \",\"startTime\":1740788687,\"endTime\":1740788690},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I''m like, OK, I''m not in the classroom with kids. I''m in the classroom with \",\"startTime\":1740788690,\"endTime\":1740788694},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"adults. How do you do with adults? How do you use these routines to engage learners \",\"startTime\":1740788694,\"endTime\":1740788697},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and all of this stuff? And OK, how do you really facilitate meaningful discourse? \",\"startTime\":1740788697,\"endTime\":1740788700},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I don''t read and figure this out. And then I''m like, holy crap. \",\"startTime\":1740788700,\"endTime\":1740788703},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Write it.\",\"startTime\":1740788702,\"endTime\":1740788703},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Other tools in mic show me this tool and like we can do one-on-one conversations and not even be there in the room and trust them and you can facilitate meaningful discourse by having a few cars on the screen. How do you do that? \",\"startTime\":1740788705,\"endTime\":1740788717},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love it. We can just dive in and get to all this good stuff.\",\"startTime\":1740788717,\"endTime\":1740788721},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. So I think it''s two reasons I''m here. One, I''m still on my quest \",\"startTime\":1740788722,\"endTime\":1740788726},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to facilitate meaningful discourse and I''m learning how to do it. I''m getting \",\"startTime\":1740788726,\"endTime\":1740788730},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"better at it because I love people. I love working with them. And I realize \",\"startTime\":1740788730,\"endTime\":1740788733},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788731,\"endTime\":1740788731},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it''s really important to let them do the talking and the learning and the the driving and the painting and all that stuff and to get out of the way. \",\"startTime\":1740788733,\"endTime\":1740788741},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And also.\",\"startTime\":1740788742,\"endTime\":1740788744},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I just love getting chance to see people do their things and want to get to interact with them and learn about them and hear from them. But I love being \",\"startTime\":1740788744,\"endTime\":1740788751},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"able to enhance their identity and agency as they''re doing their things and then synthesize their thinking and bring it together to the whole class or the whole group. And, and now it''s like my zone approximal development. How do you \",\"startTime\":1740788751,\"endTime\":1740788763},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"do that, Jeff, with educators all over the place? \",\"startTime\":1740788763,\"endTime\":1740788766},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And how do I use AI tools? So it feels to me much of A growing and how do I \",\"startTime\":1740788768,\"endTime\":1740788773},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788772,\"endTime\":1740788772},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"help grow community and grow educators and get out of the way and stop like now talking so much or taking so much air time in a classroom. But really just \",\"startTime\":1740788773,\"endTime\":1740788781},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"give them the tools to to do the things that they need to do to grow. \",\"startTime\":1740788781,\"endTime\":1740788785},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1740788781,\"endTime\":1740788781},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"That''s why I''m here.\",\"startTime\":1740788786,\"endTime\":1740788787},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Yeah, wow.\",\"startTime\":1740788786,\"endTime\":1740788786},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love that and I think like you''re really in the right, you''re in the right place. Like this is perfect for you and I''m so glad that you are doing this \",\"startTime\":1740788787,\"endTime\":1740788793},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"and sharing all of your knowledge and wisdom and just supporting our community at whole. \",\"startTime\":1740788793,\"endTime\":1740788799},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1740788794,\"endTime\":1740788795},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Thanks. Really appreciate it.\",\"startTime\":1740788800,\"endTime\":1740788802},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You slide that one in right there, thanking your partner. Thank you, Brittany. \",\"startTime\":1740788804,\"endTime\":1740788808},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I learned from you today. It''s called Text Blaze, and I said it a bunch of times. \",\"startTime\":1740788808,\"endTime\":1740788812},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thank you, Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1740788809,\"endTime\":1740788810},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Text Blaze Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788811,\"endTime\":1740788812},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So I remember text plays and what it does. I know more about what it does. I \",\"startTime\":1740788812,\"endTime\":1740788817},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"knew a little bit before by now I know more. Thank you. \",\"startTime\":1740788817,\"endTime\":1740788821},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Beautiful. Well, thank you, thank you, and thank you, Jeff. I learned how to \",\"startTime\":1740788820,\"endTime\":1740788825},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"use UPDUO for my first time. And so I''m really excited to get this out of the \",\"startTime\":1740788825,\"endTime\":1740788829},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"way so I do feel more comfortable engaging in these deep and powerful conversations with other professionals. \",\"startTime\":1740788829,\"endTime\":1740788838},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Awesome, awesome.\",\"startTime\":1740788838,\"endTime\":1740788839},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right. When you hit end, it like ends, ends, just FYI. So if you''re chatting \",\"startTime\":1740788840,\"endTime\":1740788844},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788843,\"endTime\":1740788844},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"with somebody like Next and you think it''s next, it''s not. It''s really end. \",\"startTime\":1740788844,\"endTime\":1740788848},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So yeah, yeah. Anything else Brittany you''re wondering about since we''re on \",\"startTime\":1740788848,\"endTime\":1740788853},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"OK, good to know.\",\"startTime\":1740788849,\"endTime\":1740788850},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a call besides the cards and stuff, anything about side by or what you''re wondering or had questions or wanted to say anything while you had a chance? It is almost \",\"startTime\":1740788853,\"endTime\":1740788861},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"430, but I just wanted to be mindful. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1740788861,\"endTime\":1740788866},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I think that now that I''ve had this I a lot of my questions were answered on how does it work. I was a little confused at first but I feel like this really \",\"startTime\":1740788867,\"endTime\":1740788876},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"clarified a lot for me so this has been helpful. \",\"startTime\":1740788876,\"endTime\":1740788880},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Awesome, good, good. And I''ll send you a follow up note, but uh, in your dashboard \",\"startTime\":1740788877,\"endTime\":1740788882},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"at my side by dot AI look in your feed and umm, we''re working on it and even next week we''re gonna have more updates that come. But uh, I''ll take our transcript \",\"startTime\":1740788882,\"endTime\":1740788892},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and it''s being automated now, which is better taking our transcript and then I can pull out of there and press the button. \",\"startTime\":1740788892,\"endTime\":1740788901},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And from our transcript, ask it our assistant, our robot.\",\"startTime\":1740788901,\"endTime\":1740788905},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hey, give us some insight and then it goes through and it will give us some insights from the conversation, quotes and interesting moments, challenges, inspiring this or whatever. And then I''ll, I''ll, I''ll hit push and it will push \",\"startTime\":1740788906,\"endTime\":1740788919},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to your feet. So I''ll be watching on there and I''ll send you a note too when \",\"startTime\":1740788919,\"endTime\":1740788923},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Ya, uh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1740788920,\"endTime\":1740788924},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it comes on there. But it''s great ''cause then you get artifacts back to you. \",\"startTime\":1740788923,\"endTime\":1740788928},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Instead of you trying to put all the stuff together, we want to put together for you artifacts so that you can, can just focus on conversation. \",\"startTime\":1740788928,\"endTime\":1740788936},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And get back to what you''re doing. And then out of it will come. Hey, here''s \",\"startTime\":1740788937,\"endTime\":1740788940},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love that.\",\"startTime\":1740788937,\"endTime\":1740788938},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"your cool podcast or whatever down the road. Not yet. We''re not there yet. Yeah, \",\"startTime\":1740788940,\"endTime\":1740788943},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you got it. \",\"startTime\":1740788943,\"endTime\":1740788946},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"I love that we get to create more, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740788944,\"endTime\":1740788947},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, have a happy, wonderful Friday and a weekend. Hope you take care \",\"startTime\":1740788948,\"endTime\":1740788951},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Love that.\",\"startTime\":1740788948,\"endTime\":1740788949},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of yourself. Remember, nobody else will, OK? \",\"startTime\":1740788951,\"endTime\":1740788953},{\"speaker\":\"11883\",\"text\":\"Thank you, Jeff. Have a good weekend. Bye, bye.\",\"startTime\":1740788954,\"endTime\":1740788957},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1740788956,\"endTime\":1740788957}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.882124+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.882124+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1428, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.842Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('ffbe89d7-ed50-4713-ad46-60afc77f5849', '1437c66b-ec40-4d5f-ae09-61eaf239da58', '137240', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I teach teachers to use AI so that they can teach their students to use AI.\",\"startTime\":1740437234,\"endTime\":1740437237},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"And.\",\"startTime\":1740437237,\"endTime\":1740437238},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I hope to learn about what''s changing as it changes.\",\"startTime\":1740437239,\"endTime\":1740437242},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward. Lean it forward whenever I find myself leaning too far back.\",\"startTime\":1740437256,\"endTime\":1740437258},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I remind myself to lean a little further forward.\",\"startTime\":1740437258,\"endTime\":1740437260},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward could means more student centrifuges. Forward could mean more skill. \",\"startTime\":1740437260,\"endTime\":1740437263},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Forward could mean. \",\"startTime\":1740437263,\"endTime\":1740437265},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"Umm towards change towards technology umm forward could mean.\",\"startTime\":1740437267,\"endTime\":1740437270},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I don''t know.\",\"startTime\":1740437272,\"endTime\":1740437272},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I teach my kids to ski.\",\"startTime\":1740437288,\"endTime\":1740437289},{\"speaker\":\"11897\",\"text\":\"I like punk rock music. I like to ski off pieced, jump off of things.\",\"startTime\":1740437289,\"endTime\":1740437295}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.398238+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.398238+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 47, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.360Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('18d479ad-b7e5-45e7-a66a-6ca2c3230b46', '6591e553-8215-4832-843f-a15c716b5863', '137780', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"Hello, just jumping in here to introduce myself and make sure I can match with a partner. Appreciate the ability to reflect. \",\"startTime\":1742588967,\"endTime\":1742588974},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I am Erica and.\",\"startTime\":1742588976,\"endTime\":1742588979},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"That''s that.\",\"startTime\":1742588986,\"endTime\":1742588987},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"So I''m in reflecting and it''s says there''s three cards but I''m just on card 1. \",\"startTime\":1742588988,\"endTime\":1742588993},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"And it doesn''t move me to the next card until I''m through a minute. That''s interesting. \",\"startTime\":1742588995,\"endTime\":1742589000},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"So I can''t finish the reflection quickly if I want to, which could be a thing. \",\"startTime\":1742589004,\"endTime\":1742589009},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"But that''s interesting. Like I can see that there''s three. \",\"startTime\":1742589009,\"endTime\":1742589013},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"I could, I could just like X myself out, but I can''t. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1742589014,\"endTime\":1742589016},{\"speaker\":\"11954\",\"text\":\"That''s interesting. It still did. So now I''ve hit my one minute.\",\"startTime\":1742589027,\"endTime\":1742589030}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.47678+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.47678+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 87, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.454Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('f7b6daa0-f971-4377-8a79-df012b2e34c1', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', '105903', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.270552+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:54.270552+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 627, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:54.187Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('21440ed0-f089-45aa-8267-9141c741b804', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '138135', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Everyone, my name is Mike Peck. Uh, I''m a director of technology for a public \",\"startTime\":1744720857,\"endTime\":1744720860},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"school in Pennsylvania. I''m excited to. \",\"startTime\":1744720860,\"endTime\":1744720863},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Through Upduo and sci-fi get to meet other.\",\"startTime\":1744720863,\"endTime\":1744720866},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Educators like myself.\",\"startTime\":1744720867,\"endTime\":1744720869},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Who are interested in how we can leverage technology to enhance learning.\",\"startTime\":1744720869,\"endTime\":1744720874},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Outcomes and opportunities.\",\"startTime\":1744720875,\"endTime\":1744720877},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"So my stance with respect to teaching and learning, I prior to getting into technology leadership, I was the classroom educator. \",\"startTime\":1744720909,\"endTime\":1744720917},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And in that role?\",\"startTime\":1744720917,\"endTime\":1744720919},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Through the use of technology, I was really focused on how we can use the technology in a way that allows students to explore learning versus telling them how to learn. And so I focused a lot on project based learning and how we can learn \",\"startTime\":1744720921,\"endTime\":1744720938},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"through exploration and play. And this is going back to like 2007, 2008, 2009. \",\"startTime\":1744720938,\"endTime\":1744720944},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Where, you know, we were first seeing the initial like iPad rollouts and things like that. And So what I found was that students were much more interested in \",\"startTime\":1744720945,\"endTime\":1744720955},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"engaged in learning when they could actively explore it on their own and so. \",\"startTime\":1744720955,\"endTime\":1744720961},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"That said, about all sorts of exploration on my own part, looking into gamification. \",\"startTime\":1744720961,\"endTime\":1744720965},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Like I said, project based learning. \",\"startTime\":1744720965,\"endTime\":1744720969},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And then exploring new technologies and how they could really enhance teaching and learning. So my hope is new technologies can allow us to return to a place \",\"startTime\":1744720969,\"endTime\":1744720978},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"where educators can, can be, connectors can be, mentors can be. \",\"startTime\":1744720978,\"endTime\":1744720982},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, you know, supports versus being the thing that, that, uh, allows kids to learn. \",\"startTime\":1744720983,\"endTime\":1744720988},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"And I think especially through the use of new technologies like AI that we''re gonna be able to get there. But we have to not just. \",\"startTime\":1744720989,\"endTime\":1744720997},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Think about teaching and learning. We need to think about the systems that undergird \",\"startTime\":1744720997,\"endTime\":1744720999},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"it. \",\"startTime\":1744720999,\"endTime\":1744721001},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I think umm.\",\"startTime\":1744721037,\"endTime\":1744721037},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"I find myself most in a state of flow.\",\"startTime\":1744721037,\"endTime\":1744721041},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, when I''m engaging in sort of like passion projects. So certainly.\",\"startTime\":1744721043,\"endTime\":1744721046},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"With work, I like building stuff, planning things.\",\"startTime\":1744721047,\"endTime\":1744721051},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Executing on projects you know checking off the task list really gets me motivated. \",\"startTime\":1744721052,\"endTime\":1744721058},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Outside of work? Umm, I think uh.\",\"startTime\":1744721058,\"endTime\":1744721062},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Umm, I think so. I would say first and foremost outside of work, umm, spending \",\"startTime\":1744721064,\"endTime\":1744721067},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"time with my, my son who''s 2, uh. \",\"startTime\":1744721067,\"endTime\":1744721071},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"He''s incredible and you know, I could spend hours and hours just kind of playing and talking and doing things with him. \",\"startTime\":1744721072,\"endTime\":1744721080},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Spending time with my family, both my my immediate family, my extended family. \",\"startTime\":1744721082,\"endTime\":1744721088},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Those things are really exciting for me and umm, and sports too, so I''m pretty active athlete, umm, still uh. \",\"startTime\":1744721088,\"endTime\":1744721095},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Somehow find my time to play.\",\"startTime\":1744721096,\"endTime\":1744721099},{\"speaker\":\"11981\",\"text\":\"Soccer, quite a bit, golfing are my 2 favorites and and so yeah, those are the things that I really enjoyed, you know, spending time on outside of work. \",\"startTime\":1744721099,\"endTime\":1744721108}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.263643+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.263643+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 198, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.229Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('b67134b3-70be-4675-ad42-6ca8e4557038', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137153', '"[{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hey, Tom, good morning. Happy hot tea to you.\",\"startTime\":1739982512,\"endTime\":1739982515},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1739982529,\"endTime\":1739982529},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, you glitched out for just a second that I agree. Your partner Tom \",\"startTime\":1739982530,\"endTime\":1739982534},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and press more for the icebreaker. \",\"startTime\":1739982534,\"endTime\":1739982537},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You could have a superpower related to AI. What would it be and why? Oh.\",\"startTime\":1739982540,\"endTime\":1739982545},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Well, one of my super powers that I''ve always wished I had would be to be able to freeze time. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1739982552,\"endTime\":1739982558},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So, umm.\",\"startTime\":1739982562,\"endTime\":1739982563},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Is there a way to like?\",\"startTime\":1739982564,\"endTime\":1739982566},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like freeze time would be.\",\"startTime\":1739982568,\"endTime\":1739982570},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"For AI to.\",\"startTime\":1739982572,\"endTime\":1739982574},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Daily scan my calendar, tell me which things it''s got. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1739982575,\"endTime\":1739982581},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And tell me how much time I just gained and then I can.\",\"startTime\":1739982583,\"endTime\":1739982587},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Fill it with stuff that I would do if I could freeze time.\",\"startTime\":1739982590,\"endTime\":1739982593},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Am I hearing you like the superpower would be is the AI power tool would be to integrate with your calendar to help free up more space so that you would be able to do stuff like time or frozen? \",\"startTime\":1739982596,\"endTime\":1739982609},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes, exactly.\",\"startTime\":1739982611,\"endTime\":1739982612},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, I like that. I really like that.\",\"startTime\":1739982615,\"endTime\":1739982617},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I think for me it would be similar but it''s more of time management.\",\"startTime\":1739982620,\"endTime\":1739982625},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"In my brain I have all of these, even kindergarten visuals of Jeff''s health and well-being. And the bars would be going up and down for the different areas \",\"startTime\":1739982627,\"endTime\":1739982635},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that Jeff got exercised. Jeff slept well, Jeff ate good food. Things that Jeff \",\"startTime\":1739982635,\"endTime\":1739982640},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"doesn''t manage really well in his life at times. \",\"startTime\":1739982640,\"endTime\":1739982644},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"But he''s happy when he''s got all of those buckets filled and the bars are reaching critical levels of happiness and getting the tea and walking about having good conversations. So for me, the superpower would be is like the automated. \",\"startTime\":1739982644,\"endTime\":1739982660},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I don''t know the heads up display of like Jarvis from Iron Man showing me how my oxygen levels are, but in all of the areas and and give me recommendations and help schedule out. Jeff, go for a walk and do a up duo chat with Tom a side \",\"startTime\":1739982662,\"endTime\":1739982674},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739982669,\"endTime\":1739982670},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739982671,\"endTime\":1739982672},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"by chat with Tom while you''re going for a walk. Remember your ear buds. And \",\"startTime\":1739982674,\"endTime\":1739982678},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"then it would show me that this is getting my my health and well-being meter up. \",\"startTime\":1739982678,\"endTime\":1739982687},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And scheduling out a ski date with with a friend and then make sure you''re doing art time to get in flow and to do your meditation and just let go of the other stuff and give your brain some space to think deeply. \",\"startTime\":1739982688,\"endTime\":1739982703},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739982690,\"endTime\":1739982691},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like, yeah, it''d be like the kindergarten mom for a little Jeff.\",\"startTime\":1739982703,\"endTime\":1739982707},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Integrated into my system. Oh I like.\",\"startTime\":1739982708,\"endTime\":1739982711},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, by the way, what is your, what''s your art?\",\"startTime\":1739982710,\"endTime\":1739982713},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Creating.\",\"startTime\":1739982716,\"endTime\":1739982717},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I love woodworking, first of all. It''s been a passion for a long time and of \",\"startTime\":1739982717,\"endTime\":1739982720},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"late I''ve been doodling. \",\"startTime\":1739982720,\"endTime\":1739982723},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"As a matter of fact, since I can walk about, I''ll show you my current doodle. \",\"startTime\":1739982725,\"endTime\":1739982729},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Welcome to our world.\",\"startTime\":1739982733,\"endTime\":1739982734},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''ll even put the light on.\",\"startTime\":1739982734,\"endTime\":1739982736},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"See if you can see it.\",\"startTime\":1739982741,\"endTime\":1739982742},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It''s a line art technique that a friend shared with me and I''ve been morphing it and I like that. \",\"startTime\":1739982744,\"endTime\":1739982752},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739982746,\"endTime\":1739982747},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Use chalk in a medium and put a timer on it. So 5 minutes or 20 minutes or 15 \",\"startTime\":1739982752,\"endTime\":1739982757},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"minutes and then just doodle and do my drawings. So currently I''ve been doing \",\"startTime\":1739982757,\"endTime\":1739982762},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"landscapes and trying to embody what I see in the world and I find that even a 5 minute doodle on the chalkboard knowing that that''s all I have, that''s my canvas. If that''s the. \",\"startTime\":1739982762,\"endTime\":1739982778},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Microwave timer or whatever is cooking in the oven and I got 1520 minutes. I \",\"startTime\":1739982779,\"endTime\":1739982782},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"just put it on and that''s all I get. \",\"startTime\":1739982782,\"endTime\":1739982786},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And just get some space in there and.\",\"startTime\":1739982786,\"endTime\":1739982788},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s my current artwork.\",\"startTime\":1739982789,\"endTime\":1739982790},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thanks for asking.\",\"startTime\":1739982792,\"endTime\":1739982794},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want to hit next. Oh, you beat me to it, ''cause it says partner ready.\",\"startTime\":1739982795,\"endTime\":1739982799},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, ask Tom.\",\"startTime\":1739982802,\"endTime\":1739982803},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"What recent AI innovation announced in the last week? Who did you find the most \",\"startTime\":1739982804,\"endTime\":1739982809},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"exciting? So if you didn''t hear in the last week, just in general? \",\"startTime\":1739982809,\"endTime\":1739982815},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, in the last week I heard about, learned about, and then played around with the, uh, ChatGPT, deep research. \",\"startTime\":1739982817,\"endTime\":1739982827},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Well, you played with it.\",\"startTime\":1739982829,\"endTime\":1739982830},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Tell me about it, I just read that it came out.\",\"startTime\":1739982831,\"endTime\":1739982833},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I with another guy who I''m just sort of like thinking and dreaming with. We \",\"startTime\":1739982836,\"endTime\":1739982841},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"both went on and went through this series of prompts about starting a new, innovative high school in Denver. \",\"startTime\":1739982841,\"endTime\":1739982851},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And you know, kind of research then it like it went deep into like here''s some funding, here''s structures, here''s. \",\"startTime\":1739982854,\"endTime\":1739982861},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like all these different?\",\"startTime\":1739982862,\"endTime\":1739982863},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"It was 27 pages of like, really kind of good.\",\"startTime\":1739982867,\"endTime\":1739982871},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Stuff that you could put in front of a board and they''d be like, whoa, you''ve really thought about this? \",\"startTime\":1739982871,\"endTime\":1739982876},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That sounds like a magic time stop machine.\",\"startTime\":1739982879,\"endTime\":1739982881},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s crazy.\",\"startTime\":1739982883,\"endTime\":1739982884},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"But I also I graduated to pay versions.\",\"startTime\":1739982887,\"endTime\":1739982892},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"For both ChatGPT and Claude.\",\"startTime\":1739982895,\"endTime\":1739982899},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like I said, I graduated. What gave you the impetus to graduate?\",\"startTime\":1739982901,\"endTime\":1739982905},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, it was. It was interest. Just like if I am the the kind of the person who \",\"startTime\":1739982910,\"endTime\":1739982915},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"is the future''s thinker at my organization. \",\"startTime\":1739982915,\"endTime\":1739982921},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And I''m a huge fan of AI and I use it all the time.\",\"startTime\":1739982922,\"endTime\":1739982926},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I just wanted to learn what the difference was. Lakeside school in Seattle there. \",\"startTime\":1739982927,\"endTime\":1739982933},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Do you track them or do you know anyone there or?\",\"startTime\":1739982935,\"endTime\":1739982937},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"We had a couple people come to the AI Summit. We were in Seattle, Tacoma area \",\"startTime\":1739982939,\"endTime\":1739982943},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"2 weeks ago, first week of February and there were a few people there from Lakeside, so I got to meet with them but I don''t have any deep connections at the moment there. \",\"startTime\":1739982943,\"endTime\":1739982954},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So their director of tech is this guy Jamie Britto.\",\"startTime\":1739982954,\"endTime\":1739982957},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Who is an amazing thinker and you 2 are?\",\"startTime\":1739982959,\"endTime\":1739982962},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Absolutely kindred spirits in a lot of ways. So that''s like an interesting connection. \",\"startTime\":1739982965,\"endTime\":1739982971},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"They are offering paid ChatGPT to every student and faculty member. \",\"startTime\":1739982971,\"endTime\":1739982978},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1739982982,\"endTime\":1739982983},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And so just sort of talking with him, seeing what they''re thinking about, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1739982982,\"endTime\":1739982987},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, super cool thing that we''ve been doing and it was fun even at just similar. \",\"startTime\":1739982991,\"endTime\":1739982997},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I don''t want to go too far off topic here, but this just reminds me that at the AI Summit, we were able to give three people who are in the session with Mike and I as about how do you, how do you keep up with AI in the next decade? \",\"startTime\":1739982997,\"endTime\":1739983012},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And at side by, even at the, the main page at side by, there''s a opportunity for people to sponsor educators and we had 19 sponsorships available so that we could give. \",\"startTime\":1739983012,\"endTime\":1739983027},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Sponsorships and paid subscriptions. So three people in a session, we were giving \",\"startTime\":1739983029,\"endTime\":1739983034},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"play time and they were exploring and using tools and as Mike said it, hey, when you reach a barrier and it''s a paywall barrier, let us know we happen to have sponsorships. So three people got. \",\"startTime\":1739983034,\"endTime\":1739983048},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Either a ChatGPT plus or access to lovable and and I think the other one was ChatGPT plus also or maybe Claude but. \",\"startTime\":1739983048,\"endTime\":1739983058},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Teachers have that as a barrier and it''s great to hear at Lakeside that they''re removing that barrier for them and that side by some groups are saying, hey, we want to support and what what could we do to support? And we know that one \",\"startTime\":1739983058,\"endTime\":1739983069},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"of the things is to provide access for people to. \",\"startTime\":1739983069,\"endTime\":1739983073},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Get their paid subscriptions so that they can use the tools and drive this super cool ship. \",\"startTime\":1739983073,\"endTime\":1739983079},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That they''re at, they''re at the controls and they can run with it. Yeah, I think \",\"startTime\":1739983079,\"endTime\":1739983083},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that''s a huge thing for educators is to get them into the driver''s seat so they can really play with the the stuff. \",\"startTime\":1739983083,\"endTime\":1739983089},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1739983083,\"endTime\":1739983084},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Exactly.\",\"startTime\":1739983090,\"endTime\":1739983091},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Umm, the by the way.\",\"startTime\":1739983095,\"endTime\":1739983098},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Bueno, güey.\",\"startTime\":1739983099,\"endTime\":1739983099},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"This video call that we''re doing, what''s, what''s the like?\",\"startTime\":1739983100,\"endTime\":1739983104},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What is up to using for the video call?\",\"startTime\":1739983104,\"endTime\":1739983107},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s a great question. I don''t know all the answers to that, but I do \",\"startTime\":1739983112,\"endTime\":1739983117},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"know that with the software, the engineers programming in and with tools today, it''s pretty easy to even set up your own web space. By the way, you could do \",\"startTime\":1739983117,\"endTime\":1739983125},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Lovable is the app that we''re using to build a bunch of cool stuff. Like you \",\"startTime\":1739983125,\"endTime\":1739983130},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"can even at Lovable. Claude would have something similar, but Lovable would \",\"startTime\":1739983130,\"endTime\":1739983134},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"integrate and there''s like 3 different main pieces. \",\"startTime\":1739983134,\"endTime\":1739983139},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"To run software, to be able to do video calls and to have them recorded, you need a database, you need to have a server and then your your code repository. \",\"startTime\":1739983139,\"endTime\":1739983148},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"There''s something else I''m missing right now, but yeah, we should chat about that one later. I can give you hints on it so. \",\"startTime\":1739983148,\"endTime\":1739983156},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"All good. Yeah, lovable. I just pulled it up and came around with that later. \",\"startTime\":1739983156,\"endTime\":1739983160},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, play with Lovable. Lovable is a great one to build out code for websites \",\"startTime\":1739983160,\"endTime\":1739983163},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1739983161,\"endTime\":1739983161},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"for doing things like what you''re saying. Claude also has that same kind of \",\"startTime\":1739983163,\"endTime\":1739983167},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"ability, but different lovables like turbo power, and you might have fun playing with that one too. \",\"startTime\":1739983167,\"endTime\":1739983174},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Cool for sure.\",\"startTime\":1739983173,\"endTime\":1739983176},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Sorry, hold on a second, you didn''t share your AI?\",\"startTime\":1739983176,\"endTime\":1739983179},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah. All right.\",\"startTime\":1739983177,\"endTime\":1739983178},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I did indirectly and it''s cool is the cards sometimes are more of a asking and a listening roles. So in that case I was asking listen and then you were the \",\"startTime\":1739983183,\"endTime\":1739983192},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"1 to get to speak. \",\"startTime\":1739983192,\"endTime\":1739983196},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"But on this next card, take turns sharing with Tom, so sometimes I don''t get to tell my cool things, I just get to listen. \",\"startTime\":1739983197,\"endTime\":1739983204},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"A