 a as a student and questions like how was the support? \",\"startTime\":1739983940,\"endTime\":1739983956},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739983951,\"endTime\":1739983952},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"From your your educators, or even more generally, Hey, where did you feel like you were positioned as capable? \",\"startTime\":1739983960,\"endTime\":1739983967},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"How did that feel? Did they give you the steering wheel or the pencil to do \",\"startTime\":1739983967,\"endTime\":1739983971},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"these things this week? How did they do that or how did they not do that? And \",\"startTime\":1739983971,\"endTime\":1739983975},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"how did you feel about your identity this week? What were you as a learner? \",\"startTime\":1739983975,\"endTime\":1739983979},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Did you have your identity enhanced? Who? How did you see yourself as a learner \",\"startTime\":1739983979,\"endTime\":1739983983},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"this week? Where was your agency? How did you? \",\"startTime\":1739983983,\"endTime\":1739983987},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"What was it like for you as a learner along those lines? And then the third \",\"startTime\":1739983988,\"endTime\":1739983992},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"principle that I always go to is valuing multiple contributions. So that did \",\"startTime\":1739983992,\"endTime\":1739983996},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you position each learners capable? Did you enhance the identity and agency \",\"startTime\":1739983996,\"endTime\":1739984001},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"of each learner? And then did you value multiple contributions? Hey kid, just \",\"startTime\":1739984001,\"endTime\":1739984005},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"reflect with somebody else. Tom, were you were you getting different perspectives \",\"startTime\":1739984005,\"endTime\":1739984009},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"and different ways of thinking from other people and hear about their ideas? \",\"startTime\":1739984009,\"endTime\":1739984013},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And did you feel like you had the the place and space? \",\"startTime\":1739984013,\"endTime\":1739984018},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And felt like you belong to share your thinking so that others valued your contributions as well. Like if you had that, then then I''m just wondering like one-on-one \",\"startTime\":1739984019,\"endTime\":1739984029},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"conversations or even reflections, self reflections for the the learners to get that data to feed into the system that you''re talking about so that you get feedback as an educator. And then you would go, oh, holy crap, little Jeff \",\"startTime\":1739984029,\"endTime\":1739984044},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"is feeling like you took this pencil away. \",\"startTime\":1739984044,\"endTime\":1739984049},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, Tom took his pencil away. That''s what he said. And why don''t you \",\"startTime\":1739984050,\"endTime\":1739984053},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"give him the pencil, Tom? And then Jeff feels like he belongs and he''s at the \",\"startTime\":1739984053,\"endTime\":1739984056},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"controls. And then you can help support him or like you said. \",\"startTime\":1739984056,\"endTime\":1739984060},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You''ve been telling me the same thing over and over again. It''s not working. \",\"startTime\":1739984061,\"endTime\":1739984064},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Like you don''t need to tell me 20 more times the same thing. \",\"startTime\":1739984064,\"endTime\":1739984068},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And what if so this is like a like a question about the back end or like how things work, but also like as a way to riff on your idea. \",\"startTime\":1739984068,\"endTime\":1739984078},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like is this transcript being recorded? And then is it the same thing? Saved \",\"startTime\":1739984079,\"endTime\":1739984083},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"ideas get pushed up. It''s like, hey man, you said this thing five different \",\"startTime\":1739984083,\"endTime\":1739984086},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"times and these are the moments of brilliance or these are the the insights and then that kid now has. \",\"startTime\":1739984086,\"endTime\":1739984093},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"A like, you have so many thoughts, right? So you''ve got this like partner in \",\"startTime\":1739984096,\"endTime\":1739984099},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"distilling and crystallizing. Oh, that''s, that''s a, you know, that''s exactly \",\"startTime\":1739984099,\"endTime\":1739984103},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"what I was feeling, but I didn''t kind of notice that because I wasn''t able to capture all of my language that I said out loud, but. \",\"startTime\":1739984103,\"endTime\":1739984110},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Instead of just like journaling with yourself or.\",\"startTime\":1739984111,\"endTime\":1739984113},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know your keyboard, you''re doing it with someone else.\",\"startTime\":1739984113,\"endTime\":1739984116},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Answering your question in brief, I think what we''re trying to do is really \",\"startTime\":1739984117,\"endTime\":1739984124},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"remove the neurological burden, the cognitive load when it comes to note taking, when it comes to reflections and really keen into the strengths that we have as humans and that we''re language based, we''re we''re communicators, we''re storytellers. \",\"startTime\":1739984124,\"endTime\":1739984144},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And even right now I can just start talking and I''m not worried about how it''s spelled or how it''s written or for me, which color pen I''m going to use to write the thing down and is this most important and I write it bigger font or like all of those questions are on my mind that cognitive load is too much. \",\"startTime\":1739984146,\"endTime\":1739984162},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And to free that up for the individual to say, just talk, tell your story, have questioning, go back and forth with rich discourse. And then we''ll use the tools \",\"startTime\":1739984163,\"endTime\":1739984173},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"like from here, the transcript right now, what we can do is, is run it through that process that you saw just real quickly. What are some of the the pluses, \",\"startTime\":1739984173,\"endTime\":1739984182},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the challenges and then really cool inspirational perspectives. That''s where \",\"startTime\":1739984182,\"endTime\":1739984187},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want that turbo or that rocket fuel to really help me in my work is. \",\"startTime\":1739984187,\"endTime\":1739984192},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want it to be even more, I want to give even more to the the user so that on your space at my at side by you''re going to get all of that and even more that I could give you the hey, Tom, you were talking about innovative teaching schools. Here''s five articles that that seemed to be really related to what \",\"startTime\":1739984193,\"endTime\":1739984210},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you were doing. And here are five people that are are doing wonderful things. \",\"startTime\":1739984210,\"endTime\":1739984215},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And here''s 2 podcasts. \",\"startTime\":1739984215,\"endTime\":1739984219},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Sure, what you''re looking for, but if you''re looking for more, here''s more for you. And Tom, if you want to click on this, we will connect you with with Amy \",\"startTime\":1739984221,\"endTime\":1739984229},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Hancock, who is dreaming about starting a new school, who at dream camp last year articulated that she wants to build a new school and on her timeline XYZ and we can share that with you to connect. Oh, and Tom, here''s a cool article. \",\"startTime\":1739984229,\"endTime\":1739984242},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"You know, we could post that with you on LinkedIn to share and showcase this awesome stuff that you''re doing. \",\"startTime\":1739984242,\"endTime\":1739984251},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That is out of the conversation where you are in your journey. We can meet you \",\"startTime\":1739984251,\"endTime\":1739984255},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"where you are, and that''s where I want the rocket fuel to go faster and the tools to get that to life for you. \",\"startTime\":1739984255,\"endTime\":1739984263},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739984260,\"endTime\":1739984260},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"To that point, like record this stuff like hey, by the way, here''s an article that like takes all the things you just said and that and you should post this to LinkedIn now that would be amazing. I have got A10 AMI guess 9:00 AM your \",\"startTime\":1739984264,\"endTime\":1739984278},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"time hard stop. No, no, no, no, I just want to like. \",\"startTime\":1739984278,\"endTime\":1739984283},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That''s right. That''s right. OK.\",\"startTime\":1739984282,\"endTime\":1739984283},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Honor all the different awesomenesses that we''re going to read the scenario. \",\"startTime\":1739984289,\"endTime\":1739984293},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, the next scenario, let''s just read it real quick because I think we probably answered it. \",\"startTime\":1739984292,\"endTime\":1739984296},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"How could you encourage each other to explore and chat new? Yep.\",\"startTime\":1739984298,\"endTime\":1739984301},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, all right.\",\"startTime\":1739984301,\"endTime\":1739984303},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Like you just, you just gave a great scenario on that.\",\"startTime\":1739984302,\"endTime\":1739984305},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I''m going to challenge for this is the tool that I''m going to try building here. And then I''m going to drop it for you and you build what you want to lovable \",\"startTime\":1739984306,\"endTime\":1739984314},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"might be a great place. And since you already have clawed and you have ChatGPT \",\"startTime\":1739984314,\"endTime\":1739984318},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"my path, I''ve done and and my kid has done it as well as we chat with Claude or ChatGPT and say, hey. \",\"startTime\":1739984318,\"endTime\":1739984327},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I want to build out this scheduling monitor tool and you describe it in the way that you were describing to me, but in more detail and then talk about how you want to use a tool like Lovable to try to build that. \",\"startTime\":1739984327,\"endTime\":1739984340},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Cloud or GBT tech? GBT might be able to do that as well for you, but I''m thinking \",\"startTime\":1739984342,\"endTime\":1739984346},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Lovable might really fit for your itch. \",\"startTime\":1739984346,\"endTime\":1739984350},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"That I know you want to scratch like how do I build this stuff out? And then \",\"startTime\":1739984350,\"endTime\":1739984354},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"after chatting in one, then go for it and and see what you can do in lovable and see if you can build it an interactive. Hey, where are people at and how \",\"startTime\":1739984354,\"endTime\":1739984362},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"do we make this faster? And that scheduling monitor tool. I''m not sure but that \",\"startTime\":1739984362,\"endTime\":1739984366},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that would be yeah, that''s what I heard from you. All right, rock star. \",\"startTime\":1739984366,\"endTime\":1739984371},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Check it out.\",\"startTime\":1739984368,\"endTime\":1739984368},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I''m gonna play.\",\"startTime\":1739984369,\"endTime\":1739984370},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So thank you.\",\"startTime\":1739984375,\"endTime\":1739984377},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Last card.\",\"startTime\":1739984375,\"endTime\":1739984376},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Learned lovable. Didn''t know lovable.\",\"startTime\":1739984378,\"endTime\":1739984380},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Boom and thanks for the reminder. I guess learning that we can stop time. I \",\"startTime\":1739984381,\"endTime\":1739984385},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"never thought of it that way and I really can''t. \",\"startTime\":1739984385,\"endTime\":1739984390},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"What would I do if I could stop time? I would want to do these other things \",\"startTime\":1739984391,\"endTime\":1739984392},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"so. \",\"startTime\":1739984392,\"endTime\":1739984394},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I can''t stop time, so that''s what I''m learning.\",\"startTime\":1739984394,\"endTime\":1739984397},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Thank you. Yeah, thank you for Lovable.\",\"startTime\":1739984401,\"endTime\":1739984404}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.354088+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.354088+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1896, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.313Z", "session_title": "Innovation in AI - Recent Updates", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1447", "name": "Innovation in AI - Recent Updates", "tags": [{"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}, {"name": "First10"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
