	('5df895d8-a2b1-4389-b2cf-894399e86744', 'e703c834-b010-4c88-9b89-e310df8ad353', '138243', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"My name is Jason. I''m a professor of psychology at a Community College. I''ve \",\"startTime\":1745376424,\"endTime\":1745376428},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"been teaching for 13 years in higher education. I also teach social work at \",\"startTime\":1745376428,\"endTime\":1745376432},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"the graduate College of social work. I am a social worker. I just recently got \",\"startTime\":1745376432,\"endTime\":1745376436},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"a part time position at the graduate College of social work for AI technology consultant and I recently found a six watts of clarity. We teach AI literacy \",\"startTime\":1745376436,\"endTime\":1745376443},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"to anyone and everyone, specifically non tech individuals and we just launched our platform on Monday our platform next Monday 60 watts AI faculty lounge where we. \",\"startTime\":1745376443,\"endTime\":1745376454},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Or a companion rather. They help faculty members learn, teach, and integrate \",\"startTime\":1745376454,\"endTime\":1745376457},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"AI into their curriculum at their own place. So I''m interested in meeting other \",\"startTime\":1745376457,\"endTime\":1745376460},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"educators to see what they''re doing in the classroom. What are their painstakes \",\"startTime\":1745376460,\"endTime\":1745376464},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"as well? And specifically K to 12. Because one day I will love to work with \",\"startTime\":1745376464,\"endTime\":1745376467},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"someone to build something out there that can actually help KD12. Not just mass \",\"startTime\":1745376467,\"endTime\":1745376470},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"produce and just output an assignment, but also just, you know, at their level at their time and make sure they have integrity inside of it as well. So hit \",\"startTime\":1745376470,\"endTime\":1745376477},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"me up. \",\"startTime\":1745376477,\"endTime\":1745376480},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Right now I think the role of the teacher is different. My role is no longer \",\"startTime\":1745376500,\"endTime\":1745376504},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"going to be that I know everything and I this and this note absolutely not. \",\"startTime\":1745376504,\"endTime\":1745376508},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"The learner and teacher are like this now. We''re both in the same space, so \",\"startTime\":1745376508,\"endTime\":1745376513},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"we are both struggling trying to figure out how to. \",\"startTime\":1745376513,\"endTime\":1745376516},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"Integrate AI into our lives. So, you know, along with the transparent about \",\"startTime\":1745376516,\"endTime\":1745376520},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"it. I think the teacher and the learner are now both the learner now and I think \",\"startTime\":1745376520,\"endTime\":1745376523},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"it''s going to stay that way for a very long time because we are very, we are in a unique position of how we can explain our subjects. But the problem is \",\"startTime\":1745376523,\"endTime\":1745376530},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"we need to be able to explain it while integrating AI. \",\"startTime\":1745376530,\"endTime\":1745376533},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"None of the above.\",\"startTime\":1745376557,\"endTime\":1745376558},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I I have been obsessed with AI since it came out. Well, maybe I came out since \",\"startTime\":1745376558,\"endTime\":1745376561},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"last October or August and that''s all I ever do now. I don''t, I don''t go do \",\"startTime\":1745376561,\"endTime\":1745376564},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"anything else. \",\"startTime\":1745376564,\"endTime\":1745376567},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I do play trumpet though. I do kind of hang out with friends now, but mostly \",\"startTime\":1745376568,\"endTime\":1745376573},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"I go to work, come back home and do my AI stuff and that''s it. It''s very interesting \",\"startTime\":1745376573,\"endTime\":1745376577},{\"speaker\":\"12008\",\"text\":\"right now and I just committed to doing it and see how far I can get with it. \",\"startTime\":1745376577,\"endTime\":1745376581}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.270575+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.270575+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 131, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.240Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('22f37147-8cf9-4582-9761-a6810fb671e4', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '138232', '"[{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"My name is Jeff and I''m an educator working with other educators to help them to become better at what they do, hopefully help them reflect as humans, be better learners. \",\"startTime\":1745354012,\"endTime\":1745354022},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I hope to get better at my job.\",\"startTime\":1745354025,\"endTime\":1745354026},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Is that all educators are capable.\",\"startTime\":1745354043,\"endTime\":1745354046},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And that we should position them as capable.\",\"startTime\":1745354046,\"endTime\":1745354050},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Of driving their own learning, determining their own path.\",\"startTime\":1745354051,\"endTime\":1745354055},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And that we should not only position them as capable, but enhance their identity and their agency. \",\"startTime\":1745354061,\"endTime\":1745354066},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"While also valuing multiple contributions or perspectives from their own mind, especially from others. \",\"startTime\":1745354069,\"endTime\":1745354076},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Climbing.\",\"startTime\":1745354093,\"endTime\":1745354093},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Rock climbing. I love rock climbing.\",\"startTime\":1745354094,\"endTime\":1745354095}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.301245+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.301245+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 69, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.267Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('d7ebcb65-bfab-488d-be25-79f8597ed21d', '4f2c17d9-95b8-4de7-8b97-ea6e0874f465', '138233', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Here''s a little crazy right now.\",\"startTime\":1745354197,\"endTime\":1745354198},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I do many things as an educator, or maybe everything I do is as an educator, whether it be as a parent or consultant. \",\"startTime\":1745354198,\"endTime\":1745354205},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I write curricula. Sometimes I work directly with students. Considering going \",\"startTime\":1745354206,\"endTime\":1745354209},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"back into the classroom soon. \",\"startTime\":1745354209,\"endTime\":1745354213},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Work a lot with AI.\",\"startTime\":1745354215,\"endTime\":1745354216},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"My name is docs.\",\"startTime\":1745354240,\"endTime\":1745354240},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I was a classroom teacher for many years. I''m now a consultant. I write curricula \",\"startTime\":1745354241,\"endTime\":1745354246},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"for different clients and different fields. So health education. \",\"startTime\":1745354246,\"endTime\":1745354251},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Workforce development, but also still some K12 education.\",\"startTime\":1745354251,\"endTime\":1745354255},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think I approach everything as an educator.\",\"startTime\":1745354257,\"endTime\":1745354259},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''ve been working a lot with AI over the last year and.\",\"startTime\":1745354260,\"endTime\":1745354264},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I''m pretty interested in how to leverage the technology.\",\"startTime\":1745354265,\"endTime\":1745354269},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Particularly to help teachers be effective educators.\",\"startTime\":1745354270,\"endTime\":1745354274},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"For someone who studied education at the far theoretical level, I''m going to stick with the prompts. \",\"startTime\":1745354306,\"endTime\":1745354309},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"What is the role of the teacher? The teacher''s role is to be the intellectual \",\"startTime\":1745354309,\"endTime\":1745354314},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"and moral educator of the student, to help them and lead them on a journey outward from themselves. The role of the learner is to learn. Both of those people have \",\"startTime\":1745354314,\"endTime\":1745354323},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"a job, even if one of them isn''t doing it. \",\"startTime\":1745354323,\"endTime\":1745354327},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"What should change?\",\"startTime\":1745354328,\"endTime\":1745354329},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Man, so many things.\",\"startTime\":1745354331,\"endTime\":1745354333},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Umm.\",\"startTime\":1745354333,\"endTime\":1745354333},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think a lot of probably what needs to change is thinking about motivation, umm, and how to. \",\"startTime\":1745354335,\"endTime\":1745354342},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Help students to become adults and learners and not simply passive.\",\"startTime\":1745354344,\"endTime\":1745354351},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"And begrudging recipients of content knowledge.\",\"startTime\":1745354353,\"endTime\":1745354357},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"What should stay the same? I think a formal education system is necessary, and \",\"startTime\":1745354358,\"endTime\":1745354363},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think one that is universal and free is necessary. \",\"startTime\":1745354363,\"endTime\":1745354368},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"So I lose myself in most things. I lose myself in writing and reading.\",\"startTime\":1745354397,\"endTime\":1745354401},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I snowboard.\",\"startTime\":1745354401,\"endTime\":1745354402},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Pretty much any project I could lose myself in for a significant amount of time. \",\"startTime\":1745354404,\"endTime\":1745354408},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"If I''m not careful, for example recording a video like this, I could lose myself in. \",\"startTime\":1745354408,\"endTime\":1745354415},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Umm.\",\"startTime\":1745354415,\"endTime\":1745354415},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"In some ways I''m very focused, in other ways I''m very distractible.\",\"startTime\":1745354418,\"endTime\":1745354421},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I think that I like to lose myself in stories. I like to lose myself in interactions \",\"startTime\":1745354422,\"endTime\":1745354425},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"with people. \",\"startTime\":1745354425,\"endTime\":1745354429},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I like to lose myself in.\",\"startTime\":1745354432,\"endTime\":1745354434},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"Cerebral Pursuits.\",\"startTime\":1745354439,\"endTime\":1745354441},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I do like to lose myself in my work.\",\"startTime\":1745354441,\"endTime\":1745354443},{\"speaker\":\"11987\",\"text\":\"I have a harder time losing myself and my responsibilities, so like I have to very much think about the things that I have to do. \",\"startTime\":1745354444,\"endTime\":1745354452}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.358141+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.358141+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 172, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.337Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('1971148b-2076-4f58-9148-84005dfc76f6', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '137822', '"[{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"We figured it out for you.\",\"startTime\":1743016274,\"endTime\":1743016276},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Hi, I''m alright. How are you?\",\"startTime\":1743016274,\"endTime\":1743016277},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Don''t get happy Wednesday.\",\"startTime\":1743016277,\"endTime\":1743016279},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes, happy hump day. I''m so glad.\",\"startTime\":1743016279,\"endTime\":1743016281},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"On that side of the slope, where are you in the world?\",\"startTime\":1743016283,\"endTime\":1743016287},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Indiana.\",\"startTime\":1743016288,\"endTime\":1743016291},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Cool, I''m in California near near the Tahoe area. So the part of California \",\"startTime\":1743016291,\"endTime\":1743016293},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"where it snows. \",\"startTime\":1743016293,\"endTime\":1743016296},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Great. OK.\",\"startTime\":1743016296,\"endTime\":1743016297},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Oh fun, I grew up in Wisconsin so I love snow.\",\"startTime\":1743016298,\"endTime\":1743016301},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743016300,\"endTime\":1743016300},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Right on. We just got like 4 1/2 feet in the last week. But it''s that March \",\"startTime\":1743016301,\"endTime\":1743016305},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"snow that melts pretty quickly because it''s warm. So it''s it''s kind of fun. \",\"startTime\":1743016305,\"endTime\":1743016309},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Have you? So I''m guessing this is the first time in this zone. There''s little \",\"startTime\":1743016312,\"endTime\":1743016314},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"prompts on the bottom that tell us kind of what to focus on. The whole thing''s \",\"startTime\":1743016314,\"endTime\":1743016317},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"probably about 15 minutes. \",\"startTime\":1743016317,\"endTime\":1743016319},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, OK.\",\"startTime\":1743016317,\"endTime\":1743016318},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"And the first one that asked me is what it What''s something besides becoming fluent in AI? \",\"startTime\":1743016320,\"endTime\":1743016325},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"That you''re working on? What are you learning about?\",\"startTime\":1743016326,\"endTime\":1743016327},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Besides AI.\",\"startTime\":1743016328,\"endTime\":1743016328},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So I teach three different classes. I have a world history class. I''m at high \",\"startTime\":1743016330,\"endTime\":1743016334},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"school. Are you OK? \",\"startTime\":1743016334,\"endTime\":1743016338},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Me too, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1743016339,\"endTime\":1743016340},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"OK, so I have world history. I have a fusion.\",\"startTime\":1743016339,\"endTime\":1743016343},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Of geography and world history. So it''s kind of a cultural geography.\",\"startTime\":1743016343,\"endTime\":1743016348},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Indiana decided to do their own thing, so like, they wrote their own standards. \",\"startTime\":1743016349,\"endTime\":1743016352},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"It''s great. It''s actually a fun class. I love it. \",\"startTime\":1743016352,\"endTime\":1743016355},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And then I have a sheltered U.S. history class, so only for our English language \",\"startTime\":1743016356,\"endTime\":1743016360},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Cool.\",\"startTime\":1743016357,\"endTime\":1743016357},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"learners and since they have a little background. \",\"startTime\":1743016360,\"endTime\":1743016365},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And this is the first year having that.\",\"startTime\":1743016366,\"endTime\":1743016368},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1743016369,\"endTime\":1743016369},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"That is totally an experiment.\",\"startTime\":1743016370,\"endTime\":1743016373},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And I love it. It''s great.\",\"startTime\":1743016374,\"endTime\":1743016375},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I''ll be curious to hear how you''re using, how you''re leveraging AI to facilitate translation and stuff like that. I wonder if that''s part of. \",\"startTime\":1743016375,\"endTime\":1743016382},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"I do all the time.\",\"startTime\":1743016382,\"endTime\":1743016383},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Like do you do it for kids or do you teach kids to do it for themselves \",\"startTime\":1743016384,\"endTime\":1743016387},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"or somewhere between? \",\"startTime\":1743016387,\"endTime\":1743016391},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Cool. Yeah, similar.\",\"startTime\":1743016391,\"endTime\":1743016392},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"CS go umm.\",\"startTime\":1743016393,\"endTime\":1743016394},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So do you use PowerPoint I''m assuming?\",\"startTime\":1743016395,\"endTime\":1743016398},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"I don''t use much PowerPoint. Umm yeah I''m I''m kinda.\",\"startTime\":1743016399,\"endTime\":1743016403},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1743016401,\"endTime\":1743016401},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"One of the things that I use is like I have in PowerPoint. It can translate \",\"startTime\":1743016404,\"endTime\":1743016408},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"like live translate for you as you talk. \",\"startTime\":1743016408,\"endTime\":1743016412},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Oh wow.\",\"startTime\":1743016413,\"endTime\":1743016414},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And uh-huh, it is game changing.\",\"startTime\":1743016414,\"endTime\":1743016418},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"So kids are like on a helicopter overhead.\",\"startTime\":1743016418,\"endTime\":1743016423},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"So kids are like, you''re presenting and they have something in front of them too, and it''s translating just for them. \",\"startTime\":1743016424,\"endTime\":1743016431},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So there''s options.\",\"startTime\":1743016432,\"endTime\":1743016433},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"In a class where I have a couple of kids who have different languages.\",\"startTime\":1743016435,\"endTime\":1743016441},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"That need that lower level translation they can scan in on a QR code and then it will live translate in their language on their device or in some of my classes I have just like mostly Spanish. \",\"startTime\":1743016441,\"endTime\":1743016458},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And then it puts subtitles in Spanish as I am teaching.\",\"startTime\":1743016460,\"endTime\":1743016466},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"On the screen, it is a game changer.\",\"startTime\":1743016467,\"endTime\":1743016470},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Thank you. All right, That''s going to make tomorrow better. Like, seriously. \",\"startTime\":1743016470,\"endTime\":1743016475},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Not sure why I have to go through, but let''s keep going on the on the prompting here. I think we''ll get to dig into that a little bit. \",\"startTime\":1743016475,\"endTime\":1743016480},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s super cool.\",\"startTime\":1743016482,\"endTime\":1743016483},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"So any questions about the like orienting to what you''re looking at first real quick, do you want to know how to drive this thing? You can ignore the web app. \",\"startTime\":1743016486,\"endTime\":1743016493},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"We''re just looking at the app duo thing and there''s like a more button that''s like for a little bit more. And then and then there''s we''ll have cards. So like \",\"startTime\":1743016493,\"endTime\":1743016500},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Sure.\",\"startTime\":1743016499,\"endTime\":1743016500},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"like 4 chapters or five chapters of the conversation. \",\"startTime\":1743016500,\"endTime\":1743016504},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1743016507,\"endTime\":1743016507},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Uh, yeah. Any any other questions as you move through it?\",\"startTime\":1743016508,\"endTime\":1743016511},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Like as it like I think.\",\"startTime\":1743016511,\"endTime\":1743016512},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Now it seems pretty straightforward.\",\"startTime\":1743016514,\"endTime\":1743016515},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Cool so I got already 1 tip here but in general how has AI changed your work as an educator or educators so far? \",\"startTime\":1743016517,\"endTime\":1743016525},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"AI has made.\",\"startTime\":1743016531,\"endTime\":1743016532},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Teaching this ENL class possible?\",\"startTime\":1743016533,\"endTime\":1743016536},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Do you guys use WIDA? Like WIDA scores? OK, so for us it''s.\",\"startTime\":1743016537,\"endTime\":1743016542},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Basically gives us an understanding of where kids are in their language understanding. \",\"startTime\":1743016544,\"endTime\":1743016549},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And so 5 being essentially fluent and academically capable and a one being.\",\"startTime\":1743016550,\"endTime\":1743016556},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"They probably speak no English, or maybe they can ask to go to the bathroom kind of thing. \",\"startTime\":1743016556,\"endTime\":1743016562},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"No.\",\"startTime\":1743016562,\"endTime\":1743016563},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"So I have kids who are anywhere from a 1 1/2, so here maybe a couple of months or less, two kids who are a four and a half who have been here for a couple of years or have English skills elsewhere. \",\"startTime\":1743016563,\"endTime\":1743016578},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"All in the same classroom in that U.S. history class.\",\"startTime\":1743016579,\"endTime\":1743016582},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"And so I have to provide different levels of content.\",\"startTime\":1743016584,\"endTime\":1743016589},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"For them because of that and AI has made that more possible. So I''ll take my \",\"startTime\":1743016590,\"endTime\":1743016595},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"regular U.S. history curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1743016595,\"endTime\":1743016599},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Use AI to reduce it to a.\",\"startTime\":1743016601,\"endTime\":1743016604},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Probably a 6th grade level and then reduce it again down to a second or third grade level for my lower level kids and then it also then. \",\"startTime\":1743016605,\"endTime\":1743016614},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Differentiates my activities and my, you know, anything else that I''m using for them in that sense. So it has saved me. \",\"startTime\":1743016615,\"endTime\":1743016627},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Otherwise this class would be so much harder.\",\"startTime\":1743016629,\"endTime\":1743016631},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Hmm. Yes, I''m hearing like a lot of like that like.\",\"startTime\":1743016629,\"endTime\":1743016632},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"Lexile level.\",\"startTime\":1743016632,\"endTime\":1743016634},{\"speaker\":\"9738\",\"text\":\"In service.\",\"startTime\":1743016634,\"endTime\":1743016635},{\"speaker\":\"11956\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1743016