	('92c514af-d274-4ecd-b62c-9c874300b5d0', '5a8ff088-2eb6-45c7-84d7-d40f066b7a20', '137158', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"My name is David Olson. I''m a fifth grade math and science teacher here at Manson \",\"startTime\":1740070527,\"endTime\":1740070531},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Elementary in Manson, WA. \",\"startTime\":1740070531,\"endTime\":1740070534},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Really had a great time learning about lovable dot dev and one of the things I really wanted to learn is how can I leverage it more to create websites and some tools and things like that. I think it''d be awesome to. \",\"startTime\":1740070534,\"endTime\":1740070545},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Have a website that''s really dedicated for my students learning that they can access. \",\"startTime\":1740070545,\"endTime\":1740070550},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"And have some tools there, some videos to watch things like that. So that''s, \",\"startTime\":1740070551,\"endTime\":1740070554},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"that''s the overall goal of what I''m looking for. \",\"startTime\":1740070554,\"endTime\":1740070557},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Where is a.\",\"startTime\":1740070612,\"endTime\":1740070614},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"And learning. I would say that I''m trying to empower children to take initiative \",\"startTime\":1740070614,\"endTime\":1740070617},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"with their education. \",\"startTime\":1740070617,\"endTime\":1740070620},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Teaching is a second career for me. I was a mechanical engineer for 15 years \",\"startTime\":1740070621,\"endTime\":1740070626},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"and so having been in the, you know, the industry and working as an engineer. \",\"startTime\":1740070626,\"endTime\":1740070630},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Umm, yeah, I''ve got a I''ve got a good view on, you know, what kind of education is necessary to get into. \",\"startTime\":1740070631,\"endTime\":1740070637},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"More complex advanced career fields and I really want to share that with my students. \",\"startTime\":1740070638,\"endTime\":1740070642},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"And really instill that that love of learning so that they can they can be that lifelong learner that is going to be so advantageous to them in their future. \",\"startTime\":1740070642,\"endTime\":1740070651},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"As far as a primary flow activity, I don''t know what what I do for fun.\",\"startTime\":1740070675,\"endTime\":1740070679},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Personally, it''s fishing. I love being in the outdoors and.\",\"startTime\":1740070679,\"endTime\":1740070683},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"It''s it doesn''t get better than that and really, really enjoy.\",\"startTime\":1740070683,\"endTime\":1740070687},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Being turned by nature and you know, kind of getting into a groove with all kinds of fishing, with ice fishing or fly fishing, spin fishing, you name it. \",\"startTime\":1740070687,\"endTime\":1740070695},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"So as far as in the classroom though, you know, I really like to have number talks with the kids. I think it''s great to see how everyone''s brain works differently \",\"startTime\":1740070695,\"endTime\":1740070702},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"to solve a similar problem. And I think that that sharing of that mentality \",\"startTime\":1740070702,\"endTime\":1740070706},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"can be really. \",\"startTime\":1740070706,\"endTime\":1740070710},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"Great for helping other students see things through a different lens and even in ways that can help them understand a concept better. So I guess those would \",\"startTime\":1740070710,\"endTime\":1740070718},{\"speaker\":\"11856\",\"text\":\"be kind of the two different ways, professionally and personally. \",\"startTime\":1740070718,\"endTime\":1740070722}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.43793+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.43793+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 132, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.412Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('ba44a3c0-49b7-4834-8a6c-886134316bb7', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '137362', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"How''s it going? My name''s Jeff. I''m a high school counselor. I''m also a technology. \",\"startTime\":1740799952,\"endTime\":1740799956},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"And I love to integrate new technology within my practice as a counselor, help other counselors do the same. And so I am hoping to be able to connect with \",\"startTime\":1740799956,\"endTime\":1740799966},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"others to learn new ways of integrating technology within. \",\"startTime\":1740799966,\"endTime\":1740799971},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Educational Practice.\",\"startTime\":1740799972,\"endTime\":1740799973},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"From I work in the front office at school and you know, I''m really interested in learning about AI tools that are out there. \",\"startTime\":1740799974,\"endTime\":1740799981},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Let''s do it in the two.\",\"startTime\":1740799983,\"endTime\":1740799985},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Forget the name of the tool.\",\"startTime\":1740799987,\"endTime\":1740799988},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Love labs or something like that.\",\"startTime\":1740799991,\"endTime\":1740799992},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Really lovely using ChatGPT and some other tools like Claude. And so I''m I''m \",\"startTime\":1740799993,\"endTime\":1740799997},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"just interested in connecting with those that share a passion for trying new things and new tools and being able to expand on that into our work as educators. \",\"startTime\":1740799997,\"endTime\":1740800006},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Well, as I''m not a classroom teacher necessarily, I maybe have a slightly different perspective and some of those that are in the classroom every day. But I do \",\"startTime\":1740800042,\"endTime\":1740800051},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"think that my perspective as counselor helps to. \",\"startTime\":1740800051,\"endTime\":1740800056},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Understand a little bit better, and I do believe that right now in education, the adults often hold too much of the onus. \",\"startTime\":1740800056,\"endTime\":1740800067},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"To have students succeed.\",\"startTime\":1740800072,\"endTime\":1740800074},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"And I think that we are potentially out of balance in that sense. I think that \",\"startTime\":1740800074,\"endTime\":1740800077},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"we''ve taken a lot of the responsibility, at least at the high school level off of the students and. \",\"startTime\":1740800077,\"endTime\":1740800085},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Tend to focus on either end of the spectrum in terms of students who are achieving highly or students who are struggling greatly. \",\"startTime\":1740800088,\"endTime\":1740800094},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"We oftentimes leave some of the folks who we can move probably the most in the middle behind. And so that''s one thing that I would. \",\"startTime\":1740800095,\"endTime\":1740800101},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Wish that I had a better answer and a solution for and and maybe through this platform I can start to consider that and think about. \",\"startTime\":1740800103,\"endTime\":1740800109},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Ways to tackle that hidden and forgotten middle.\",\"startTime\":1740800109,\"endTime\":1740800112},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"But it''s something that I struggle with is, you know, I feel like sometimes the adults are doing so much of the work and heavy lifting that it has potentially backfired. And on our support for students. \",\"startTime\":1740800112,\"endTime\":1740800123},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Probably cooking is my definite activity. I enjoy creativity.\",\"startTime\":1740800161,\"endTime\":1740800165},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Not necessarily a chore for me to cook, kind of the main.\",\"startTime\":1740800165,\"endTime\":1740800168},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"In our household and it''s something that I do to relax to.\",\"startTime\":1740800169,\"endTime\":1740800174},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"That dominion of that kitchen in that space and so, but it also allows me to. \",\"startTime\":1740800176,\"endTime\":1740800182},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"Both be creative and follow a set of rules and expectations. I''m not really \",\"startTime\":1740800182,\"endTime\":1740800186},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"a recipe follower, which is why I don''t do a kind of baking. \",\"startTime\":1740800186,\"endTime\":1740800190},{\"speaker\":\"11911\",\"text\":\"But I do typically use a recipe for some sort of inspiration and then kind of invalid along the way depending on what I feel like or what I''ve done in the past. \",\"startTime\":1740800191,\"endTime\":1740800200}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.705721+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.705721+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 192, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.690Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('856b5ec0-e5b2-4088-a30a-4072eb4d4e17', '1437c66b-ec40-4d5f-ae09-61eaf239da58', '137242', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Learner from 2001. In 2001 I was in 10th grade and I was learning.\",\"startTime\":1740438013,\"endTime\":1740438019},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"As a student As a capital S student in high school in Petaluma, CA.\",\"startTime\":1740438019,\"endTime\":1740438025},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Umm, I now teach.\",\"startTime\":1740438027,\"endTime\":1740438029},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"People that have more guts than they would.\",\"startTime\":1740438030,\"endTime\":1740438032},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Without me, uh, how to skip steps?\",\"startTime\":1740438033,\"endTime\":1740438035},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Had a drop in, had to point their skis straight downhill.\",\"startTime\":1740438038,\"endTime\":1740438041},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I want to learn.\",\"startTime\":1740438042,\"endTime\":1740438043},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"How to be more effective in that and how to make my impact scale and help us go faster towards wherever it is that we''re going? \",\"startTime\":1740438044,\"endTime\":1740438050},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I say, what might I say? I might say Fast forward leaning, standing tall when \",\"startTime\":1740438064,\"endTime\":1740438067},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I''m at my best. \",\"startTime\":1740438067,\"endTime\":1740438070},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Student centered.\",\"startTime\":1740438070,\"endTime\":1740438072},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Tech forward.\",\"startTime\":1740438074,\"endTime\":1740438075},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Uh, rhythmic. There''s a lot of cadence in my teaching, uh.\",\"startTime\":1740438079,\"endTime\":1740438082},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Like the analogy of.\",\"startTime\":1740438083,\"endTime\":1740438085},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"And I think that teachers are incredible.\",\"startTime\":1740438086,\"endTime\":1740438089},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I think that learners are everywhere and can be motivated by good teachers or by good experiences. \",\"startTime\":1740438090,\"endTime\":1740438097},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Eat, eat, eat apples and bananas.\",\"startTime\":1740438108,\"endTime\":1740438111},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I like to eat, eat, eat those apples, those bananas.\",\"startTime\":1740438111,\"endTime\":1740438115},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I love to oat oat oat, those opals and bononos.\",\"startTime\":1740438116,\"endTime\":1740438120},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"I like to sing songs.\",\"startTime\":1740438121,\"endTime\":1740438123},{\"speaker\":\"11898\",\"text\":\"Play guitar and go skiing.\",\"startTime\":1740438123,\"endTime\":1740438126}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.878092+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.878092+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 103, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.846Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('1edf68d7-a63f-4f88-bcba-e31773cf9dc4', 'bd47a56c-b275-4972-987f-30b0cd993f17', '138038', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Hello.\",\"startTime\":1744212401,\"endTime\":1744212401},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Let me do.\",\"startTime\":1744212404,\"endTime\":1744212405},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hey, hey, hey.\",\"startTime\":1744212409,\"endTime\":1744212410},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, you lagged out a little bit.\",\"startTime\":1744212416,\"endTime\":1744212418},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Let''s go try. Do you know?\",\"startTime\":1744212418,\"endTime\":1744212420},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"In the app to headphones.\",\"startTime\":1744212420,\"endTime\":1744212422},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Also.\",\"startTime\":1744212426,\"endTime\":1744212426},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1744212426,\"endTime\":1744212427},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. Be your partner. Hey, Tom.\",\"startTime\":1744212429,\"endTime\":1744212433},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Hey, can you hear me?\",\"startTime\":1744212434,\"endTime\":1744212436},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yes, I can hear you now.\",\"startTime\":1744212438,\"endTime\":1744212439},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Sweet umm.\",\"startTime\":1744212441,\"endTime\":1744212442},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Do you know how I swear?\",\"startTime\":1744212443,\"endTime\":1744212444},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Go to my headphones.\",\"startTime\":1744212445,\"endTime\":1744212446},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"If my phone''s connected to it already, oh, for whatever reason it''s here. Got \",\"startTime\":1744212447,\"endTime\":1744212449},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"it. I''m ready, Rock. \",\"startTime\":1744212449,\"endTime\":1744212451},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, ready to go? OK, Greet your partner and then press more. Hi, Tom. \",\"startTime\":1744212454,\"endTime\":1744212458},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"First experience using an AI tool.\",\"startTime\":1744212463,\"endTime\":1744212466},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"First of all, thank you, Abduo for the grounding question.\",\"startTime\":1744212473,\"endTime\":1744212475},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Do you want to go first?\",\"startTime\":1744212479,\"endTime\":1744212481},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, either one, go for it.\",\"startTime\":1744212481,\"endTime\":1744212484},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I can''t really.\",\"startTime\":1744212486,\"endTime\":1744212487},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I mean, I''m doing that thing where I''m just thinking about when was the first time that I got on ChatGPT. \",\"startTime\":1744212491,\"endTime\":1744212497},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I don''t know if that''s the right question.\",\"startTime\":1744212499,\"endTime\":1744212500},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh well, tell me about chat TPT. This is great feedback for the question. I \",\"startTime\":1744212501,\"endTime\":1744212505},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"think we should update the question to one of your first experiences. \",\"startTime\":1744212505,\"endTime\":1744212509},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"One of my first experiences was a year ago sorry probably last November.\",\"startTime\":1744212510,\"endTime\":1744212516},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"After like.\",\"startTime\":1744212519,\"endTime\":1744212520},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Messing around with it for a minute, I threw a kid on ChatGPT to help her create a business plan. \",\"startTime\":1744212522,\"endTime\":1744212527},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744212529,\"endTime\":1744212529},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"For this idea she had, and ultimately what she.\",\"startTime\":1744212530,\"endTime\":1744212533},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And I, I kind of knew this going into it, but what she really wanted to do was to impress her dad. \",\"startTime\":1744212534,\"endTime\":1744212538},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1744212540,\"endTime\":1744212540},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So so in my mind I was like fuck it, I don''t care, there''s no cheating here because all you really want to do is impress and connect with your dad. So let''s \",\"startTime\":1744212541,\"endTime\":1744212548},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"chat GP the hell out of this so you can impress your dad. \",\"startTime\":1744212548,\"endTime\":1744212551},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I love it.\",\"startTime\":1744212553,\"endTime\":1744212554},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, by the way, I learned something in here. If the card questions in the way \",\"startTime\":1744212556,\"endTime\":1744212560},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"of the person that you''re chatting with, you just touch the screen like on their face or something, not on the card, and then it goes away and then you can touch it again and it comes back. \",\"startTime\":1744212560,\"endTime\":1744212571},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, that''s cool. How was that experience helping the kid? Like you just, \",\"startTime\":1744212573,\"endTime\":1744212576},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"like, chatted? \",\"startTime\":1744212576,\"endTime\":1744212579},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Would you say use ChatGPT the hell out of it?\",\"startTime\":1744212580,\"endTime\":1744212583},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s on the chat cheap between the Halo so you can press your dad. And \",\"startTime\":1744212582,\"endTime\":1744212585},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"I didn''t see that to her because that was like anyways, like I was like the adult in the situation saying let''s use this tool to actually get to the real goal. \",\"startTime\":1744212585,\"endTime\":1744212592},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And it like totally it. It helped her.\",\"startTime\":1744212596,\"endTime\":1744212601},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744212600,\"endTime\":1744212600},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Have a conversation with her dad about.\",\"startTime\":1744212602,\"endTime\":1744212605},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Going to college because she was a senior last year.\",\"startTime\":1744212607,\"endTime\":1744212609},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And it just sort of like.\",\"startTime\":1744212609,\"endTime\":1744212613},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Elevated the whole thing and I mean there were so many layers of like parents are divorced and. \",\"startTime\":1744212613,\"endTime\":1744212618},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh cool.\",\"startTime\":1744212618,\"endTime\":1744212618},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You know, like some deep misogyny and all that. Like, like there''s all that \",\"startTime\":1744212619,\"endTime\":1744212621},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"type of stuff that was. \",\"startTime\":1744212621,\"endTime\":1744212623},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"At play and so it was just a cool vehicle to get to something really important and it helped her have a great conversation with her dad about. \",\"startTime\":1744212624,\"endTime\":1744212632},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Colleges. And he was like, oh, you''re for real, like.\",\"startTime\":1744212633,\"endTime\":1744212636},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You could actually go and do stuff as opposed to just being like an objectified female, which is what he was. That''s how kind of he looked into the world. So \",\"startTime\":1744212636,\"endTime\":1744212642},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"anyways, it was so like, honestly, from that point on, I was like, yes, more of this, please. \",\"startTime\":1744212642,\"endTime\":1744212648},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow that''s such a cool story of hearing that AI was a tool that really empowered a girl to stand tall and show her dad that she has identity and agency of her own. \",\"startTime\":1744212650,\"endTime\":1744212663},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And she is. She''s capable. That''s way cool.\",\"startTime\":1744212665,\"endTime\":1744212668},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744212668,\"endTime\":1744212668},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ll go with the.\",\"startTime\":1744212669,\"endTime\":1744212671},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"''Cause I''m not sure the AI were just good programming, but I''ll go with ChatGPT too. I was thinking about the other predictions on phones and swipe technology, \",\"startTime\":1744212673,\"endTime\":1744212682},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"which is a whole fun other conversation, but uh, I remember hopping on ChatGPT cause I''ve been reading, reading, reading about AI and what it could do and all of these things and it''s been years. I''m like, OK, this is really cool. \",\"startTime\":1744212682,\"endTime\":1744212695},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"This is really cool. Now I get to put my hands on it and uh. I. \",\"startTime\":1744212695,\"endTime\":1744212699},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I was asking it to do things with my Google Drive and suite and documents, taking lessons of curriculum that I''ve been part of and, and asking it to generate templates and then build up new lessons and all the stuff. Which today I realized \",\"startTime\":1744212700,\"endTime\":1744212715},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"takes a lot of work or programming the AI to even be able to do that. And I \",\"startTime\":1744212715,\"endTime\":1744212720},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"was imagining it could do way more super powered things than than it could do at the time. And I was really underwhelmed because. \",\"startTime\":1744212720,\"endTime\":1744212730},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Couldn''t do it. No, I can''t read your Google Drive. No, I can''t read that link. \",\"startTime\":1744212732,\"endTime\":1744212736},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, I can''t do this. I''m like, well, what can you do? And it helped me get back \",\"startTime\":1744212736,\"endTime\":1744212740},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"to the reality. Oh, yeah, there is a lot that is needing to be done. I was in \",\"startTime\":1744212740,\"endTime\":1744212744},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"the house analogy. I was like, build me a house, but not just build me a house, \",\"startTime\":1744212744,\"endTime\":1744212748},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"build me a whole development. No, not just a whole develop. Let''s build a city. \",\"startTime\":1744212748,\"endTime\":1744212752},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, not just a city. Let''s build a whole world. \",\"startTime\":1744212752,\"endTime\":1744212756},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And instead of, you know, it takes a lot of time to even draft out what your house plans are for one house and then what the environmental impact is and all these other things like the thoughtfulness that I was wanting the the AI tool to put into it. I was just imagining that this. \",\"startTime\":1744212757,\"endTime\":1744212774},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Years, this decade of work or a lifetime of work for me that I consolidate and they would be able to understand it and then be able to implement it immediately. \",\"startTime\":1744212777,\"endTime\":1744212787},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I didn''t realize how complex the world is and how complex things are. Like \",\"startTime\":1744212787,\"endTime\":1744212792},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"creating curriculum, creating really good curriculum. That''s what I was wanting \",\"startTime\":1744212792,\"endTime\":1744212797},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"it to do at that time. I forgot how complex it is because at the moment. \",\"startTime\":1744212797,\"endTime\":1744212802},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''s simple. It''s right in front of me. You just do it. Duh.\",\"startTime\":1744212803,\"endTime\":1744212806},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Teach. It''s what you know how to do.\",\"startTime\":1744212807,\"endTime\":1744212809},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I was expecting the tool to be able to catch up to speed immediately without doing the training or the grounding or using it specifically. So it was quite \",\"startTime\":1744212810,\"endTime\":1744212818},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a quite a eye opening experiment for me. \",\"startTime\":1744212818,\"endTime\":1744212823},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m going to press next. This is just the ice breaker.\",\"startTime\":1744212825,\"endTime\":1744212827},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744212828,\"endTime\":1744212829},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. And then?\",\"startTime\":1744212829,\"endTime\":1744212830},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"There was a lot of different things that I just thought about. So OK, partner \",\"startTime\":1744212829,\"endTime\":1744212832},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"ready, here we go. \",\"startTime\":1744212832,\"endTime\":1744212834},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1744212833,\"endTime\":1744212833},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Share your thoughts on real fears versus misplaced fears about using AI tools in education. Then ask your partner to add to your answer. Oh, so yours probably \",\"startTime\":1744212837,\"endTime\":1744212846},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"says Ask Jeff. \",\"startTime\":1744212846,\"endTime\":1744212850},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Ask your partner, what do you think are some real fears versus misplaced fears? \",\"startTime\":1744212851,\"endTime\":1744212855},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Listen for the information and more.\",\"startTime\":1744212856,\"endTime\":1744212859},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah. All right. OK.\",\"startTime\":1744212861,\"endTime\":1744212863},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So do I, do I click more or do I ask you that and then click more?\",\"startTime\":1744212862,\"endTime\":1744212866},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"I think you listen for what''s in the Moor.\",\"startTime\":1744212867,\"endTime\":1744212870},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK. So share my thoughts on real fears versus misplaced 1. I think a real fear \",\"startTime\":1744212873,\"endTime\":1744212876},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"is that. \",\"startTime\":1744212876,\"endTime\":1744212879},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"AI agents, assistance tools, whatever they are, will do things that we normally do in our jobs. \",\"startTime\":1744212883,\"endTime\":1744212891},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And that''s a real fear.\",\"startTime\":1744212893,\"endTime\":1744212894},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Because they can do a lot of things that we do in our jobs. But I think that''s \",\"startTime\":1744212895,\"endTime\":1744212900},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"misplaced fear that it, that the AI tool will replace us, especially as educators. \",\"startTime\":1744212900,\"endTime\":1744212905},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"It''ll just replace me as a teacher because it can just be now a tutor that that does all of these things for the kid almost instantly. Like you just mentioned \",\"startTime\":1744212905,\"endTime\":1744212915},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"the the student, she used GPT to ChatGPT to help write her business. \",\"startTime\":1744212915,\"endTime\":1744212920},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Plan. Well, where''s the teacher then? Then I think that''s the misplaced fear \",\"startTime\":1744212923,\"endTime\":1744212926},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"is that we will we will be replaced. \",\"startTime\":1744212926,\"endTime\":1744212928},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I think if our jobs are allocated and our roles and the things that we do, our menial repetitive tasks. \",\"startTime\":1744212930,\"endTime\":1744212936},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Can just be functionally programmed. When the student says or does A, then output \",\"startTime\":1744212939,\"endTime\":1744212943},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"B. If that''s what we''re doing in our jobs, in our work, then then we''re not \",\"startTime\":1744212943,\"endTime\":1744212947},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"being creative or we''re not being human in the way that we should be. \",\"startTime\":1744212947,\"endTime\":1744212951},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And I think we need to change our jobs. But that''s my first thought on the fears. \",\"startTime\":1744212952,\"endTime\":1744212956},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Alright, umm.\",\"startTime\":1744212961,\"endTime\":1744212961},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m looking at them more now.\",\"startTime\":1744212962,\"endTime\":1744212964},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"How about your thoughts on it?\",\"startTime\":1744212971,\"endTime\":1744212972},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"You just like made me think about.\",\"startTime\":1744212975,\"endTime\":1744212977},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You want to share?\",\"startTime\":1744212983,\"endTime\":1744212984},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Start the edge on the right shoes for a second. Umm.\",\"startTime\":1744212986,\"endTime\":1744212988},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"One yes, yeah, I''m gonna share should I click more though first to like stay true to the to the experience. \",\"startTime\":1744212988,\"endTime\":1744212994},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, no, go with it.\",\"startTime\":1744212994,\"endTime\":1744212995},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"No, the experiences we get to drive the conversation.\",\"startTime\":1744212996,\"endTime\":1744212998},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right.\",\"startTime\":1744212999,\"endTime\":1744213000},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"What what that just made me think about was that I agree that that is a fear and it''s misplaced. And what is like if you get to the root of what is misplaced \",\"startTime\":1744213001,\"endTime\":1744213011},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"there, and the fear is that teachers don''t value what they do. \",\"startTime\":1744213011,\"endTime\":1744213017},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"So in other words, like if you think you''re going to get replaced by ChatGPT, Chat cheap or whatever, AI is going to replace menial repetitive tasks. And \",\"startTime\":1744213022,\"endTime\":1744213029},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Hmm, tell me more about that.\",\"startTime\":1744213022,\"endTime\":1744213025},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"if that''s the only thing that we do as teachers and if that''s our most important thing. \",\"startTime\":1744213029,\"endTime\":1744213036},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"Then yes, that probably would be replaced or be replaceable through some some technology and some chat bots and blah blah blah. \",\"startTime\":1744213038,\"endTime\":1744213045},{\"speaker\":\"11890\",\"text\":\"And so if that''s like where you''re stuck and then that''s like what you think you do and that''s the value you bring, and that''s how you look at your work. \",\"startTime\":1744213046,\"endTime\":1744213054},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1744213056,\"endTime\":1744213057},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Wow, you made me think when you were saying that about the teachers who teach kids to do menial, repetitive tasks. \",\"startTime\":1744213060,\"endTime\":1744213070},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"If my job is to teach kids, for example, how to solve a 2 step equation for the quadratic formula through this process of repetitive simple tasks procedures that you can mimic? \",\"startTime\":1744213072,\"endTime\":1744213086},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Then my job is is gone. What? What''s my value?\",\"startTime\":1744213090