 then suddenly. \",\"startTime\":1745345045,\"endTime\":1745345048},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345045,\"endTime\":1745345046},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"You went through too far. You went too far. And then it''s usually it''s it''s \",\"startTime\":1745345049,\"endTime\":1745345054},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"a good idea to start all over, but with renewed problems statement or something like that. Yeah, that''s, that''s what I do. Do you do? \",\"startTime\":1745345054,\"endTime\":1745345062},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think Speaking of like home improvement in Brick Lane and things like that, it''s, it''s to me, it''s almost like going to the hardware store and I''m talking to somebody there to to find my answers or to get help on something. \",\"startTime\":1745345062,\"endTime\":1745345078},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And sometimes we''re talking for too long and it''s not happening. It''s not working. \",\"startTime\":1745345078,\"endTime\":1745345082},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"They''re not seeing what I''m seeing. Or we''re off target and we''re doing something \",\"startTime\":1745345082,\"endTime\":1745345085},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"else and you''re like, Oh my God. \",\"startTime\":1745345085,\"endTime\":1745345088},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And then you come back to the point which you''re trying to get. I just need \",\"startTime\":1745345088,\"endTime\":1745345090},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"paint. \",\"startTime\":1745345090,\"endTime\":1745345092},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m gonna go talk to somebody else. And it helps in that way because you have \",\"startTime\":1745345093,\"endTime\":1745345098},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, no.\",\"startTime\":1745345096,\"endTime\":1745345098},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"a, as a user, a fresher perspective of what you''re trying to do. So you can \",\"startTime\":1745345098,\"endTime\":1745345102},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"articulate it better. You can have a better prompt. And then also it''s fresher \",\"startTime\":1745345102,\"endTime\":1745345106},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"for them. So not all the other stuff is in the way. So you can really hone in \",\"startTime\":1745345106,\"endTime\":1745345110},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"on what you''re trying to do. Yeah, I like it. OK, These are fun. I would, I \",\"startTime\":1745345110,\"endTime\":1745345115},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"would do one of these almost every day with you. But we have other work to do. \",\"startTime\":1745345115,\"endTime\":1745345119},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Um, OK, uh, I''m going to say done on this one and then you''re ready and then thank your partner. Oh, I learned one thing from you today. Uh, thanks Diego, \",\"startTime\":1745345121,\"endTime\":1745345129},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"but it''s about the tokens. \",\"startTime\":1745345129,\"endTime\":1745345132},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745345132,\"endTime\":1745345133},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I know that there were some things about tokens, but I didn''t know it was like that and that we''ve gone from numbers like 4000 tokens to over 1,000,000. And \",\"startTime\":1745345133,\"endTime\":1745345141},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that''s such a huge difference. I see that experientially as amusing the AI tools \",\"startTime\":1745345141,\"endTime\":1745345146},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that I hadn''t even thought about it in that regard and why they''re they''re short term memory is as it is. Yeah. So thanks for that. \",\"startTime\":1745345146,\"endTime\":1745345154},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, because token. A token by definition right now, is 3/4 of a word of an \",\"startTime\":1745345154,\"endTime\":1745345158},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"English word. \",\"startTime\":1745345158,\"endTime\":1745345162},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So it''s a 3/4 of an English word. So if you have like.\",\"startTime\":1745345164,\"endTime\":1745345168},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Hello. That''s, uh, you have like 3 fourth tokens, right? Something like that. \",\"startTime\":1745345168,\"endTime\":1745345175},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So a million tokens would be like 700,000 words, right? So that''s the right. \",\"startTime\":1745345175,\"endTime\":1745345181},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So in the other umm.\",\"startTime\":1745345183,\"endTime\":1745345185},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Interesting.\",\"startTime\":1745345183,\"endTime\":1745345183},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Measurement is input tokens and output tokens.\",\"startTime\":1745345186,\"endTime\":1745345191},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Input tokens are cheaper than output tokens in newer models.\",\"startTime\":1745345191,\"endTime\":1745345196},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"So, uh, the other day as, uh, I was doing something for, for, for Chile.\",\"startTime\":1745345197,\"endTime\":1745345203},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And and suddenly I started playing with Gemini 2.5, which is the latest Google \",\"startTime\":1745345205,\"endTime\":1745345211},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"model. And suddenly I see my bail because you can you connect it to your bill. \",\"startTime\":1745345211,\"endTime\":1745345217},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And in a few hours of coding, I spent $100 in, in codes like in tokens, I mean. \",\"startTime\":1745345217,\"endTime\":1745345222},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And it was what the, uh, you know, it was like, OK, I''m going to turn it up like. \",\"startTime\":1745345223,\"endTime\":1745345228},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345226,\"endTime\":1745345226},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I don''t understand.\",\"startTime\":1745345229,\"endTime\":1745345231},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Turn it off. Turn it off.\",\"startTime\":1745345230,\"endTime\":1745345231},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1745345233,\"endTime\":1745345234},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Can you imagine the parents now with their teenage kids who are doing programming and their their parents gave them the credit card and now they''re like 500 or $1000 a day that they''re it''s like, it''s like the old Internet or cell phones for international calling them. I''m calling my friend in in Connecticut''s \",\"startTime\":1745345234,\"endTime\":1745345250},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"long distance. You can''t talk with with with Diego all day long. We don''t have \",\"startTime\":1745345250,\"endTime\":1745345254},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345252,\"endTime\":1745345253},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the money. \",\"startTime\":1745345254,\"endTime\":1745345258},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Was it was it like that before, uh, calling in between state? It was, it was \",\"startTime\":1745345259,\"endTime\":1745345262},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"considered like long distance. \",\"startTime\":1745345262,\"endTime\":1745345265},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345262,\"endTime\":1745345263},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"It was long distance. Yeah, like my sister.\",\"startTime\":1745345266,\"endTime\":1745345268},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I''m 53 and my sister''s 43, and she''s blind. She''s from Guatemala. And so she \",\"startTime\":1745345269,\"endTime\":1745345273},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"loved talking on the phone. So when she was a teenager and she would go like, \",\"startTime\":1745345273,\"endTime\":1745345276},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"she went to blind camp in the summer and she would meet these people from all over the States and she would want to connect with them. And then so it''s easy \",\"startTime\":1745345276,\"endTime\":1745345284},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"on the phone. You just like pick up the phone and talk. And my dad would tell \",\"startTime\":1745345284,\"endTime\":1745345288},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"the stories about their, their phone bill and he''d be like you. And they would \",\"startTime\":1745345288,\"endTime\":1745345291},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"argue back and forth. And she''s just like a teenager. I just want to talk to \",\"startTime\":1745345291,\"endTime\":1745345295},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"my friends. \",\"startTime\":1745345295,\"endTime\":1745345299},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I have here similar stories, but even.\",\"startTime\":1745345300,\"endTime\":1745345302},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745345300,\"endTime\":1745345300},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Less significant, like a kid.\",\"startTime\":1745345303,\"endTime\":1745345306},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"A A a parent giving access to the, uh, to the credit card connected to your cell phone to your kid, and then the kid buying skins for a video game and spending like crazy amounts of money in video games. So it''s not new. \",\"startTime\":1745345306,\"endTime\":1745345321},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s not new. Nope, Nope.\",\"startTime\":1745345321,\"endTime\":1745345323},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, Diego, thanks. Let me know how this works with transcript stuff. \",\"startTime\":1745345324,\"endTime\":1745345329},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And I want to give a thumbs up for text output though on our new version on the admin panel, when we download a tech or a transcript, if it''s in a TXT file format, it''s faster, simpler and the the robots read it better. When we would \",\"startTime\":1745345329,\"endTime\":1745345344},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745345340,\"endTime\":1745345343},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"use AVT format like on up below when you download it from up Duo, which you can see it does do. \",\"startTime\":1745345344,\"endTime\":1745345354},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Format which is great for some things, but I found that my bots were hallucinating because it wouldn''t always read it correctly or it wouldn''t go through the process of even reading it. So a text file is way faster and easier for all things. \",\"startTime\":1745345354,\"endTime\":1745345367},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745345363,\"endTime\":1745345363},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"I think it''s.\",\"startTime\":1745345367,\"endTime\":1745345368},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Text. It''s a text file, yeah, no, right now you can download uh.\",\"startTime\":1745345369,\"endTime\":1745345374},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Umm, TXT files? Yeah, I''m gonna send you a screenshot right now.\",\"startTime\":1745345375,\"endTime\":1745345379},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah. OK, great. Yeah, I know we can do that. Currently in our admin panel when \",\"startTime\":1745345380,\"endTime\":1745345384},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"we download it, it is a TXT file. So as you''re figuring and and fiddling TXT \",\"startTime\":1745345384,\"endTime\":1745345388},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"file would be the preference. That''s the best and this great. All right, Anything \",\"startTime\":1745345388,\"endTime\":1745345392},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Hey.\",\"startTime\":1745345391,\"endTime\":1745345391},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"else? \",\"startTime\":1745345392,\"endTime\":1745345396},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"That''s great. See you. No, we''re good.\",\"startTime\":1745345394,\"endTime\":1745345396},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"OK, awesome. Thanks, Diego.\",\"startTime\":1745345397,\"endTime\":1745345399}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.375752+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.375752+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1161, "created_at": "2025-04-30T2