Or that what you''re talking about for poetry?\",\"startTime\":1741726075,\"endTime\":1741726077},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"And then helping to just process it with our emotions in that somatic, like what''s in our body, what''s going on here and thinking about that and how to express I''m just like you helped pique my interest into that. \",\"startTime\":1741726078,\"endTime\":1741726089},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"So I would say fully learned it, but you''ve, you''ve helped me open my eyes to that, that notion of I guess I''ve learned that there''s something very embody about not just our emotions, which are in our head, but the whole body aspect and how we can express it through poetry and how healthy that can be. So thank \",\"startTime\":1741726089,\"endTime\":1741726105},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1741726090,\"endTime\":1741726090},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you for that. \",\"startTime\":1741726105,\"endTime\":1741726109},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, awesome. Yeah, No, I''m, I''ve always appreciate our talks together.\",\"startTime\":1741726110,\"endTime\":1741726114},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Oh, you''re welcome. You''re welcome. I love him too. Thank you so much. After \",\"startTime\":1741726114,\"endTime\":1741726118},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"this, when you, by the way, when you press end, it''s end. And then you can do \",\"startTime\":1741726118,\"endTime\":1741726121},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"a you can do a little message to me if you want to at the end. But I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1741726121,\"endTime\":1741726125},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"work. I''ll take our transcript. I get to see the video and transcript and I''ll \",\"startTime\":1741726125,\"endTime\":1741726129},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1741726127,\"endTime\":1741726127},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"put some artifacts for you into your dashboard at side by. So go to go to your \",\"startTime\":1741726129,\"endTime\":1741726132},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"my side by and then I''ll match you up because we''ve been matched. I''ll match \",\"startTime\":1741726132,\"endTime\":1741726136},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you with somebody else and you guys can figure out a time to connect for your next one. \",\"startTime\":1741726136,\"endTime\":1741726143},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You wanted to have more social time and there''s so many amazing other people out there and I''m thinking of some other cool people who are specialists in in MTSS and the work that they do there and that might be super fun. \",\"startTime\":1741726144,\"endTime\":1741726156},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"Or just other geeky math teachers. I have a couple in mind. You would love them \",\"startTime\":1741726156,\"endTime\":1741726159},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1741726157,\"endTime\":1741726158},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"and they would love you. \",\"startTime\":1741726159,\"endTime\":1741726161},{\"speaker\":\"11887\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s awesome. Oh my gosh. I''m so thankful. Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1741726162,\"endTime\":1741726165},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome. Thank you, Haley. Have a wonderful, wonderful day. Appreciate \",\"startTime\":1741726165,\"endTime\":1741726167},{\"speaker\":\"11912\",\"text\":\"you. \",\"startTime\":1741726167,\"endTime\":1741726170}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.471301+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.471301+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1121, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.437Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "190", "name": "#ai_learning_tools", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
