aker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh awesome.\",\"startTime\":1740769567,\"endTime\":1740769568},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Umm so I''m in Raleigh, NC if you ever if you''ve in the area, umm we, we have 200 schools in our county. \",\"startTime\":1740769571,\"endTime\":1740769580},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh, nice, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1740769575,\"endTime\":1740769577},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Oh wow.\",\"startTime\":1740769581,\"endTime\":1740769581},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"So I, I support about 25 schools. So if there''s anyone in the school that needs \",\"startTime\":1740769582,\"endTime\":1740769587},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"help with like, you know, anything technology like digital learning technology, not like, you know, laptops broken kind of. \",\"startTime\":1740769587,\"endTime\":1740769596},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1740769597,\"endTime\":1740769598},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"I''ll go and help them.\",\"startTime\":1740769599,\"endTime\":1740769600},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''m in Forks, WA and we have 4 schools in our entire district.\",\"startTime\":1740769603,\"endTime\":1740769609},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"Nice, nice. You know what, I I do miss that. Like that, you know, people knowing \",\"startTime\":1740769608,\"endTime\":1740769612},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1740769610,\"endTime\":1740769610},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"you on more of a personal basis. \",\"startTime\":1740769612,\"endTime\":1740769616},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"So, so I see the bottom here, there''s like a a little thing. Yeah. So it says \",\"startTime\":1740769619,\"endTime\":1740769623},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. We''ve got nice breaker.\",\"startTime\":1740769622,\"endTime\":1740769626},{\"speaker\":\"11896\",\"text\":\"greet your partner, then press more. OK Iceberg. OK, If you could have a superpower \",\"startTim