	('f45f132f-ab6b-4007-a246-e11270544423', 'db53cc1a-13b8-41ef-bc7c-401cd5851e20', '138203', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hi, Michelle, How are you?\",\"startTime\":1745254929,\"endTime\":1745254930},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Hi, Jess.\",\"startTime\":1745254930,\"endTime\":1745254931},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m good. How are you doing?\",\"startTime\":1745254931,\"endTime\":1745254932},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Good, good, it''s another sunny day. We just moved to Tucson a couple weeks ago \",\"startTime\":1745254932,\"endTime\":1745254937},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"and it''s sunny almost every day so far, so we''re loving it. \",\"startTime\":1745254937,\"endTime\":1745254941},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, nice. Yeah, we''re you can see a tiny bit of Spain out there. That''s Spain. \",\"startTime\":1745254942,\"endTime\":1745254948},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745254943,\"endTime\":1745254943},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Not much of it, not much of you.\",\"startTime\":1745254949,\"endTime\":1745254950},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, where in Spain are you?\",\"startTime\":1745254949,\"endTime\":1745254951},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"We''re in a town called Almonica, which is on the southern coast. If you were \",\"startTime\":1745254951,\"endTime\":1745254954},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to find Grenada on the map and just go straight down from there, pretty much directly down on the coast. \",\"startTime\":1745254954,\"endTime\":1745254961},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Ah, I love it.\",\"startTime\":1745254961,\"endTime\":1745254962},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I wasn''t knowing if you were in Spain or not when you said mid Europe. And I''m \",\"startTime\":1745254962,\"endTime\":1745254967},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"like, oh, I''m wondering where my wife and I and we love the area over there. \",\"startTime\":1745254967,\"endTime\":1745254972},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I was wanting us to go to Spain maybe even for a year. I was, I was pitching \",\"startTime\":1745254972,\"endTime\":1745254976},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"for Valencia pretty hard, but we we ended up landing in Tucson, so. \",\"startTime\":1745254976,\"endTime\":1745254981},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745254982,\"endTime\":1745254983},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but we''ll get to Valencia soon.\",\"startTime\":1745254984,\"endTime\":1745254986},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Probably, yes, yeah, we our plan was to come for one year and now we''re finishing our second year and Terry tearing ourselves away to the to go back to the US but at the end of the school year. But it''s been a really great adventure. We \",\"startTime\":1745254986,\"endTime\":1745254998},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Oh.\",\"startTime\":1745254996,\"endTime\":1745254998},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"have two children and that was a big part of the impetus was to get them here to learn Spanish. So they''re going to school just at the regular public school \",\"startTime\":1745254998,\"endTime\":1745255007},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"here and watching their magic that happens when when a brain, a young brain especially, is immersed in another language so and another. \",\"startTime\":1745255007,\"endTime\":1745255015},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Sure. Like they''re getting just priceless experience. So it''s been amazing.\",\"startTime\":1745255017,\"endTime\":1745255020},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. That''s awesome. Oh, wonderful. OK, I''m pressing them more because \",\"startTime\":1745255020,\"endTime\":1745255024},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255023,\"endTime\":1745255023},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it says greet your partner and then press more. \",\"startTime\":1745255024,\"endTime\":1745255028},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What''s the skill besides AI fluency that you''re working to improve?\",\"startTime\":1745255031,\"endTime\":1745255036},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"The first one that comes to mind is always. I am trying to work on kind of two \",\"startTime\":1745255036,\"endTime\":1745255041},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"big things for me. One is like just efficiency I can get so. \",\"startTime\":1745255041,\"endTime\":1745255046},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Bogged down in the details of and I''m, I''m thinking kind of specifically of like curriculum planning work or you know, I can get so bogged down in the details of that, but. \",\"startTime\":1745255050,\"endTime\":1745255059},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It causes me more stress than is necessary and I''ve been, I think because I I transitioned from just classroom teaching to a lot of coaching work in the last few years. \",\"startTime\":1745255060,\"endTime\":1745255068},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And when I would see other teachers with habits similar to mine and I would try to encourage them like you got to find your good enough point and give yourself permission to move on. And I was like, oh this is really good advice I should \",\"startTime\":1745255068,\"endTime\":1745255077},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"take as well so. \",\"startTime\":1745255077,\"endTime\":1745255080},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah. I think that''s the biggest one that I feel like I''ve made growth in, but \",\"startTime\":1745255080,\"endTime\":1745255083},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m just I''m always working on and. \",\"startTime\":1745255083,\"endTime\":1745255085},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I also think it ties into the AI tools that are now becoming available because. \",\"startTime\":1745255086,\"endTime\":1745255092},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I don''t have to get so hung up on every single word I''m trying to write.\",\"startTime\":1745255092,\"endTime\":1745255096},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I can give myself permission to get my ideas out and then use the tool that''s available, like, hey, Polish this for me, and then I can go back and revise that a bit. Yeah. How about you? \",\"startTime\":1745255096,\"endTime\":1745255106},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That oh, that resonated really hard and so many a good heart in so many ways. \",\"startTime\":1745255108,\"endTime\":1745255113},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm, for me, it''s about trying to focus. That''s a skill for because there''s \",\"startTime\":1745255113,\"endTime\":1745255118},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"so many possibilities. Like you said with the details. I see it as like an example \",\"startTime\":1745255118,\"endTime\":1745255122},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"of curriculum. If I''m chatting with an AI bot or just in general with my work, \",\"startTime\":1745255122,\"endTime\":1745255126},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I''m thinking about there''s infinite possibilities. Now, what we could do this \",\"startTime\":1745255126,\"endTime\":1745255130},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"way, we could do it this way, we could do it this way. And I see them as. \",\"startTime\":1745255130,\"endTime\":1745255135},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Things to go and to do. And. And I like how you were saying it. It''s like it''s \",\"startTime\":1745255136,\"endTime\":1745255140},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"good enough. Like you don''t have to explore all of the ends of the universe, \",\"startTime\":1745255140,\"endTime\":1745255144},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Jeff, to just pick up half to go play and to go do something. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745255144,\"endTime\":1745255148},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah. It''s, there''s some balance there between like we, we want \",\"startTime\":1745255149,\"endTime\":1745255153},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to continuously improve and that goes for our curriculum work as well. But at \",\"startTime\":1745255153,\"endTime\":1745255157},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"some point like because there we are fortunate and also not to work in this field where like there are many pathways to to a positive end and many you''re never really going to get like the right answer, but you could always. So it \",\"startTime\":1745255157,\"endTime\":1745255170},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"was really hard for me not to every year like I want to revisit things, but I also. \",\"startTime\":1745255170,\"endTime\":1745255178},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Know that at some point I need to say like, that worked last year, that''ll probably work again, and it''s OK to give myself permission to to instead like. \",\"startTime\":1745255179,\"endTime\":1745255186},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"No, What''s that like? Oh, that''s fun. So Michelle, you''re right now you said \",\"startTime\":1745255184,\"endTime\":1745255188},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Spend time with my spouse instead or something instead of.\",\"startTime\":1745255187,\"endTime\":1745255191},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"you''re not in the classroom, but you''re doing lots of coaching. Is that tell \",\"startTime\":1745255188,\"endTime\":1745255191},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"me more about that. I''m curious about your role. \",\"startTime\":1745255191,\"endTime\":1745255195},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255192,\"endTime\":1745255193},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well, yeah, this this year is is unusual because of my current geographic location. So right now I''m. \",\"startTime\":1745255200,\"endTime\":1745255210},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m doing when I when I left the school that I that I do still currently work with. When I left campus and and started working remotely. At that time I was \",\"startTime\":1745255211,\"endTime\":1745255219},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"working as an instructional coach. \",\"startTime\":1745255219,\"endTime\":1745255223},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And teaching just one.\",\"startTime\":1745255223,\"endTime\":1745255225},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I would teach one course, like an elective course every year just to kind of stay in the classroom and help support that work that was needed the team. \",\"startTime\":1745255226,\"endTime\":1745255234},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And was also just doing leadership work to support the school''s director and teachers in general. And so when I transitioned to what I thought was going \",\"startTime\":1745255234,\"endTime\":1745255243},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to be one year living in Spain, I continued to do. \",\"startTime\":1745255243,\"endTime\":1745255247},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"The coaching work from afar for for some people who needed a bit of that, but but mostly I was coaching the person who took over my position in my absence. \",\"startTime\":1745255249,\"endTime\":1745255258},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And then I''m writing a lot of our advisory curriculum, doing some, making some improvements to that. \",\"startTime\":1745255259,\"endTime\":1745255265},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745255264,\"endTime\":1745255264},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And then this year that pair that work paired down even or when I wrote our WASC report, I got to do much of the crafting of that is that, do you know what I mean when I say a wasp report? \",\"startTime\":1745255266,\"endTime\":1745255276},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"What''s No I don''t.\",\"startTime\":1745255276,\"endTime\":1745255278},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"A big.\",\"startTime\":1745255277,\"endTime\":1745255278},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It''s an accreditation document that schools have to engage with in California periodically and in other places I think as well. But anyway, it''s a big lift. \",\"startTime\":1745255280,\"endTime\":1745255287},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Got it, Got it.\",\"startTime\":1745255282,\"endTime\":1745255283},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And so I did some of that work. So I was really doing doing very different. \",\"startTime\":1745255287,\"endTime\":1745255290},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Remote work that was important to the school that disconnected from certainly from connecting directly with students and then even less so with with the adults on campus over time. So this and then in over the past six months or so as I \",\"startTime\":1745255291,\"endTime\":1745255303},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"was trying to kind of look for a little more work to tide me over until I returned to California in the fall. \",\"startTime\":1745255303,\"endTime\":1745255311},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Or the summer, rather. I I started looking for some curriculum development work \",\"startTime\":1745255313,\"endTime\":1745255317},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to supplement the income, and so I''ve been doing that. Right now the big project \",\"startTime\":1745255317,\"endTime\":1745255320},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m doing is writing. \",\"startTime\":1745255320,\"endTime\":1745255324},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Entire year long courses in biology, chemistry and physics for a school that''s like an online Independent School that''s starting up this fall. So that is feeling \",\"startTime\":1745255325,\"endTime\":1745255335},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"like a big lift or I''m thinking about it. It''s great. Like it''s very interesting \",\"startTime\":1745255335,\"endTime\":1745255340},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"work, but it''s a lot too. And it''s where I''m really appreciating and wanting \",\"startTime\":1745255340,\"endTime\":1745255345},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"to know more about all of the tools that are available to help make that. \",\"startTime\":1745255345,\"endTime\":1745255350},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"A task I can accomplish in the time that I have available.\",\"startTime\":1745255352,\"endTime\":1745255355},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Wow, I am.\",\"startTime\":1745255356,\"endTime\":1745255358},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I admire the work that you''re doing right now. That seems so intense.\",\"startTime\":1745255358,\"endTime\":1745255362},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Thanks. Yeah, it''s a lot. It is.\",\"startTime\":1745255363,\"endTime\":1745255367},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm, yeah, yeah. Uh, I wanna get back to our conversation here, but I would \",\"startTime\":1745255363,\"endTime\":1745255366},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"totally wanna chat more about all of the online learning and, and the writing of curriculum. I totally geek out. I am such a curriculum geek. Like at the \",\"startTime\":1745255366,\"endTime\":1745255373},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"heart, like I realized that forever ago and I''m always still doing curriculum and curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1745255373,\"endTime\":1745255379},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But later I did notice this, that on the app, if you if you don''t want the words there, you can touch away from the words. I could just touch on the picture \",\"startTime\":1745255381,\"endTime\":1745255387},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"MMM. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745255382,\"endTime\":1745255382},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"on the person. \",\"startTime\":1745255387,\"endTime\":1745255390},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And then it will go away and then tap it again, it''ll come back. I just figured \",\"startTime\":1745255390,\"endTime\":1745255392},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Wondered. Ah, you have a chin. OK, yay.\",\"startTime\":1745255390,\"endTime\":1745255396},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that out. \",\"startTime\":1745255392,\"endTime\":1745255394},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I do have a chin. Oh, and I even see in the app I can tell you where it''s gonna \",\"startTime\":1745255394,\"endTime\":1745255397},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"like know my eyes. Looks like you have your phone propped up somewhere and I \",\"startTime\":1745255397,\"endTime\":1745255401},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"don''t. I''m just trying to hold it out. \",\"startTime\":1745255401,\"endTime\":1745255404},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I do.\",\"startTime\":1745255406,\"endTime\":1745255406},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK. I''m going to press. I''m going to press next.\",\"startTime\":1745255406,\"endTime\":1745255408},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It''s I haven''t some of this crown molding fell off of my daughter''s bedroom ceiling. Oh, that''s unfortunate. I chose the the crusty corner. So that''s why \",\"startTime\":1745255407,\"endTime\":1745255415},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I''m trying this. But you know what? \",\"startTime\":1745255415,\"endTime\":1745255418},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, wouldn''t even notice. Yeah, not today. What was you saying earlier? Just \",\"startTime\":1745255417,\"endTime\":1745255422},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Let''s just leave it, yeah?\",\"startTime\":1745255420,\"endTime\":1745255421},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it''s good enough. It''s good enough. Doesn''t have to be perfect. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745255422,\"endTime\":1745255427},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, exactly. Good enough. You''re right.\",\"startTime\":1745255425,\"endTime\":1745255427},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"True. Yeah. What''s Jeff, can I ask you really quickly, what''s your area of specialty \",\"startTime\":1745255428,\"endTime\":1745255430},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"All right, OK, I''m gonna press.\",\"startTime\":1745255428,\"endTime\":1745255430},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"in education? \",\"startTime\":1745255430,\"endTime\":1745255433},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It was mathematics and curriculum. So for example, in 2005 I was on the lead \",\"startTime\":1745255435,\"endTime\":1745255439},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255436,\"endTime\":1745255437},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"in our district to put our first online math. \",\"startTime\":1745255439,\"endTime\":1745255443},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Course together and so as you were saying that like writing a full year courses, I''m like, oh, I know that joy and then I''m thinking. \",\"startTime\":1745255444,\"endTime\":1745255452},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255451,\"endTime\":1745255452},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, but now they have and you have AI tools, so.\",\"startTime\":1745255452,\"endTime\":1745255455},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"How much cooler and more wonderful is it? And we know so much more 20 years \",\"startTime\":1745255456,\"endTime\":1745255460},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"later. Yeah, we do. But math and then high school math. I did a 17 year stint \",\"startTime\":1745255460,\"endTime\":1745255464},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255462,\"endTime\":1745255463},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"at Ferris High School up in the Pacific Northwest, Spokane, WA home with a Gonzaga Bulldogs and. \",\"startTime\":1745255464,\"endTime\":1745255472},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Hmm. Uh-huh. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255472,\"endTime\":1745255475},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s where we just moved from and my focus has been curriculum and then professional learning, including professional learning curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1745255474,\"endTime\":1745255482},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255482,\"endTime\":1745255482},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So not only.\",\"startTime\":1745255482,\"endTime\":1745255483},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Facilitating professional learning, So moving from the classroom working with students to working with teachers a lot. I did instructional coaching that you''re \",\"startTime\":1745255484,\"endTime\":1745255491},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"mentioning you''re doing and I was doing that in the in the district and then online and then remotely and then doing a lot more work supporting curricular material sets. \",\"startTime\":1745255491,\"endTime\":1745255501},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Analyzing them, giving feedback consultant work for that and then some really fun state national projects and then. \",\"startTime\":1745255502,\"endTime\":1745255509},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And then my journey ended up being back around to professional learning. How \",\"startTime\":1745255510,\"endTime\":1745255512},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"do you do professional learning and how do you develop professional learning curriculum and how how do you give? \",\"startTime\":1745255512,\"endTime\":1745255517},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Good quality feedback for that. Like even this, like the questions on here. \",\"startTime\":1745255517,\"endTime\":1745255521},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s my my current work is how do you give questions knowing you get 5 cards to give to people you don''t get to facilitate other than giving them the tool and then letting them go? Oh, that''s a different weird feel about curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1745255521,\"endTime\":1745255533},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255523,\"endTime\":1745255525},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Oh.\",\"startTime\":1745255534,\"endTime\":1745255535},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but how exciting, like to get to do something. Yeah, apply that skill \",\"startTime\":1745255535,\"endTime\":1745255539},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255538,\"endTime\":1745255540},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"set in such a different way. Nice. OK, so then I, I, I, I went over your question, \",\"startTime\":1745255539,\"endTime\":1745255542},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, it totally is.\",\"startTime\":1745255541,\"endTime\":1745255542},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"you know, or your turn answering the question in order to ask that one. So yeah, \",\"startTime\":1745255542,\"endTime\":1745255546},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"go back to that. \",\"startTime\":1745255546,\"endTime\":1745255549},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I don''t care.\",\"startTime\":1745255548,\"endTime\":1745255549},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So what''s a skill that you''re working to improve? I guess, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255551,\"endTime\":1745255554},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m going to press.\",\"startTime\":1745255551,\"endTime\":1745255553},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That was focused. I''m trying to focus, Yeah. I''m trying to focus and let go \",\"startTime\":1745255555,\"endTime\":1745255557},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255557,\"endTime\":1745255558},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"of all of those details, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745255557,\"endTime\":1745255560},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"What a funny thing for me to not remember you said.\",\"startTime\":1745255560,\"endTime\":1745255563},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, it''s funny, ''cause I wouldn''t remember otherwise. Had a good flashback. \",\"startTime\":1745255564,\"endTime\":1745255567},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Whoopsie.\",\"startTime\":1745255565,\"endTime\":1745255566},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, I''m gonna press next. \",\"startTime\":1745255567,\"endTime\":1745255570},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255569,\"endTime\":1745255569},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"On the bottom and then I think yours will Oh you beat me to it because right right before I pressed next it said waiting for partner. OK mine says ask Michelle. \",\"startTime\":1745255570,\"endTime\":1745255579},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Got it.\",\"startTime\":1745255574,\"endTime\":1745255575},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255579,\"endTime\":1745255580},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So I''m gonna ask you, how has AI changed your work?\",\"startTime\":1745255581,\"endTime\":1745255584},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Wait, where?\",\"startTime\":1745255583,\"endTime\":1745255584},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Then ask Jeff to add to your answer. OK, I didn''t see that part at the bottom \",\"startTime\":1745255585,\"endTime\":1745255587},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"first so. \",\"startTime\":1745255587,\"endTime\":1745255589},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah. How is the I changed your work as an educator or leader of educators \",\"startTime\":1745255589,\"endTime\":1745255592},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"so far? \",\"startTime\":1745255592,\"endTime\":1745255595},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It''s interesting. I feel like so much of it, when it sort of first emerged, \",\"startTime\":1745255596,\"endTime\":1745255600},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"at least in a kind of the everyday conversation for educators a few years ago, it was really like, what are we going to do with this tool that kids are going to use to cheat with? \",\"startTime\":1745255600,\"endTime\":1745255611},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And that was so much of the conversation.\",\"startTime\":1745255612,\"endTime\":1745255615},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And now not that that conversation is I expect over and I just haven''t been working with teachers in that same capacity for the last couple of years. And \",\"startTime\":1745255618,\"endTime\":1745255626},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"so I''m I''m curious to know. \",\"startTime\":1745255626,\"endTime\":1745255630},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Like for our English teachers, for example, like what are they thinking about this as a tool or an enemy? Right now we''re a little bit of both. \",\"startTime\":1745255631,\"endTime\":1745255638},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Umm, and instead myself, the work that I''m focused on right now, just in the last, like very present in the last couple of weeks ''cause I really dug into this work. \",\"startTime\":1745255640,\"endTime\":1745255651},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"For example, trying to find.\",\"startTime\":1745255653,\"endTime\":1745255656},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Sample anchor text that I can use.\",\"startTime\":1745255656,\"endTime\":1745255659},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"For a particular unit or project and instead of me just.\",\"startTime\":1745255660,\"endTime\":1745255664},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Kind of doing like Internet searches blindly. I can ask ChatGPT what what it \",\"startTime\":1745255664,\"endTime\":1745255667},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"says and it proposes a bunch and some of them I can use. I''m still applying \",\"startTime\":1745255667,\"endTime\":1745255671},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"my expertise to say like, no, that one''s not quite right or that one''s off the mark or the Alexa level wouldn''t be right on that. But then there''s other things \",\"startTime\":1745255671,\"endTime\":1745255678},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"like it would point me toward I found, you know, some really excellent Open Access scientific, you know, peer reviewed journal articles. I was like, these \",\"startTime\":1745255678,\"endTime\":1745255686},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"are perfect. This is exactly what I want to use. And I don''t know if I had sifted \",\"startTime\":1745255686,\"endTime\":1745255690},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"through the countless number of those that that. \",\"startTime\":1745255690,\"endTime\":1745255693},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Available through a standard Google search like what? I found that so I think \",\"startTime\":1745255695,\"endTime\":1745255699},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"it''s changing my work in both efficiency and probably quality as well. \",\"startTime\":1745255699,\"endTime\":1745255703},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And I still for me to realize like, but I''m not cheating like. And there are \",\"startTime\":1745255704,\"endTime\":1745255708},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"ways for us to teach kids to do this without where it''s not like they''re not learning skill, but it''s one of the tools that''s available to them. \",\"startTime\":1745255708,\"endTime\":1745255716},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And how do we use it to improve our thinking, improve our ideas and improve the application of what we we did create with our human brains that are also amazing machines, you know, that can do can do a lot. So so I''m finding that \",\"startTime\":1745255718,\"endTime\":1745255732},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"every day now I am my work is being made more. \",\"startTime\":1745255732,\"endTime\":1745255737},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"It may be easier, but I don''t even know that it''s easy. I''m still doing hard \",\"startTime\":1745255740,\"endTime\":1745255743},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"work, but it''s, I think the work I''m putting in on getting more out of it through the use of these tools and that, you know, benefits kids, the quality of the of the curriculum they''re going to get to access. \",\"startTime\":1745255743,\"endTime\":1745255753},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. I love how you''re saying that the the amount of work that you \",\"startTime\":1745255755,\"endTime\":1745255758},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes.\",\"startTime\":1745255758,\"endTime\":1745255760},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"put in to the effect that you get out. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1745255758,\"endTime\":1745255762},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It just seems like we have turbo boosters on our our work or like a new gear for pedalling our bike or something. They''re like, oh, I can go faster with \",\"startTime\":1745255764,\"endTime\":1745255772},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"the same amount of work or I can get more done or. \",\"startTime\":1745255772,\"endTime\":1745255776},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I think especially about what you were saying for checking for references and resources, as soon as you started talking about that, I imagine. \",\"startTime\":1745255778,\"endTime\":1745255784},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You or me or any of us as writers of content online after dark, the kids are in bed and we''re hacking away at the machine trying to find, please, what''s a good quote? What''s a good resource for this? How about a nice video? I''ll \",\"startTime\":1745255784,\"endTime\":1745255797},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"get up at 4:00 in the morning and watch all of the videos on the Internet to see if I can find one that works for my kids. That''s what we would do as teachers. \",\"startTime\":1745255797,\"endTime\":1745255806},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s what we do as authors. And today you can just. \",\"startTime\":1745255806,\"endTime\":1745255811},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Is uh, yes, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255807,\"endTime\":1745255811},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Ask a couple prompts and get a huge list of resources that you never knew was there. Yeah, it''s amazing. \",\"startTime\":1745255812,\"endTime\":1745255818},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes, yeah, I love the I love the Usain like turbo boosters are like easier gear to pedal in cause features and kids too, because this is all about like what are kids getting out of this too? Like they need that. Like the work is \",\"startTime\":1745255820,\"endTime\":1745255832},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"the work is really hard, especially if you''re not going to just plop A textbook down in front of a kid and, you know, work through that together if you''re going to create really dynamic, meaningful, authentic curriculum. \",\"startTime\":1745255832,\"endTime\":1745255845},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"That''s just so much work and anything we can do to make that a little easier for teachers, a little more possible, a little more efficient is really important. \",\"startTime\":1745255847,\"endTime\":1745255856},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I think it''s like it''s going to keep people in the in the profession longer. \",\"startTime\":1745255856,\"endTime\":1745255861},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1745255861,\"endTime\":1745255861},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, burnout has been a real issue for us as educators, that''s for sure. And \",\"startTime\":1745255863,\"endTime\":1745255867},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I hope that we can find a good balance between using AI as a tool to support us rather than another thing on our plate to do. \",\"startTime\":1745255867,\"endTime\":1745255875},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255869,\"endTime\":1745255870},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That wears this down.\",\"startTime\":1745255877,\"endTime\":1745255878},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745255879,\"endTime\":1745255881},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, this is awesome. OK.\",\"startTime\":1745255881,\"endTime\":1745255883},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Great take turns sharing with Michelle. How do you think AI will change the \",\"startTime\":1745255886,\"endTime\":1745255889},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"role of learners in the future? \",\"startTime\":1745255889,\"endTime\":1745255891},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You already mentioned this on your last question, and I''m going to see if I can paraphrase what you''re saying. You were saying the role of learners. \",\"startTime\":1745255894,\"endTime\":1745255901},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I''m trying to think what you were saying. But they''re gonna be able to do \",\"startTime\":1745255904,\"endTime\":1745255907},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"more and get there faster because of the tools. So I''m wondering about the role \",\"startTime\":1745255907,\"endTime\":1745255911},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"of the learners, how that changes. \",\"startTime\":1745255911,\"endTime\":1745255914},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Is the rule now that they''re going to have to manage their learning more because they have more to do or they''re going to have to become more organized or more meta? I''m not sure from what you were saying. Tell me what you''re thinking on \",\"startTime\":1745255917,\"endTime\":1745255926},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I I''m, I don''t.\",\"startTime\":1745255926,\"endTime\":1745255928},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"that. Like how would that change their role? \",\"startTime\":1745255926,\"endTime\":1745255929},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I think you''re gonna hear me verbally process a lot right now because, because I don''t know. This is a question that I''m really mulling over. It''s like, what \",\"startTime\":1745255934,\"endTime\":1745255939},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"is this gonna mean for learners in the future? And. \",\"startTime\":1745255939,\"endTime\":1745255942},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I think that when you''re interacting with any of the AI tools that are available, so much of it is still about knowing what the quality question to ask. So I \",\"startTime\":1745255944,\"endTime\":1745255954},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"think that''s the same thing for students learning in a classroom that don''t have access to those tools immediately. It''s like, how do you how do you know \",\"startTime\":1745255954,\"endTime\":1745255963},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"what questions to ask? And then in the more in recent years where we usually. \",\"startTime\":1745255963,\"endTime\":1745255968},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"You know, release students to like, open their computers and go like, start searching Google, ask your good question or look for the prompt, and then you''re gonna get all this information. \",\"startTime\":1745255971,\"endTime\":1745255978},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And you have to be able to sift through that and pick out what information is valid, what''s serving, what''s answering your question best. And I think kids \",\"startTime\":1745255979,\"endTime\":1745255988},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"are still going to need to do that with what we''re currently seeing with, again, with a tool like ChatGPT, you put something in, it''s going to give you something back, but you, the learner still needs to. \",\"startTime\":1745255988,\"endTime\":1745256002},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Not just copy and paste that or pick the first thing on the list, but instead think a little bit about what. \",\"startTime\":1745256006,\"endTime\":1745256011},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Possible information they could lean on.\",\"startTime\":1745256014,\"endTime\":1745256016},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Are you saying, are you saying that there will have to be even more critical consumers of information? \",\"startTime\":1745256016,\"endTime\":1745256023},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I don''t know if I''ll have.\",\"startTime\":1745256022,\"endTime\":1745256023},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"To be more, it depends on how we build our tools. Do those tools work to already \",\"startTime\":1745256023,\"endTime\":1745256027},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"get rid of a lot of the garbage that would show up otherwise? \",\"startTime\":1745256027,\"endTime\":1745256031},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Or not. Yeah, that''s those are my initial thoughts about it, but I yeah, I think \",\"startTime\":1745256033,\"endTime\":1745256037},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745256037,\"endTime\":1745256040},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I love him. Yeah, I think, I think my thoughts are really similar along those \",\"startTime\":1745256039,\"endTime\":1745256043},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"lines of the user, the role of the learner now. And I like how you called it \",\"startTime\":1745256043,\"endTime\":1745256046},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"out because you called out you''re a learner and then you''re learning how to use these tools. And it''s the same thing for the kids as they''re learning to \",\"startTime\":1745256046,\"endTime\":1745256053},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"use these tools. So I think it''s. \",\"startTime\":1745256053,\"endTime\":1745256056},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"One the role of learner is that we and I''m stealing from the math practice standards in math. I love the 8 practices the habits of mind we''re trying to grow in kids. \",\"startTime\":1745256058,\"endTime\":1745256068},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Or in everybody and I think about and this is like.\",\"startTime\":1745256069,\"endTime\":1745256072},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Pre-K like from their baby till you''re dead and one of them is use appropriate tools strategically and I think the role of the learner. \",\"startTime\":1745256072,\"endTime\":1745256080},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"At all ages for us, especially as educators and then our kids is.\",\"startTime\":1745256080,\"endTime\":1745256084},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Is to teach them to.\",\"startTime\":1745256084,\"endTime\":1745256086},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Use appropriate tools strategically, and that''s their role is that they''re users of tools. \",\"startTime\":1745256087,\"endTime\":1745256092},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"But then I have to think about when is it the right tool so it''s the appropriate tool, and then how do I use it strategically? And as you''re talking about that, \",\"startTime\":1745256092,\"endTime\":1745256098},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256098,\"endTime\":1745256099},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it wasn''t just about the information I was hearing. It''s about do I ask the \",\"startTime\":1745256098,\"endTime\":1745256101},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"right question and do I get it this way? And does it get the thing that I want \",\"startTime\":1745256101,\"endTime\":1745256104},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"it to get me at the end? \",\"startTime\":1745256104,\"endTime\":1745256107},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"And I and I kept thinking that sounds like tools.\",\"startTime\":1745256109,\"endTime\":1745256111},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"So that''s one of the things I''ve been thinking about a lot, is we''re gonna be like new tool users, like how do you use the new cool tools and how do you use them to solve problems? \",\"startTime\":1745256112,\"endTime\":1745256123},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256118,\"endTime\":1745256120},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think the role is gonna be different for, for, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256123,\"endTime\":1745256126},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s it''s not the first time we''re having this conversation, right, about new tools like, and do you let kids use calculators? When do you, when the Internet \",\"startTime\":1745256125,\"endTime\":1745256133},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, no, no.\",\"startTime\":1745256131,\"endTime\":1745256134},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"came along, like how that was going to destroy, you know, kids ability to look things up in encyclopedias and like, well, maybe that''s OK, maybe this is better. \",\"startTime\":1745256133,\"endTime\":1745256140},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Don''t give them encyclopedias, they might look it up.\",\"startTime\":1745256143,\"endTime\":1745256146},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So we just have to be ready to.\",\"startTime\":1745256144,\"endTime\":1745256146},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right.\",\"startTime\":1745256148,\"endTime\":1745256149},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"They might look ahead, they might get to the F encyclopedia and see all the kind of fish before my special F day. \",\"startTime\":1745256151,\"endTime\":1745256157},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we''re not there yet.\",\"startTime\":1745256155,\"endTime\":1745256156},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Exactly, yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256159,\"endTime\":1745256160},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it. OK, I think there''s more on the more. Yeah, lots of things we \",\"startTime\":1745256162,\"endTime\":1745256166},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"could have gone down, but I liked our conversation. But yeah, OK, I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1745256166,\"endTime\":1745256169},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"say next. \",\"startTime\":1745256169,\"endTime\":1745256173},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK, read the challenges and choose 10.\",\"startTime\":1745256177,\"endTime\":1745256180},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So we choose one, but we might choose different ones like we don''t tell each other which is that what that means? \",\"startTime\":1745256182,\"endTime\":1745256186},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I like this game. Yeah, sounds good.\",\"startTime\":1745256186,\"endTime\":1745256188},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Share your story or solve a problem with practice. Oh OK, you get to go first. \",\"startTime\":1745256193,\"endTime\":1745256199},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256198,\"endTime\":1745256198},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"In your own words, what''s your sad?\",\"startTime\":1745256200,\"endTime\":1745256201},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"What''s a problem? What''s the problem with practices?\",\"startTime\":1745256204,\"endTime