gs we''re doing in our classes. So. \",\"startTime\":1745256804,\"endTime\":1745256811},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"I think you really like him in the language is really rich, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256811,\"endTime\":1745256814},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256813,\"endTime\":1745256814},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Cool. Yes, Yeah, I''ll be looking at that soon.\",\"startTime\":1745256815,\"endTime\":1745256818},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. OK, sweet. And then, umm, I don''t know, umm, I have to check with Erica \",\"startTime\":1745256816,\"endTime\":1745256819},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"for when you and I might connect again. Just if we wanted to do a check in or \",\"startTime\":1745256819,\"endTime\":1745256823},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"call. But I know she''s got you doing some work, but I''d love any of the feedback \",\"startTime\":1745256823,\"endTime\":1745256827},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"from your experience about how it is. \",\"startTime\":1745256827,\"endTime\":1745256831},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256831,\"endTime\":1745256831},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Coming through and all of the stuff, even with our funky, quirky tools that we have right now and fun being a learner in front of other learners, knowing that it''s going to not work all the time. \",\"startTime\":1745256831,\"endTime\":1745256844},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, no, so far, great.\",\"startTime\":1745256837,\"endTime\":1745256840},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Uh, what did you say? Do I want to be bad at something or do I want to suck \",\"startTime\":1745256845,\"endTime\":1745256848},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Oh yes.\",\"startTime\":1745256846,\"endTime\":1745256846},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"at something for the first year? \",\"startTime\":1745256848,\"endTime\":1745256850},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, that''s exactly, that''s sort of what I''m. Yeah. Publicly, I thought \",\"startTime\":1745256851,\"endTime\":1745256855},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"In front of others.\",\"startTime\":1745256851,\"endTime\":1745256852},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"I was done with that. Yeah, no, Yeah, I think so. I''m meeting with Erica. We \",\"startTime\":1745256855,\"endTime\":1745256859},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256855,\"endTime\":1745256856},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"have a meeting scheduled on the 29th. \",\"startTime\":1745256859,\"endTime\":1745256863},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745256860,\"endTime\":1745256861},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"And I believe she wanted me to make sure I had at least two conversations.\",\"startTime\":1745256865,\"endTime\":1745256869},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Before that meeting. So that''s that''s what comes to mind right now as far as \",\"startTime\":1745256870,\"endTime\":1745256873},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Great.\",\"startTime\":1745256873,\"endTime\":1745256874},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"like what we want to try to make sure I get. \",\"startTime\":1745256873,\"endTime\":1745256877},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256875,\"endTime\":1745256875},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Then let''s be real authentic to the process and I will match you with some other educators like. \",\"startTime\":1745256879,\"endTime\":1745256884},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Curriculum authors or people who are doing remote learning or have been in that same kind of position and of leadership instructional work as well. I''ll see \",\"startTime\":1745256885,\"endTime\":1745256892},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"what I can do to partner you up. And it would be wonderful to get that feedback \",\"startTime\":1745256892,\"endTime\":1745256895},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"from your journey because it''s new and we don''t have 1000 people online yet, so you don''t get somebody right away to match. \",\"startTime\":1745256895,\"endTime\":1745256903},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256897,\"endTime\":1745256899},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256903,\"endTime\":1745256904},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Umm, not like the popular whatever games online or whatever, umm, that will get you there and it''ll be great to get your feedback from that and like what that process is like. So alright. \",\"startTime\":1745256904,\"endTime\":1745256914},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm, Great. Yeah. I''ve been keeping a doc, a document of just running notes \",\"startTime\":1745256913,\"endTime\":1745256917},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"and I shared that with Erica and think mentioned like I don''t know if they if I should share it with anybody else on the team at this point or not, but I it''s possible like that''s where I''ve been kind of keeping everything. So yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745256917,\"endTime\":1745256931},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"You''re welcome to share it with me. I would, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745256928,\"endTime\":1745256930},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"So that''s helpful. I''ll just share you on those. \",\"startTime\":1745256931,\"endTime\":1745256935},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Yeah, No, I would love to see. Yeah, if you want to share with that \",\"startTime\":1745256932,\"endTime\":1745256934},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"with me, that would be awesome, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1745256934,\"endTime\":1745256937},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745256937,\"endTime\":1745256938},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Sweet beans. Oh, I hope you have a wonderful evening. Oh, Spain.\",\"startTime\":1745256939,\"endTime\":1745256943},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Great. OK, Well, in.\",\"startTime\":1745256939,\"endTime\":1745256941},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1745256942,\"endTime\":1745256943},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Oh, is it warm today?\",\"startTime\":1745256945,\"endTime\":1745256947},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, if you can do your year, your year in Valentine.\",\"startTime\":1745256945,\"endTime\":1745256948},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Beautiful. Like, yeah, today was the first day I was like, I gotta get out the \",\"startTime\":1745256948,\"endTime\":1745256951},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"big sun hat for my walk to town because it''s getting pretty intense. But yeah, \",\"startTime\":1745256951,\"endTime\":1745256955},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"it''s a beautiful time of year here. The humidity is not super high yet and. \",\"startTime\":1745256955,\"endTime\":1745256958},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Beautiful.\",\"startTime\":1745256959,\"endTime\":1745256959},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"Love it. I love it. Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1745256960,\"endTime\":1745256962},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Yeah, but looks like Tucson''s treating you OK, too. Great.\",\"startTime\":1745256960,\"endTime\":1745256963},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It is like 0 humidity pretty much and in our place we bought their cacti and palm trees already growing in. \",\"startTime\":1745256963,\"endTime\":1745256971},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Ah, no.\",\"startTime\":1745256972,\"endTime\":1745256972},{\"speaker\":\"11963\",\"text\":\"It''s wonderful. Yeah. All right. More chats later. Have a great day. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1745256973,\"endTime\":1745256977},{\"speaker\":\"11995\",\"text\":\"Nice. All right. Well, enjoy it. Yes. We''ll talk soon. You too.\",\"startTime\":1745256975,\"endTime\":1745256978}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.398817+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:08.398817+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 2055, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:08.365Z", "session_title": "#ai_learning_tools", 