5507851},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"The coordinator for our 4th grade camping trip.\",\"startTime\":1745507852,\"endTime\":1745507855},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Nova Cats camping coordinator.\",\"startTime\":1745507860,\"endTime\":1745507862},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So Yep, Yep, it''s like a survival camping, right? It''s like you have to like \",\"startTime\":1745507862,\"endTime\":1745507867},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"do first aid and like eat fish eyeballs and stuff. \",\"startTime\":1745507867,\"endTime\":1745507871},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I''ve never been, but now I''m the coordinator. I love it. Anyway, so we have \",\"startTime\":1745507872,\"endTime\":1745507876},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"to create. There''s 103 kiddos and they each get to request who they want to \",\"startTime\":1745507876,\"endTime\":1745507881},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"be in their tent with them. And so normally there''s this like 6 hour long process \",\"startTime\":1745507881,\"endTime\":1745507886},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"where the teachers cut up slips of paper and they like manually move all the groups around. And I''ve been using taught GPT to like recreate multiple iterations \",\"startTime\":1745507886,\"endTime\":1745507896},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"of possible groupings that like keep in mind all of the different requirements. \",\"startTime\":1745507896,\"endTime\":1745507901},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And it''s interesting, it''s breaking GPT. And then today Charles is like, actually, \",\"startTime\":1745507902,\"endTime\":1745507905},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"it''s like having an actual issue today. Like it''s not just you. It''s like, actually \",\"startTime\":1745507905,\"endTime\":1745507907},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"there''s like a known issue today. I was like, OK, well, that makes me feel a \",\"startTime\":1745507907,\"endTime\":1745507910},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"little better, but. \",\"startTime\":1745507910,\"endTime\":1745507913},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"This has been interesting, like really like pushing it to its limits. And I''m \",\"startTime\":1745507913,\"endTime\":1745507916},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like, I don''t feel like this is like a big data set. I don''t feel like this \",\"startTime\":1745507916,\"endTime\":1745507920},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"is a complex problem, but it''s complex enough that it''s like reaching the limits of, of chat, GP, TS capabilities. It''s like, we recommend that you run this \",\"startTime\":1745507920,\"endTime\":1745507927},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"script locally and like, no, you do it. \",\"startTime\":1745507927,\"endTime\":1745507930},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Try harder.\",\"startTime\":1745507932,\"endTime\":1745507933},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love it. I''ve had that same experience where you''re like getting into \",\"startTime\":1745507934,\"endTime\":1745507938},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"something, you''re like, you should totally be able to do this and. \",\"startTime\":1745507938,\"endTime\":1745507941},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"When I look at the GPT thread and I have to walk away and go for a walk to sometimes do it. \",\"startTime\":1745507942,\"endTime\":1745507948},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"But I have to think of the AI tool as a human being. I know it''s not, but it''s \",\"startTime\":1745507949,\"endTime\":1745507953},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"built on a neural network. And if I think of it as a new college graduate. \",\"startTime\":1745507953,\"endTime\":1745507958},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"That just got hired and it''s my new assistant following me around and I''m asking you to do something. \",\"startTime\":1745507959,\"endTime\":1745507964},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And it''s just like stuck on something. I''m like, come on, why can''t you do it \",\"startTime\":1745507964,\"endTime\":1745507967},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"so simple? You were trained to do this. \",\"startTime\":1745507967,\"endTime\":1745507970},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I just need a break and realize oh wait, it''s just doing what it''s trying and thinking it''s best to do. \",\"startTime\":1745507970,\"endTime\":1745507975},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I''m realizing that in my work, I keep thinking like, not just grouping like you''re doing, but how do you do things like? \",\"startTime\":1745507975,\"endTime\":1745507983},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Create good artifacts. I ran into one forever that the GPT would not give me \",\"startTime\":1745507984,\"endTime\":1745507989},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"back verbatim quotes. It would just quote up something that sounded good. \",\"startTime\":1745507989,\"endTime\":1745507993},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I know she''s. I know she''s yelling and you don''t like it. It''s OK, Kelly. I \",\"startTime\":1745507994,\"endTime\":1745507997},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And I would ask it.\",\"startTime\":1745507994,\"endTime\":1745507995},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"know you don''t like it. I know she''s yellow. \",\"startTime\":1745507997,\"endTime\":1745508000},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s OK. It''s OK. Look, she''s gonna go inside now. It''s all done, OK? \",\"startTime\":1745508000,\"endTime\":1745508002},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"It''s OK. \",\"startTime\":1745508002,\"endTime\":1745508004},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"She''s all done, All done.\",\"startTime\":1745508006,\"endTime\":1745508007},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Sorry, the lady next door was screaming at someone on the phone and Kelly did not like it. \",\"startTime\":1745508008,\"endTime\":1745508012},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, oh God, sense that.\",\"startTime\":1745508014,\"endTime\":1745508018},{\"speaker\":\"1200