\",\"startTime\":1745508120,\"endTime\":1745508123},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And it breaks the GPT''s. I''m like, OK, Jeff, stop.\",\"startTime\":1745508123,\"endTime\":1745508126},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508126,\"endTime\":1745508128},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So it''s changed the way I''m thinking because I have to think more about.\",\"startTime\":1745508126,\"endTime\":1745508130},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508128,\"endTime\":1745508129},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"What''s the structure I want it to have and when do I not give it give it structure like when is it structure important because. \",\"startTime\":1745508131,\"endTime\":1745508138},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"We wanna run the 4th grade camp this way. It has to be these things. And then \",\"startTime\":1745508139,\"endTime\":1745508142},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1745508142,\"endTime\":1745508144},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"when is it OK to not give structure? \",\"startTime\":1745508142,\"endTime\":1745508145},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Because, you know, I don''t know what the title of this article should be. Let''s \",\"startTime\":1745508146,\"endTime\":1745508148},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"just talk and see what it is and what the most important quotes are or the main things, and then we''ll come up to the title later. \",\"startTime\":1745508148,\"endTime\":1745508154},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508154,\"endTime\":1745508156},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Duh. Yeah, it''s been challenging, that''s for sure.\",\"startTime\":1745508156,\"endTime\":1745508159},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Charles has such an interesting inner. You''ve never met my husband, but he has \",\"startTime\":1745508160,\"endTime\":1745508163},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"he''s like got the brain for it. And it''s like infuriating for me, but also really \",\"startTime\":1745508163,\"endTime\":1745508166},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"helpful. But like today I was and it''s I love that we share our ChatGPT too. \",\"startTime\":1745508166,\"endTime\":1745508169},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"So like I''ll be like, you know, griping in him about something like via text and he like goes in and just like gives it a prompt and I''ll go and I''m like, oh. \",\"startTime\":1745508169,\"endTime\":1745508179},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508177,\"endTime\":1745508178},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Oh, that''s a really smart problem. Like you just like jumps in and like does \",\"startTime\":1745508179,\"endTime\":1745508182},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"it for me. \",\"startTime\":1745508182,\"endTime\":1745508184},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"But I learned so much from it. So like, for example, today this was like an \",\"startTime\":1745508184,\"endTime\":1745508188},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"awful today. Today it would say, here''s a new alternative grouping for the boys. \",\"startTime\":1745508188,\"endTime\":1745508192},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"You didn''t insert the table. Where''s the data? And it''s like, yeah, here''s the \",\"startTime\":1745508192,\"endTime\":1745508197},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"data. Do you want an export file? Yes, I want an export file. Great, here''s \",\"startTime\":1745508197,\"endTime\":1745508201},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"your export file. I click on the export file, file doesn''t exist. And I''m like, \",\"startTime\":1745508201,\"endTime\":1745508205},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"what is happening? It keeps saying that it''s giving me the data, but there''s \",\"startTime\":1745508205,\"endTime\":1745508209},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"no data. And so then Charles was like, you have to ask it if. \",\"startTime\":1745508209,\"endTime