startTime\":1745508271,\"endTime\":1745508275},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, that''s what I mean. Like after a while you you have to step back \",\"startTime\":1745508275,\"endTime\":1745508279},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and go, OK, what''s that structure you gave it the structure. Here''s the outline \",\"startTime\":1745508279,\"endTime\":1745508283},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"in the parameter. And I''m learning that we have to think more clearly. \",\"startTime\":1745508283,\"endTime\":1745508286},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508286,\"endTime\":1745508289},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Just like with somebody else, when we want somebody to do something, a business, an organization or an individual. \",\"startTime\":1745508287,\"endTime\":1745508292},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How do we ask them very clearly what we want to get done and what the parameters are? \",\"startTime\":1745508292,\"endTime\":1745508297},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And where do we give them freedom and flexibility to do their work and be their awesome experts and not tell them what to do? \",\"startTime\":1745508298,\"endTime\":1745508305},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508301,\"endTime\":1745508302},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Exactly. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508305,\"endTime\":1745508308},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, MM called it out. He had a great video that Dan, I forgot his last name, \",\"startTime\":1745508307,\"endTime\":1745508311},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Programmer guy. \",\"startTime\":1745508311,\"endTime\":1745508314},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Was watching yesterday that and Dan is the program was interviewing Mike and Mike was sharing about what he''s doing a sci-fi and he even used the phrase like. \",\"startTime\":1745508314,\"endTime\":1745508323},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Well, I think about positioning it as capable. And if you just hired a new MIT \",\"startTime\":1745508323,\"endTime\":1745508327},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"graduate, you''d be like, oh, you''re an expert in coding. I''m gonna trust you \",\"startTime\":1745508327,\"endTime\":1745508331},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and I''m gonna over teach you. I''m gonna position you as capable and I''m gonna \",\"startTime\":1745508331,\"endTime\":1745508335},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"tell you the ideas of our project and then let you go do your work. And you''re \",\"startTime\":1745508335,\"endTime\":1745508339},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"like, oh, same thing. Like how? How do you know? \",\"startTime\":1745508339,\"endTime\":1745508343},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508341,\"endTime\":1745508342},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Right. That''s it. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508343,\"endTime\":1745508344},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"How do you know how to position that GPT is capable of doing that work and.\",\"startTime\":1745508345,\"endTime\":1745508350},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508350,\"endTime\":1745508353},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, OK, let me do next 10.\",\"startTime\":1745508353,\"endTime\":1745508355},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Sharing How do you think AI will change the role of learners in the future?\",\"startTime\":1745508359,\"endTime\":1745508364},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Circle alright.\",\"startTime\":1745508367,\"endTime\":1745508370},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Did you happen to catch Dan Myers session that he presented at the AI conference a couple weekends ago? \",\"startTime\":1745508374,\"endTime\":1745508381},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I did not.\",\"startTime\":1745508382,\"endTime\":1745508383},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"He did this 15 minute long. It''s definitely, you should definitely watch it \",\"startTime\":1745508383,\"endTime\":1745508387},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"just because it''s like your world, it''s your realm. \",\"startTime\":1745508387,\"endTime\":1745508390},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1745508387,\"endTime\":1745508387},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I was just like, I don''t know what this dude''s getting on. Like this is \",\"startTime\":1745508392,\"endTime\":1745508396},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"a bit much for me. It''s like basically likening AI to church and it, it went \",\"startTime\":1745508396,\"endTime\":1745508400},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like probably this went sideways. And then I came to learn that there''s this \",\"startTime\":1745508400,\"endTime\":1745508405},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like whole like religion of AI. There''s like a real thing. Like people are actually \",\"startTime\":1745508405,\"endTime\":1745508409},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like going to church and saying like AI is going to be the next coming. It''s \",\"startTime\":1745508409,\"endTime\":1745508413},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"like. \",\"startTime\":1745508413,\"endTime\":1745508418},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Like a real So anyway I I I have.\",\"startTime\":1745508420,\"endTime\":1745508423},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So is that your? Is that you''re changing the role of learners? Tell me more \",\"startTime\":1745508423,\"endTime\":1745508425},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"about this, I can''t wait. \",\"startTime\":1745508425,\"endTime\":1745508427},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Well, it''s so the, the connection is like, I think that there is fear of the unknown and fear of like being replaced, but I think the reality is that AI is going to actually just assist teachers in doing their job easier and more efficiently. \",\"startTime\":1745508428,\"endTime\":1745508449},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And I think that like, the fear just comes from the