artTime\":1745508516,\"endTime\":1745508520},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Oh, it''s a good place to hide.\",\"startTime\":1745508519,\"endTime\":1745508522},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"She''s like digging.\",\"startTime\":1745508521,\"endTime\":1745508522},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"She''s been really annoying, right? That''s why I was distracted. She''s she''s \",\"startTime\":1745508523,\"endTime\":1745508525},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"not being annoying, she''s being very distracting. Umm. \",\"startTime\":1745508525,\"endTime\":1745508528},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah, how about students? How do you think students role will change?\",\"startTime\":1745508531,\"endTime\":1745508536},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I think I think I needed a more global prompt before I narrowed it down to the role of the learner. \",\"startTime\":1745508540,\"endTime\":1745508544},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Umm, I think that.\",\"startTime\":1745508547,\"endTime\":1745508549},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I don''t know if I''ve given that much thought.\",\"startTime\":1745508551,\"endTime\":1745508553},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"From being honest.\",\"startTime\":1745508555,\"endTime\":1745508556},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"From what I''ve heard from you though.\",\"startTime\":1745508559,\"endTime\":1745508561},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"You''re talking about the way that you''re using AI and thinking about prompts and interactions with the prompts and the amount of reading that you have to do with it. And then I''m not sure for for learners what their role is going \",\"startTime\":1745508561,\"endTime\":1745508571},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"to be and what you''re saying for your story, but definitely is they''re using AI. \",\"startTime\":1745508571,\"endTime\":1745508578},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"They''re gonna have to read a lot more and they''re gonna have to be critical consumers of that information that''s given and be persistent in conversation. \",\"startTime\":1745508581,\"endTime\":1745508588},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"I think they have to be more articulate in their in their in their role about what they want and what to happen. And I think they''ll have to be more active \",\"startTime\":1745508588,\"endTime\":1745508595},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Sure. Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508590,\"endTime\":1745508593},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"and if if the AI is. \",\"startTime\":1745508595,\"endTime\":1745508598},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"The thing in front of them or their tool that they have, then are they able to articulate what they''re saying, thinking, be able to ask clarifying questions or clarifying prompts? \",\"startTime\":1745508600,\"endTime\":1745508612},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Uh huh.\",\"startTime\":1745508612,\"endTime\":1745508613},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Get that information and have that dialogue back and forth. Like you said, you \",\"startTime\":1745508612,\"endTime\":1745508615},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"had a thought partner. You feel like you have a thought partner right now with \",\"startTime\":1745508615,\"endTime\":1745508618},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"coaching with that same thing because that''s you as a learner with that same thing. Apply for kids. \",\"startTime\":1745508618,\"endTime\":1745508624},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Uh huh. Right?\",\"startTime\":1745508619,\"endTime\":1745508621},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"And so them Co thinking with an AI tool, I think that their their engagement will have to be now I need to take the role of the discourse. \",\"startTime\":1745508626,\"endTime\":1745508637},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Active discourse person? And what does that mean for me as a learner? OK, how \",\"startTime\":1745508637,\"endTime\":1745508640},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"do I do active discourse? \",\"startTime\":1745508640,\"endTime\":1745508643},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Yeah, right.\",\"startTime\":1745508642,\"endTime\":1745508644},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I think, I think can I just push a little bit too of like, I think it''s hard for us to know what the role of the learner will be and. \",\"startTime\":1745508644,\"endTime\":1745508653},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1745508645,\"endTime\":1745508645},{\"speaker\":\"12004\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1745508653,\"endTime\":1745508653},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"I guess I''m going a little sideways here. I apologize. But so like we had a \",\"startTime\":1745508656,\"endTime\":1745508661},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"convert. I went to the conference that I presented at in Switzerland. There \",\"startTime\":1745508661,\"endTime\":1745508665},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"was an extended session on AI. It was really interesting. I learned a lot. \",\"startTime\":1745508665,\"endTime\":1745508670},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"But like the conversation afterwards with my team was a lot of like, what do we, what parameters do we need to put in place to support students with AI? \",\"startTime\":1745508674,\"endTime\":1745508682},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"And we''re the, they were brainstorming these perimeters and I had this funny moment where I was like, Oh my God, we sound like a bunch of old geezers. Like \",\"startTime\":1745508682,\"endTime\":1745508690},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"we sound like old people, like students are going to be AI natives like they are. \",\"startTime\":1745508690,\"endTime\":1745508699},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"They get it. So like my tech coordinator.\",\"startTime\":1745508702,\"endTime\":1745508705},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"Does.\",\"startTime\":1745508706,\"endTime\":1745508707},{\"speaker\":\"12002\",\"text\":\"My tech coordinator does this activity for digital ci