h, anything else that we could do or I could do, please reach out and I''ll be working on my end to connect you with other educators and keep going back to side by. And then at some point we''ll get it to be an app and we''ll get rid \",\"startTime\":1740422648,\"endTime\":1740422659},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"of the updo logo ''cause that will be all together ours and it''ll all be bye, bye. And it''ll be one app and you can do it off your phone and you get your \",\"startTime\":1740422659,\"endTime\":1740422666},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"notification. Hey, somebody wants to chat right now about AI tools and you''d \",\"startTime\":1740422666,\"endTime\":1740422670},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"be like yes or however it is. Yeah, Alright. Thank you so much Allison, you \",\"startTime\":1740422670,\"endTime\":1740422674},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Love it.\",\"startTime\":1740422673,\"endTime\":1740422674},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"are wonderful. I hope you have a great Monday. This has been. \",\"startTime\":1740422674,\"endTime\":1740422677},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Amazing start for my day, I appreciate it.\",\"startTime\":1740422678,\"endTime\":1740422680},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Thank you. You too. It''s gonna be a great week.\",\"startTime\":1740422681,\"endTime\":1740422684},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Thanks. It is. It really is. Thanks. Bye. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1740422684,\"endTime\":1740422686},{\"speaker\":\"11876\",\"text\":\"Bye.\",\"startTime\":1740422688,\"endTime\":1740422689}]"', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.545462+00', '2025-04-30 20:57:09.545462+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 2625, "created_at": "2025-04-30T20:57:09.488Z", "session_title": "Innovation in AI - Recent Updates", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1447", "name": "Innovation in AI - Recent Updates", "tags": [{"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}, {"name": "First10"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
