ocus on what they should be doing. Like you mentioned last time about \",\"startTime\":1738087643,\"endTime\":1738087656},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"you were building out your own GPT specifically for task and helping to iteratively make them better and training them to be better at the process at what they''re doing. And I think. \",\"startTime\":1738087656,\"endTime\":1738087669},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"MMM.\",\"startTime\":1738087668,\"endTime\":1738087668},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"At least for me, it makes sense in my mind that the the biggest component about like ChatGPT is it''s built to chat. It''s built to have conversation. It wasn''t \",\"startTime\":1738087670,\"endTime\":1738087679},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"built on its surface level. \",\"startTime\":1738087679,\"endTime\":1738087683},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"To go in deep with things and even though we had the the plus version, which was like now having a whole fleet or a whole class of MIT graduates in your school just coming to help you out, you''re like, oh, this is awesome. You''re \",\"startTime\":1738087684,\"endTime\":1738087695},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"a specialist and everything. But even at that, having it even trained even more \",\"startTime\":1738087695,\"endTime\":1738087698},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"specifically because just being able to chat about a topic doesn''t mean that they''re able to help support you in in the needs that you have for the problems that you are working on and the solutions that you''re trying to find. I mean, \",\"startTime\":1738087698,\"endTime\":1738087710},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738087709,\"endTime\":1738087711},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"they might be able to help you think it out loud. \",\"startTime\":1738087710,\"endTime\":1738087713},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And to work through those things, but when it comes to like an IEP situation for your stu