	('99a3fbcb-01ef-4bca-8d3b-e90bbc155577', '86f608d8-be4a-47b2-9c8a-b0b3fb52dabb', '134638', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"How are you?\",\"startTime\":1732054754,\"endTime\":1732054755},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Good morning.\",\"startTime\":1732054754,\"endTime\":1732054755},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"So it''s asking me to tell you, ask you to share a fun fact about yourself.\",\"startTime\":1732054757,\"endTime\":1732054761},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"I don''t like cheese. I don''t know, but I don''t like cheese, all right?\",\"startTime\":1732054764,\"endTime\":1732054770},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1732054767,\"endTime\":1732054767},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Perfect.\",\"startTime\":1732054771,\"endTime\":1732054771},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"So, Sherry, a fun fact about yourself.\",\"startTime\":1732054774,\"endTime\":1732054777},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I do like cheese.\",\"startTime\":1732054778,\"endTime\":1732054779},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"There we go. Fair enough. OK, how do how do we? That is a big one. I''m a real \",\"startTime\":1732054780,\"endTime\":1732054788},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"What makes you an effective leader? Oh, that''s a bigger one.\",\"startTime\":1732054787,\"endTime\":1732054790},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"big believer in team. Everything that I do is centered around team. It''s we. \",\"startTime\":1732054788,\"endTime\":1732054795},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Everything is we and I think that inclusiveness helps move things forward. So \",\"startTime\":1732054802,\"endTime\":1732054807},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"same question for you. \",\"startTime\":1732054807,\"endTime\":1732054812},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732054810,\"endTime\":1732054810},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I''m still learning that I''m, you know, three years deep in being an assistant principal. But I think the ability to form relationships and listen to people \",\"startTime\":1732054816,\"endTime\":1732054824},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"is, is really a good start in doing that. And a teacher the other day said, \",\"startTime\":1732054824,\"endTime\":1732054828},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"thank you for saying yes. And I said, what do you mean by that? She goes, you''re \",\"startTime\":1732054828,\"endTime\":1732054832},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"always open to new ideas. I said, oh, cool, OK. I didn''t know what she meant. \",\"startTime\":1732054832,\"endTime\":1732054836},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"So that was cool to hear that. \",\"startTime\":1732054836,\"endTime\":1732054840},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome. OK, let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1732054841,\"endTime\":1732054844},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"All right, what''s the next goal in your leadership journey?\",\"startTime\":1732054846,\"endTime\":1732054850},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"I want to be principal either at a junior high or an elementary school.\",\"startTime\":1732054852,\"endTime\":1732054855},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Perfect.\",\"startTime\":1732054859,\"endTime\":1732054859},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"So same. Oh, I''m sorry. Let''s go back because I was supposed to ask you that \",\"startTime\":1732054859,\"endTime\":1732054864},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"question. Yeah. What''s the next goal of your leadership? Right. OK, Let''s see \",\"startTime\":1732054864,\"endTime\":1732054868},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Bye bye.\",\"startTime\":1732054865,\"endTime\":1732054866},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I agree. I''m debating whether to, I''m not done at the current school I''m at, \",\"startTime\":1732054868,\"endTime\":1732054873},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"here. There we are. After hearing from your partner, Cher, what is the strength \",\"startTime\":1732054868,\"endTime\":1732054872},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"of your schools? \",\"startTime\":1732054872,\"endTime\":1732054876},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"but I don''t know if you''re ever going to be done right. And so there''s some \",\"startTime\":1732054873,\"endTime\":1732054877},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"things I''m looking at is is it time for me to move on to the next level? Do \",\"startTime\":1732054877,\"endTime\":1732054881},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I go to a new district and become an assistant or do I go up to principal this next level? I don''t know if three years is enough, but I''m in the same boat. \",\"startTime\":1732054881,\"endTime\":1732054890},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"I''m like looking for that. What is the next step? So yeah, how old do you think? \",\"startTime\":1732054890,\"endTime\":1732054894},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"What? What?\",\"startTime\":1732054904,\"endTime\":1732054905},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah. So what is the strength of your school''s culture?\",\"startTime\":1732054906,\"endTime\":1732054909},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"We are really, it''s just we became really inclusive. We do the wrong Clark system \",\"startTime\":1732054911,\"endTime\":1732054916},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"where we have house and we build our whole culture around that house site in. \",\"startTime\":1732054916,\"endTime\":1732054921},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1732054918,\"endTime\":1732054918},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"So in two years we really gotten it going and it''s all about us and our houses and how we can better our school. So we''ve done some really good things there. \",\"startTime\":1732054923,\"endTime\":1732054935},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"That''s cool. Yeah, we''re struggling with culture. There''s been a huge influx \",\"startTime\":1732054937,\"endTime\":1732054941},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"of Guatemalan population. We''re at 30% of our school in the last 10 years, so \",\"startTime\":1732054941,\"endTime\":1732054946},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"it''s grown from nothing to 30%. And so really looking at integrating a different \",\"startTime\":1732054946,\"endTime\":1732054950},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"culture and in in a authentic way, not a fake way. So that''s one of the things \",\"startTime\":1732054950,\"endTime\":1732054954},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1732054953,\"endTime\":1732054953},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"we''ve been struggling with. \",\"startTime\":1732054954,\"endTime\":1732054959},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Are you guys have got a ton? We''ve got some, but it''s about 30%.\",\"startTime\":1732054959,\"endTime\":1732054965},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s 30% and growing. So yeah, it''s been crazy.\",\"startTime\":1732054964,\"endTime\":1732054968},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1732054967,\"endTime\":1732054967},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"What do we have next?\",\"startTime\":1732054970,\"endTime\":1732054971},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"What is an area of work for you in regard to schools culture?\",\"startTime\":1732054972,\"endTime\":1732054976},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"We need to. We got the kids aboard. We need to really do a better job of getting \",\"startTime\":1732054979,\"endTime\":1732054983},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"the parents involved as well on a more consistent basis. I get them to start \",\"startTime\":1732054983,\"endTime\":1732054987},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"living part of our school with their kids. \",\"startTime\":1732054987,\"endTime\":1732054991},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"Right now. Perfect. Yeah. Because your middle level as well, right? Yeah. And \",\"startTime\":1732054993,\"endTime\":1732054998},{\"speaker\":\"11316\",\"text\":\"so I think the elementary, we''re talking about this last night at either dinner or drinks, I 