t next and then I think you have to hit next too.\",\"startTime\":1733237616,\"endTime\":1733237620},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK, trying to drive. Where did you teach for Stone? Already did these.\",\"startTime\":1733237621,\"endTime\":1733237625},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237626,\"endTime\":1733237626},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"More How did you end up becoming it? Oh, we did that one right.\",\"startTime\":1733237634,\"endTime\":1733237639},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I think so. I just hit. Did you hit next down at the bottom? There it goes.\",\"startTime\":1733237639,\"endTime\":1733237643},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Partner ready, I got it.\",\"startTime\":1733237643,\"endTime\":1733237646},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"What do you hope to learn or achieve? What do you hope to learn or achieve?\",\"startTime\":1733237647,\"endTime\":1733237651},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I just think it''s nice to connect with other people that are in a similar role. \",\"startTime\":1733237653,\"endTime\":1733237657},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I feel like sometimes like I like what I take away is something I wasn''t even expecting, if that makes sense. \",\"startTime\":1733237657,\"endTime\":1733237664},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"How many years have you been principal?\",\"startTime\":1733237667,\"endTime\":1733237668},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So what this is, I''m an assistant principal and this is my second year.\",\"startTime\":1733237669,\"endTime\":1733237672},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK.\",\"startTime\":1733237675,\"endTime\":1733237676},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So yeah, how about you?\",\"startTime\":1733237677,\"endTime\":1733237679},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I think both the collegiality and the congeniality help sharpen the sword. Nobody \",\"startTime\":1733237682,\"endTime\":1733237688},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"knows or understands what we do. Like if you go to a dinner party and you''re \",\"startTime\":1733237688,\"endTime\":1733237694},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"a policeman, you get to tell everybody all your cool stories. Or if you''re a \",\"startTime\":1733237694,\"endTime\":1733237700},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"doctor, you can tell everybody your cool stories if you''re a teacher or principal. \",\"startTime\":1733237700,\"endTime\":1733237705},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Your stories just aren''t that cool, so it''s nice to talk to other people.\",\"startTime\":1733237708,\"endTime\":1733237712},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Who walk the same life as you, both collegially, who understand the challenges, the parents, the district office, curriculum, budget, all of those things, as well as congenial. Just the opportunity to meet people, be a positive influence \",\"startTime\":1733237714,\"endTime\":1733237726},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"on their lives. \",\"startTime\":1733237726,\"endTime\":1733237731},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that definitely makes sense. And I was just thinking because you''ve you''ve \",\"startTime\":1733237731,\"endTime\":1733237736},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"been in so many different schools, you might know my principal, Jeanette Siemers. \",\"startTime\":1733237736,\"endTime\":1733237741},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I probably know the name, but I''ve been at, I''ve been at Kamiak in the last 20 years. \",\"startTime\":1733237744,\"endTime\":1733237750},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I see. OK. She, she seems to know everyone everywhere we go. She was at Monroe \",\"startTime\":1733237749,\"endTime\":1733237754},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"for a long time and then at Cascade, and now she''s here. So. \",\"startTime\":1733237754,\"endTime\":1733237759},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m heading next just because I''m cognizant of the time here. All \",\"startTime\":1733237762,\"endTime\":1733237766},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"right, it says read this scenario. \",\"startTime\":1733237766,\"endTime\":1733237769},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Ah.\",\"startTime\":1733237767,\"endTime\":1733237767},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"No, I''m still driving, so you''re fine.\",\"startTime\":1733237768,\"endTime\":1733237770},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"And problem solve with your partner. Let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1733237774,\"endTime\":1733237776},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"You''ve been asked to ensure teachers across your district become good at one thing you''re great at good at one thing you''re great at OK. \",\"startTime\":1733237776,\"endTime\":1733237783},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Well, I mean, I was a teacher for a really long time. And then I did, I was \",\"startTime\":1733237785,\"endTime\":1733237789},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"like, they called us a professional learning leader. I did all the new teacher \",\"startTime\":1733237789,\"endTime\":1733237792},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"mentoring and all the professional learning for staff. \",\"startTime\":1733237792,\"endTime\":1733237795},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I''m really good at building student centered learner centered lessons learning experiences. \",\"startTime\":1733237798,\"endTime\":1733237804},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1733237808,\"endTime\":1733237808},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"So at working at a high school, I have some teachers that are there and some teachers that are still lecturing, you know, bell to bell. \",\"startTime\":1733237810,\"endTime\":1733237818},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So it''s interesting you say that one Hattie actually shows direct instruction as greater than a .41 impact on student achievement. \",\"startTime\":1733237817,\"endTime\":1733237825},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"In in snippets.\",\"startTime\":1733237828,\"endTime\":1733237830},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"In what? Oh, in snippets.\",\"startTime\":1733237832,\"endTime\":1733237834},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"In moderate, In moderation, yes. Not bell to bell.\",\"startTime\":1733237834,\"endTime\":1733237837},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Well, a good teacher is using discussion and other strategies integrated in, not just a monologue. \",\"startTime\":1733237838,\"endTime\":1733237844},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1733237842,\"endTime\":1733237843},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That''s right. That''s right.\",\"startTime\":1733237844,\"endTime\":1733237845},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"How about you? What''s one thing that you''re great at that you would want your \",\"startTime\":1733237847,\"endTime\":1733237850},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"teachers to also be good at? \",\"startTime\":1733237850,\"endTime\":1733237852},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I''m old, so it it''s we have a different challenge because.\",\"startTime\":1733237853,\"endTime\":1733237858},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I''ve hired all but probably, I think there''s probably 8 or 9 that I haven''t hired in my time at Kemayakan. \",\"startTime\":1733237862,\"endTime\":1733237870},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So we have done life together for so long. They all know and are part of who \",\"startTime\":1733237871,\"endTime\":1733237876},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"we are and what we do and we do the OR we believe in the the good to great Collins, good to great hedgehog concept. We''re going to do these things ABC and D better \",\"startTime\":1733237876,\"endTime\":1733237884},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"than anybody else in the world. So we really go after, I don''t know if it''s \",\"startTime\":1733237884,\"endTime\":1733237889},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"instructionally, but we really go after freshman, smaller class size, freshman pass rate. \",\"startTime\":1733237889,\"endTime\":1733237898},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237899,\"endTime\":1733237899},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Rigor and instruction rigor in classes.\",\"startTime\":1733237900,\"endTime\":1733237902},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Building relationships, but we''ve been doing it for so long, it''s just part of who we are and what we do. \",\"startTime\":1733237903,\"endTime\":1733237909},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And it''s kind of a natural flow, but if you''re at Kamiakin, these are the things that we do better than anybody else in the world. \",\"startTime\":1733237912,\"endTime\":1733237919},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That''s nice. I mean, I think they say it like takes a high school principal \",\"startTime\":1733237921,\"endTime\":1733237924},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"like 7 to 10 years to make like really big impact in the building. So sounds \",\"startTime\":1733237924,\"endTime\":1733237927},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"like. \",\"startTime\":1733237927,\"endTime\":1733237930},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"And the and the average tenure of a high school principal is less than three. \",\"startTime\":1733237930,\"endTime\":1733237934},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1733237934,\"endTime\":1733237937},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So, yeah, I feel like here at Cedar Crest, like they, they pride them. \",\"startTime\":1733237935,\"endTime\":1733237938},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"They''ve always prided themselves on having really strong relationships with kids. \",\"startTime\":1733237938,\"endTime\":1733237944},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Instructionally it would be build relationships, but that''s such a glib response. \",\"startTime\":1733237946,\"endTime\":1733237951},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Now. 100 years ago when Ruby Payne was brand new, that was one that everybody \",\"startTime\":1733237951,\"endTime\":1733237957},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"did. And now it''s, well, the kids misbehaving because you don''t have a relationship, \",\"startTime\":1733237957,\"endTime\":1733237962},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"which is such a Jack wagon answer. So yeah, I mean. \",\"startTime\":1733237962,\"endTime\":1733237967},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I think like after the pandemic.\",\"startTime\":1733237975,\"endTime\":1733237977},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"We definitely, I mean, we''re trying to get back to.\",\"startTime\":1733237980,\"endTime\":1733237984},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Rigor and things like like that that were kind of lost during the pandemic.\",\"startTime\":1733237985,\"endTime\":1733237990},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep, yeah, that''s that natural pendulum has swung from the SEL kinder, softer, gentler. Just glad you''re here to now. It''s definitely leveraging for OK. Now \",\"startTime\":1733237989,\"endTime\":1733237999},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"we need you to have we need to have you prepared for your post secondary goals and plans. We''ve definitely made that switch. \",\"startTime\":1733237999,\"endTime\":1733238009},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Intentionally.\",\"startTime\":1733238011,\"endTime\":1733238011},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And so are your, are your build, is your building, are your teachers working \",\"startTime\":1733238017,\"endTime\":1733238021},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"in place? \",\"startTime\":1733238021,\"endTime\":1733238024},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"They have de facto PLCS.\",\"startTime\":1733238025,\"endTime\":1733238026},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We don''t have a system in place to give them enough common time to have authentic PLCS. \",\"startTime\":1733238028,\"endTime\":1733238035},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So some departments, ELA has really strong de facto ones.\",\"startTime\":1733238038,\"endTime\":1733238043},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We have teachers who are really good at collaborating with teachers are really good at collaborating. So kind of a kind of a mix, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1733238044,\"endTime\":1733238052},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Next, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733238054,\"endTime\":1733238055},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Well, this is our district''s third attempt to roll out PLC, so I will say we go ahead. \",\"startTime\":1733238055,\"endTime\":1733238064},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and.\",\"startTime\":1733238065,\"endTime\":1733238066},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"No.\",\"startTime\":1733238068,\"endTime\":1733238068},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"I just as the way, yeah, I mean, at least this time around, I feel like there''s way more intention behind training and. \",\"startTime\":1733238070,\"endTime\":1733238077},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Your third attempt to roll them out.\",\"startTime\":1733238070,\"endTime\":1733238072},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Where before it was just.\",\"startTime\":1733238081,\"endTime\":1733238082},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Go.\",\"startTime\":1733238084,\"endTime\":1733238084},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah, we''ve had a couple formal pushes back in like 06 when we were at Gate School. We pushed it really hard, but then it went away, the funding went away. \",\"startTime\":1733238087,\"endTime\":1733238097},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"We have What''s your early release schedule?\",\"startTime\":1733238099,\"endTime\":1733238101},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"We''re out. We have 90 minutes on Fridays, every Friday. But there''s a little \",\"startTime\":1733238102,\"endTime\":1733238106},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Every Friday.\",\"startTime\":1733238106,\"endTime\":1733238106},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"caveat because there''s some that are building in district directed, but the great majority are have been contracted as teacher directed. So teachers can \",\"startTime\":1733238106,\"endTime\":1733238115},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"choose to meet in place or they can choose not. \",\"startTime\":1733238115,\"endTime\":1733238120},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733238117,\"endTime\":1733238117},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Isn''t that wonderful?\",\"startTime\":1733238123,\"endTime\":1733238125},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"In our buildings as a district, the high schools don''t have it, but the middle and elementaries have. Every Wednesday early release and principals control \",\"startTime\":1733238126,\"endTime\":1733238134},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"one a month. The rest are teacher controlled. \",\"startTime\":1733238134,\"endTime\":1733238138},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733238136,\"endTime\":1733238136},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"Yeah, makes it challenging, so.\",\"startTime\":1733238138,\"endTime\":1733238140},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Well, we don''t even have that. We have, we have one early release a month total. \",\"startTime\":1733238141,\"endTime\":1733238145},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"That''s interesting that that the high school is different than the middle and the elementaries. Yeah. So all right, Chris, I''m going to have to. We''re about \",\"startTime\":1733238147,\"endTime\":1733238153},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1733238152,\"endTime\":1733238153},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"to open the doors and stuff, so I''m going to have to get going. But it was nice \",\"startTime\":1733238153,\"endTime\":1733238156},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"to meet you. \",\"startTime\":1733238156,\"endTime\":1733238159},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733238157,\"endTime\":1733238158},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Nice to meet you, have a very happy holidays. I''m at Dutch Brothers already. \",\"startTime\":1733238162,\"endTime\":1733238167},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"You too hope you have a safe drive into work. OK, well it''s about to get better \",\"startTime\":1733238164,\"endTime\":1733238167},{\"speaker\":\"11329\",\"text\":\"then already today. \",\"startTime\":1733238167,\"endTime\":1733238170},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Have a great day.\",\"startTime\":1733238173,\"endTime\":1733238174},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Hey, good.\",\"startTime\":1733238176,\"endTime\":1733238177}]"', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.30261+00', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.30261+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 977, "created_at": "2025-05-08T03:17:44.279Z", "session_title": "#learning_to_human", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "33", "name": "#learning_to_human", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "Inclusion"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
