f 2026 to have 100,000, right. Like we''ve said, \",\"startTime\":1739568311,\"endTime\":1739568317},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like let''s go, let''s go big right now. We have in our closed communities. \",\"startTime\":1739568317,\"endTime\":1739568322},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Probably about 400, but they''re just using the up Duo app because last year we were in an education vertical that was like just get on Up Duo and connect with people. And then we have about 140 that were got in line like you did and \",\"startTime\":1739568322,\"endTime\":1739568335},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"then are getting into the app right now into side by itself. So we''ll see. But \",\"startTime\":1739568335,\"endTime\":1739568339},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"the plan is to be to use this spring to really make it work like minimum viable products so that people can come in and have conversations, info goes back like it, it can work. \",\"startTime\":1739568339,\"endTime\":1739568352},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And then just really go after where the space in place that you can learn AI from colleagues. We''re for educators by educators. We''re not sit and get and \",\"startTime\":1739568355,\"endTime\":1739568363},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"we''ll actually help you move forward and then also help you advocate to your school to have a better policy or get better tools or this or that. So the road \",\"startTime\":1739568363,\"endTime\":1739568370},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"map is ambitious. And some of that is we had to say to Google, like, what''s \",\"startTime\":1739568370,\"endTime\":1739568374},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"your 4 year plan around? \",\"startTime\":1739568374,\"endTime\":1739568378},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Applying for their AI accelerator. And so we''re thinking like it''s not that \",\"startTime\":1739568378,\"endTime\":1739568382},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"hard if we''re positioning ourselves well and if we''re improving based on user feedback. So not going not over developing as we go, but really thinking like, \",\"startTime\":1739568382,\"endTime\":1739568389},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"what are our users telling us? \",\"startTime\":1739568389,\"endTime\":1739568393},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568393,\"endTime\":1739568394},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, yeah. Awesome. Yeah. Thank you. Thank you for for that, Umm.\",\"startTime\":1739568393,\"endTime\":1739568398},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Would you mind if I ask you umm, about funding?\",\"startTime\":1739568398,\"endTime\":1739568401},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568401,\"endTime\":1739568401},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, sure. So we''re, we have precede round basically like Angel investors to \",\"startTime\":1739568402,\"endTime\":1739568406},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1739568404,\"endTime\":1739568404},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"start and we''re looking for about 2 million and we''re in the 700,000 range or we''re in the 800,000 range right now. \",\"startTime\":1739568406,\"endTime\":1739568415},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Of our 2 million initial precede and then we''ve applied for 1.5 million from \",\"startTime\":1739568416,\"endTime\":1739568421},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"the Google accelerator will apply for other grants like that, like big. \",\"startTime\":1739568421,\"endTime\":1739568426},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Accelerator slash.\",\"startTime\":1739568426,\"endTime\":1739568427},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Grant elements especially aligned to AI and education. So like Google''s was \",\"startTime\":1739568430,\"endTime\":1739568434},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like, how are people going to learn AI? And that''s where we felt like this was \",\"startTime\":1739568434,\"endTime\":1739568438},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"deeply aligned once we finish up February. \",\"startTime\":1739568438,\"endTime\":1739568442},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"The Google we won''t know about Google for a bit, but they''re there. They closed \",\"startTime\":1739568442,\"endTime\":1739568444},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"this this week. \",\"startTime\":1739568444,\"endTime\":1739568447},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"But we''ll probably move into.\",\"startTime\":1739568447,\"endTime\":1739568449},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Looking at VC firms for the next round and then just continuing with grants and accelerators and seeing where that might land. So we feel really good and \",\"startTime\":1739568451,\"endTime\":1739568458},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1739568452,\"endTime\":1739568458},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"confident and at the same time we know that we don''t have enough to say we''re good for three years, so. \",\"startTime\":1739568458,\"endTime\":1739568465},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah. No, of course. No, I, I, I am with you in that aspect.\",\"startTime\":1739568465,\"endTime\":1739568468},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568467,\"endTime\":1739568469},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Yeah, good news about Google, because they.\",\"startTime\":1739568470,\"endTime\":1739568473},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1739568474,\"endTime\":1739568475},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"Their Gemini 2.0 flash like 2 days ago. I''m already exploring it.\",\"startTime\":1739568476,\"endTime\":1739568481},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"And it''s so cheap, so cheap. It''s like I''m going to send you.\",\"startTime\":1739568481,\"endTime\":1739568486},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, well, and it''s so much better. And because we have a business account, \",\"startTime\":1739568487,\"endTime\":1739568491},{\"speaker\":\"11874\",\"text\":\"It''s like incredible cheap.\",\"startTime\