''m failing. And. \",\"startTime\":1734447749,\"endTime\":1734447753},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734447769,\"endTime\":1734447769},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"You just have to build their confidence and then it''s also a sign that maybe you need to to think about how you might take an asset based approach to with this particular situation. What strategies do we know are working? How do we \",\"startTime\":1734447772,\"endTime\":1734447786},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"do more of that and reframe it to an asset based approach? Another another way \",\"startTime\":1734447786,\"endTime\":1734447791},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"of dealing with that. Go ahead. \",\"startTime\":1734447791,\"endTime\":1734447795},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I I haven''t there''s one.\",\"startTime\":1734447802,\"endTime\":1734447803}]"', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.36087+00', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.36087+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 977, "created_at": "2025-05-08T03:17:44.335Z", "session_title": "Creating Space for Data-Driven Dialogue", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1441", "name": "Creating Space for Data-Driven Dialogue", "tags": [{"name": "HSLC"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
