	('13b9c160-114a-4824-95b2-b54602c902d8', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', '136643', '"[{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Good morning, Jennifer.\",\"startTime\":1738075551,\"endTime\":1738075552},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Hi, good morning.\",\"startTime\":1738075553,\"endTime\":1738075553},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Hey, great to see you.\",\"startTime\":1738075553,\"endTime\":1738075555},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Good to see you.\",\"startTime\":1738075555,\"endTime\":1738075556},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, love it. But uh, go ahead.\",\"startTime\":1738075558,\"endTime\":1738075562},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"This is good, OK.\",\"startTime\":1738075561,\"endTime\":1738075561},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Nope, I''m just good morning and just happened to happy to have somebody to chat with this week. I usually get a recording. \",\"startTime\":1738075561,\"endTime\":1738075567},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh, shoot, shoot.\",\"startTime\":1738075568,\"endTime\":1738075569},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I don''t think.\",\"startTime\":1738075569,\"endTime\":1738075570},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I''m glad to have you as well.\",\"startTime\":1738075570,\"endTime\":1738075571},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I don''t think any other elementary are up this early.\",\"startTime\":1738075571,\"endTime\":1738075574},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"And so I think I don''t. I don''t find someone to to match with.\",\"startTime\":1738075578,\"endTime\":1738075582},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Because again, we don''t start for a while, but I can''t drive and get there, so I do it from home. \",\"startTime\":1738075584,\"endTime\":1738075589},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah, No, no worries whatsoever. No worries whatsoever. So I''m tracking \",\"startTime\":1738075589,\"endTime\":1738075593},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"down the road here, but that''s all right. So how was I know it''s like almost \",\"startTime\":1738075593,\"endTime\":1738075597},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"the end of January, which is crazy, but came back, all right, Had a great new year and all that good stuff. \",\"startTime\":1738075597,\"endTime\":1738075605},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Well, good.\",\"startTime\":1738075599,\"endTime\":1738075599},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yes, yes, everybody came back refreshed of course and so.\",\"startTime\":1738075606,\"endTime\":1738075611},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"It was nice to see everybody relaxed and ready to start again this month. So \",\"startTime\":1738075612,\"endTime\":1738075616},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"it just seems so busy already when I look at the calendar and you put things on like your newsletters and things, it''s. \",\"startTime\":1738075616,\"endTime\":1738075624},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Is it? Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075618,\"endTime\":1738075619},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh my gosh, I''m already putting, you know, mid February dates because we have to be ready for like testing and we have. \",\"startTime\":1738075625,\"endTime\":1738075633},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075629,\"endTime\":1738075630},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"ML testing and I don''t know, it''s just crazy. I got caught.\",\"startTime\":1738075633,\"endTime\":1738075637},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075636,\"endTime\":1738075637},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"My husband, Mark Knight, Yeah, I was like, I got Scott.\",\"startTime\":1738075639,\"endTime\":1738075643},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh, perfect.\",\"startTime\":1738075641,\"endTime\":1738075643},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Perfect, Scott. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075644,\"endTime\":1738075645},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1738075648,\"endTime\":1738075649},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"All right, let''s hop in here.\",\"startTime\":1738075649,\"endTime\":1738075651},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, let''s see. Do we hit next? OK.\",\"startTime\":1738075651,\"endTime\":1738075653},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Next. Yep, hit next.\",\"startTime\":1738075654,\"endTime\":1738075655},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Certain already OK partner.\",\"startTime\":1738075656,\"endTime\":1738075658},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And I''ll let, I''ll let, I''ll let you read the questions.\",\"startTime\":1738075658,\"endTime\":1738075660},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, ask your partner what makes you an effective leader.\",\"startTime\":1738075660,\"endTime\":1738075664},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You know, as I, as I reflect back over time, I think it, it took me a while to figure figure it out. And, and I, I''ll, I''ll. \",\"startTime\":1738075671,\"endTime\":1738075678},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Think about the school leader paradigm for a second. My first few years I was, \",\"startTime\":1738075679,\"endTime\":1738075682},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I didn''t understand the buckets like around culture, systems and learning, but I knew I was probably more focused on the doing that I was leaning into who I was and what I was becoming and. \",\"startTime\":1738075682,\"endTime\":1738075693},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1738075682,\"endTime\":1738075683},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And it wasn''t until, you know, a few years in where you finally get your, your feet underneath you, per se, where I was like, you know what? I need to really, \",\"startTime\":1738075696,\"endTime\":1738075702},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I need to start listening more to people and, and bringing them together and becoming. \",\"startTime\":1738075702,\"endTime\":1738075709},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Working that way as a as a leader and allowing more space for conversations. \",\"startTime\":1738075711,\"endTime\":1738075716},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1738075713,\"endTime\":1738075714},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And so I think that then combined with me just getting stuff done, you know? \",\"startTime\":1738075716,\"endTime\":1738075721},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Umm, kind of help me turn the curve with that to make some, to assist in making some pretty big changes at school. So it wasn''t till I realized that that I \",\"startTime\":1738075724,\"endTime\":1738075731},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"recognized that I should say and the importance of that, that I became more effective. \",\"startTime\":1738075731,\"endTime\":1738075738},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1738075738,\"endTime\":1738075738},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''d agree with that because this is only going into my third year with my own building. \",\"startTime\":1738075739,\"endTime\":1738075744},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I feel super busy all the time but it''s when I start to think about.\",\"startTime\":1738075746,\"endTime\":1738075752},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"When I''m like listening to a podcast or reflecting on some of these questions too, it''s like, but am I doing the work? Like am I actually getting any work \",\"startTime\":1738075753,\"endTime\":1738075764},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"done? And so that''s I think more reflecting that I do is what''s next? Like what? \",\"startTime\":1738075764,\"endTime\":1738075770},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Have they seen my my leadership or who I want to be yet and so.\",\"startTime\":1738075773,\"endTime\":1738075778},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I don''t know. I mean, listening like you said is what I''m trying to do, trying \",\"startTime\":1738075780,\"endTime\":1738075784},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"to get more of my staff involved because the building is only, they''ve been together seven years and we have of course, you start with only like 10 staff members and now we''re to, you know, 35 certificated and 35 pairs. So we''ve grown \",\"startTime\":1738075784,\"endTime\":1738075798},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1738075794,\"endTime\":1738075794},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"and they went through COVID and I mean it just hasn''t been a regular year and so. \",\"startTime\":1738075798,\"endTime\":1738075808},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right, right.\",\"startTime\":1738075804,\"endTime\":1738075805},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"They''re considering this their first normal year. And I''m like, OK, OK. So yeah, \",\"startTime\":1738075810,\"endTime\":1738075813},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"what does that look like as we move forward, As I move forward? Because right \",\"startTime\":1738075813,\"endTime\":1738075817},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075817,\"endTime\":1738075818},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"now I feel like I put out a lot of fires. \",\"startTime\":1738075817,\"endTime\":1738075821},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I''m getting better at preparing for things and you know what''s coming up and what do we need to be doing? But I''m not yet. I mean, I''m still still figuring \",\"startTime\":1738075821,\"endTime\":1738075827},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"things out. It''s. \",\"startTime\":1738075827,\"endTime\":1738075830},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I mean, it''s, it''s hard in the moment. And again, where do we I, you know, I \",\"startTime\":1738075831,\"endTime\":1738075835},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"have a direction of where we want to go and things. But yeah, bringing everybody \",\"startTime\":1738075835,\"endTime\":1738075839},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075835,\"endTime\":1738075837},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"on board and then we just keep adding staff members. I mean, I just. \",\"startTime\":1738075839,\"endTime\":1738075843},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"There and it''s like.\",\"startTime\":1738075846,\"endTime\":1738075847},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"So it''s, it''s good to hear that I don''t, I don''t have to have it figured out right now. I''ll just say that when I take it. Oh, thank God. Oh my God. \",\"startTime\":1738075851,\"endTime\":1738075858},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"No, no, Hell no, no, no. Yeah, I''d, I''d actually, I''d actually be more worried \",\"startTime\":1738075855,\"endTime\":1738075859},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"if you thought you had it figured out. I''d be like, oh. \",\"startTime\":1738075859,\"endTime\":1738075862},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I don''t think so.\",\"startTime\":1738075864,\"endTime\":1738075865},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"No, I don''t have that figured out at all.\",\"startTime\":1738075865,\"endTime\":1738075867},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Alright, what''s that?\",\"startTime\":1738075870,\"endTime\":1738075872},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Here, no more and more. Each year I know more and more.\",\"startTime\":1738075870,\"endTime\":1738075873},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075874,\"endTime\":1738075875},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"So I''m trying to grow on that, but no, I don''t have it figured out.\",\"startTime\":1738075874,\"endTime\":1738075877},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Good, good, good.\",\"startTime\":1738075878,\"endTime\":1738075880},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"All right, I''m going to do our next.\",\"startTime\":1738075879,\"endTime\":1738075881},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Take turns, OK Describe the next goal in your leadership journey.\",\"startTime\":1738075885,\"endTime\":1738075889},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh wait, it says more. What does that mean? Oh, what has been?\",\"startTime\":1738075892,\"endTime\":1738075895},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ll just, it''ll just give you some tips, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075894,\"endTime\":1738075897},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Notable, but strategies OK. Are there any unexpected benefits?\",\"startTime\":1738075896,\"endTime\":1738075901},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"The next goal for my journey.\",\"startTime\":1738075902,\"endTime\":1738075906},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"And I''ve kind of started it this year is the.\",\"startTime\":1738075906,\"endTime\":1738075910},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"The growing other leaders in the building, they weren''t used to anybody really asking them to like step up or offering, hey, what are you interested in? Or \",\"startTime\":1738075913,\"endTime\":1738075925},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"you know, math seems to be really something you dive into. Would you like to \",\"startTime\":1738075925,\"endTime\":1738075931},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"do some of the leadership? So I''ve been slowly finding each. \",\"startTime\":1738075931,\"endTime\":1738075937},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Person''s strengths and just opening that door for them if they''re interested or not. And so I mean, I shared leadership like I can''t do it all. And so just \",\"startTime\":1738075939,\"endTime\":1738075948},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"trying to just like starting to show them where they have strengths and tapping into it. So that''s what I''ve been really working on this year. \",\"startTime\":1738075948,\"endTime\":1738075958},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075955,\"endTime\":1738075957},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"It''s great to hear and it actually really aligns with what you said in the first \",\"startTime\":1738075959,\"endTime\":1738075962},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"question about, you know, I''m busy, busy, busy, but I got to find others to, to help me, you know, and, and, and they''re in your building and we, we forget about that a lot of times. That was great to hear. \",\"startTime\":1738075962,\"endTime\":1738075972},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075967,\"endTime\":1738075968},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I think, you know, my journey is obviously I think a little more different than than being in a building. \",\"startTime\":1738075974,\"endTime\":1738075979},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738075978,\"endTime\":1738075979},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"So I think I''m gonna, I''m gonna lean into I''ve got, we''re working extremely hard right now. And after our board meeting last weekend where we can meet a \",\"startTime\":1738075979,\"endTime\":1738075987},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"bunch of stakeholders and others, we need to figure out the, the system wide preparation in our state for school leaders because it doesn''t match the realities of what''s going on in buildings right now. And so we''re, we''re preparing people \",\"startTime\":1738075987,\"endTime\":1738075999},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"for leadership that doesn''t exist because it''s what was and not what is and what will be. And so I need my leadership journey. \",\"startTime\":1738075999,\"endTime\":1738076006},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Is really inserting myself and being that leader at the state level with a variety of stakeholder groups? \",\"startTime\":1738076010,\"endTime\":1738076014},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"To get them to understand and recognize and realize the importance of that and that we as a WSP with a mighty team of, you know, 5 or 6 people, we need you to help us with this. \",\"startTime\":1738076016,\"endTime\":1738076027},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076024,\"endTime\":1738076024},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And recognize, recognize our statewide problem of practice that''s right in front of us and we understand it adds more to your plate. And I guess I would say \",\"startTime\":1738076029,\"endTime\":1738076036},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076034,\"endTime\":1738076036},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"it doesn''t add more to their plates. They have to change the work that they \",\"startTime\":1738076036,\"endTime\":1738076039},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"do to reflect the times that we''re in. And so anyway, so that''s when I think \",\"startTime\":1738076039,\"endTime\":1738076043},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Agreed.\",\"startTime\":1738076042,\"endTime\":1738076043},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"about my leadership journey, it''s not obviously building based, it''s more, it''s more in that realm. \",\"startTime\":1738076043,\"endTime\":1738076050},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"With other stakeholder groups to make the systemic changes so we can have people like you be extremely successful, you know? \",\"startTime\":1738076051,\"endTime\":1738076058},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"That''s so good to hear ''cause I mean, I''ve got.\",\"startTime\":1738076059,\"endTime\":1738076062},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"9 or 10 years, I mean, and I want to stay in education and more and more it''s like I''m out, you know, and we hear teachers, I''m out like this is horrible, all these things. And I''m like, but you can''t because you''re one of the good \",\"startTime\":1738076062,\"endTime\":1738076074},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"ones If we just let all the good ones, like leave the profession and they go do other things and we''re stuck with the crappy ones, you know? And so, yeah, \",\"startTime\":1738076074,\"endTime\":1738076082},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"they need the change. We need people to, you know, hang in there. And we know \",\"startTime\":1738076082,\"endTime\":1738076086},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076084,\"endTime\":1738076085},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"that education swings from one end to the next, but. \",\"startTime\":1738076086,\"endTime\":1738076090},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I mean, since listening to UMM and spending more time with AWSP, it''s exciting that that work is being done. \",\"startTime\":1738076092,\"endTime\":1738076101},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"That we do have people like you who are looking out for us and wanting to help us and be successful because education isn''t like it was five years ago, 10 years ago, 20 years ago. I mean, we have to do something. And like you said, \",\"startTime\":1738076101,\"endTime\":1738076113},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"more and more on our plate, like how are we handling some, what are some systems that help us with that? So that''s exciting to hear. \",\"startTime\":1738076113,\"endTime\":1738076121},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076122,\"endTime\":1738076123},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Now stay tuned. It''s not going to be an easy, easy climb, but we''re digging \",\"startTime\":1738076123,\"endTime\":1738076126},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"in. We''re digging in so. \",\"startTime\":1738076126,\"endTime\":1738076129},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh, not all.\",\"startTime\":1738076127,\"endTime\":1738076128},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I love it. All right, next. Let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1738076129,\"endTime\":1738076132},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Share with your partner what is the strength of your school''s culture.\",\"startTime\":1738076134,\"endTime\":1738076139},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1738076142,\"endTime\":1738076142},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Umm, our school.\",\"startTime\":1738076145,\"endTime\":1738076147},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"The the dedication and the heart for kids. They get so passionate.\",\"startTime\":1738076150,\"endTime\":1738076155},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"For the their kids, we''re working on all kids, which is interesting, but ''cause I have two, well, I''ve, I''ve 3 self-contained classes. But man, they have a \",\"startTime\":1738076158,\"endTime\":1738076168},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"heart for kids and they get so passionate and sometimes I have to help them with that passion and tone it down a little bit, which I think is a good problem to have, but it''s the passion it is. \",\"startTime\":1738076168,\"endTime\":1738076183},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076178,\"endTime\":1738076179},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"They really do. It''s, you know, the safety and the belonging and the well-being \",\"startTime\":1738076184,\"endTime\":1738076188},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"of our kids and I''m super proud of that. \",\"startTime\":1738076188,\"endTime\":1738076192},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s cool. That''s cool. Umm, it''s great to hear too, ''cause it remember \",\"startTime\":1738076194,\"endTime\":1738076198},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"the last building I was in, I, I recognized it was more, way more adult centered than student centered. Decisions were made for adults convenience rather than \",\"startTime\":1738076198,\"endTime\":1738076208},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"students convenience and what was right. And so slowly over time, I, I just \",\"startTime\":1738076208,\"endTime\":1738076212},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"leaned into that and, and you know, I remember after I left. \",\"startTime\":1738076212,\"endTime\":1738076217},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"The the the phrase the phrase in the building became.\",\"startTime\":1738076221,\"endTime\":1738076223},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Is that adult centered or student centered?\",\"startTime\":1738076224,\"endTime\":1738076226},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"For SH yeah, yeah. And there''s times we have to remind and then it''s like, Oh \",\"startTime\":1738076227,\"endTime\":1738076231},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"yeah, it''s like we''re going to do what''s best for kids. \",\"startTime\":1738076231,\"endTime\":1738076235},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076233,\"endTime\":1738076234},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"And they''re like, you''re right. And so we try to remind each other of that, \",\"startTime\":1738076235,\"endTime\":1738076237},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"but. \",\"startTime\":1738076237,\"endTime\":1738076239},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I''d have to say probably, you know, 98% of the time they''ve already thought about what''s good for kids or, you know, even just the act of if we''re doing small groups and you have a larger group that you know, that group stays in the classroom, whether it''s a paraeducator or a teacher. I mean, it''s the small \",\"startTime\":1738076240,\"endTime\":1738076259},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"things because some like, well, it''s my classroom and I''m staying and it''s like. \",\"startTime\":1738076259,\"endTime\":1738076263},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076261,\"endTime\":1738076263},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"You can''t. I mean, it''s the small things like comfortable, a place to teach, \",\"startTime\":1738076266,\"endTime\":1738076269},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"a place to where kids can, you know, stretch out and learn. And so, you know, \",\"startTime\":1738076269,\"endTime\":1738076273},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"even those things and we''re in a crowded building, like I don''t have any more room. \",\"startTime\":1738076273,\"endTime\":1738076279},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076280,\"endTime\":1738076281},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"You know, they start to think about.\",\"startTime\":1738076281,\"endTime\":1738076283},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Doubling up and they''re like OK yeah I can be out of my office all day or I''ll just share an office and we''ll work out schedule so. \",\"startTime\":1738076283,\"endTime\":1738076291},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"They''re, they''re, they''re good. They''re, I''m proud of them.\",\"startTime\":1738076292,\"endTime\":1738076295},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Cool. Wow, that sounds awesome and it''s been hard work for you to make that \",\"startTime\":1738076295,\"endTime\":1738076298},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"happen. But way to go. Way to go. \",\"startTime\":1738076298,\"endTime\":1738076302},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Hey, thanks.\",\"startTime\":1738076301,\"endTime\":1738076302},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Alright, let''s go next.\",\"startTime\":1738076304,\"endTime\":1738076305},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, share with me what is an area of work for you in regards to your school''s culture. Oh my goodness all I mean. \",\"startTime\":1738076306,\"endTime\":1738076314},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"There''s, I think it''s just the same thing. I think it''s just inclusion and that \",\"startTime\":1738076315,\"endTime\":1738076318},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"sense of belonging. \",\"startTime\":1738076318,\"endTime\":1738076321},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I think you have to always work at it. So it''s it''s not anything that we can \",\"startTime\":1738076321,\"endTime\":1738076324},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"say check we''ve done it. \",\"startTime\":1738076324,\"endTime\":1738076326},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right, right.\",\"startTime\":1738076327,\"endTime\":1738076328},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"No, it''s always there every single day. And and since combinative is Pi recognize \",\"startTime\":1738076328,\"endTime\":1738076331},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"the importance of that. And I''ve as I''ve been out and about facilitating stuff, \",\"startTime\":1738076331,\"endTime\":1738076335},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I''ve been asking a lot of questions around what are the like the NASA command center. You know that that and and you are you''re you''re taking all this data \",\"startTime\":1738076335,\"endTime\":1738076342},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"in like the flight. \",\"startTime\":1738076342,\"endTime\":1738076345},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Operator guru, I don''t know who that is, you know, the, the main person that says tweak this or tweak that. But so you''re gathering all of this information \",\"startTime\":1738076347,\"endTime\":1738076356},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Uh-huh. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076350,\"endTime\":1738076352},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"and, and it all related to culture and or climate, which we know are two different things. But you know, what are the, what are the gauges that you have to take \",\"startTime\":1738076356,\"endTime\":1738076366},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076357,\"endTime\":1738076357},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"information in on a regular basis to inform you whether the culture is being is, is is remaining solid or you know, I got to work on this because. \",\"startTime\":1738076366,\"endTime\":1738076375},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Cultures by design.\",\"startTime\":1738076378,\"endTime\":1738076378},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Been able to go by default if you let it, you know. So that''s what I''ve been \",\"startTime\":1738076379,\"endTime\":1738076383},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076382,\"endTime\":1738076383},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"asking a lot of people like what are the what are the gauges around culture? \",\"startTime\":1738076383,\"endTime\":1738076386},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You take the pulse of your building on a daily basis. Who do you, who do you \",\"startTime\":1738076387,\"endTime\":1738076391},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"talk to to gauge that? Like is it always the people that are always with you \",\"startTime\":1738076391,\"endTime\":1738076395},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"and all in before you or do you or do you, you know, is that is that gauge and that pulse? You know, the person that''s the the jerk head that you know, why \",\"startTime\":1738076395,\"endTime\":1738076403},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Right, right.\",\"startTime\":1738076398,\"endTime\":1738076399},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"are they in education? They don''t even like kids, you know. \",\"startTime\":1738076403,\"endTime\":1738076407},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Exactly. Exactly.\",\"startTime\":1738076408,\"endTime\":1738076410},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So those are anyway those if I was in a building, those are the things \",\"startTime\":1738076410,\"endTime\":1738076413},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"that I would I would try and figure out to to. \",\"startTime\":1738076413,\"endTime\":1738076416},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Stay on top of culture, I guess.\",\"startTime\":1738076417,\"endTime\":1738076419},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ve been.\",\"startTime\":1738076419,\"endTime\":1738076420},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Talking with our kids more, our students and, and not just like get them together on a panel or anything, but just like in conversations and, and finding that, you know, it''s not always just checking in with our fifth graders. I mean, they''re \",\"startTime\":1738076422,\"endTime\":1738076434},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076424,\"endTime\":1738076425},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"on their way out, but like our third and 4th and it''s like, you guys have a couple more years. So what is it about our school? What don''t you like? What \",\"startTime\":1738076434,\"endTime\":1738076442},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"do you want to change? And I mean, I''ve had a couple. \",\"startTime\":1738076442,\"endTime\":1738076446},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1738076443,\"endTime\":1738076444},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Who, you know, they''ll send me emails and they''re like, hey, you know, Mrs. \",\"startTime\":1738076446,\"endTime\":1738076450},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Knight, can can we talk? Can we? And I''m like, yeah, let''s I want to hear what \",\"startTime\":1738076450,\"endTime\":1738076454},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"you have to say. And, and a lot of it''s kind of like around recess and and some \",\"startTime\":1738076454,\"endTime\":1738076458},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"things and issues that happen, but it''s their school. And so, you know, trying \",\"startTime\":1738076458,\"endTime\":1738076462},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"to have more conversations with students I''m finding is really, I mean, they know everything about what goes at that school. And so and they''ll tell you. \",\"startTime\":1738076462,\"endTime\":1738076470},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah, yeah. And they''ll tell you and they''ll tell you. Yeah. So I''m glad \",\"startTime\":1738076467,\"endTime\":1738076471},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"you brought up the student voice piece because that''s a part of the pulse as well in terms of checking in with them. So awesome. \",\"startTime\":1738076471,\"endTime\":1738076479},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah. Alright. OK.\",\"startTime\":1738076479,\"endTime\":1738076480},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1738076479,\"endTime\":1738076480},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Got one more? Let''s see.\",\"startTime\":1738076480,\"endTime\":1738076482},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Oh, thank you, partner, and thank.\",\"startTime\":1738076483,\"endTime\":1738076485},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Thank you, partner.\",\"startTime\":1738076485,\"endTime\":1738076486},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"And it is nice to hear that.\",\"startTime\":1738076490,\"endTime\":1738076492},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"You don''t have it all figured out either. And I don''t need that. We always work \",\"startTime\":1738076492,\"endTime\":1738076496},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"CS GO.\",\"startTime\":1738076496,\"endTime\":1738076498},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"on it. So I appreciate that where it''s like it took me a few years because. \",\"startTime\":1738076496,\"endTime\":1738076499},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"That''s nice to hear, ''cause I''m still in those few years and I''m like, uh, not ever gonna get this. \",\"startTime\":1738076500,\"endTime\":1738076505},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Well, we, we may not, we may not fully, fully arrive, but we keep striving \",\"startTime\":1738076505,\"endTime\":1738076510},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"to get there. So, all right. \",\"startTime\":1738076510,\"endTime\":1738076514},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"I do. I do.\",\"startTime\":1738076511,\"endTime\":1738076512},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Well, thank you.\",\"startTime\":1738076515,\"endTime\":1738076516},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Well, enjoy your day, Jennifer. What''s that?\",\"startTime\":1738076516,\"endTime\":1738076518},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, you too. Well, thank you for your time. It was nice to chat with somebody. \",\"startTime\":1738076517,\"endTime\":1738076521},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh heck yes. Yeah, no, I love I I''m just absolutely enjoyed hopping on these \",\"startTime\":1738076520,\"endTime\":1738076524},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"and meeting the different people and having some pretty focused conversations. \",\"startTime\":1738076524,\"endTime\":1738076527},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s been good. Even my reflections when I record, I do try to, you know, \",\"startTime\":1738076528,\"endTime\":1738076531},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"like, OK, really think it through. Like there''s a reason. \",\"startTime\":1738076531,\"endTime\":1738076534},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. And.\",\"startTime\":1738076534,\"endTime\":1738076536},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"So yeah, I''ve been trying to embrace all and and learn.\",\"startTime\":1738076535,\"endTime\":1738076538},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Cool. Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1738076539,\"endTime\":1738076540},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Awesome. We''ll go get him today, OK.\",\"startTime\":1738076540,\"endTime\":1738076542},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, you too. I''ll see you in March if we don''t connect again.\",\"startTime\":1738076542,\"endTime\":1738076545},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"We''ll be there. All right. We''ll see you, Jennifer. Bye.\",\"startTime\":1738076546,\"endTime\":1738076548},{\"speaker\":\"11320\",\"text\":\"OK, bye.\",\"startTime\":1738076548,\"endTime\":1738076549}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.343228+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.343228+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1003, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:28.105Z", "session_title": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1416", "name": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "tags": [{"name": "BEL"}, {"name": "LSL"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('17149a60-a86a-4146-ae49-a28e8504ab86', '760ebb56-9a35-4b72-8b73-bc98a5f056a3', '135453', '"[{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Morning. Good. How are you? I just got to school.\",\"startTime\":1733237106,\"endTime\":1733237110},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"How are you?\",\"startTime\":1733237107,\"endTime\":1733237107},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Are you driving?\",\"startTime\":1733237107,\"endTime\":1733237108},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Well, wouldn''t you love to talk about uncovering student post secondary pathways right now? Is that what this. \",\"startTime\":1733237112,\"endTime\":1733237120},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"100%.\",\"startTime\":1733237118,\"endTime\":1733237119},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"OK hello, this is my first time doing this. Oh we have a nice breaker.\",\"startTime\":1733237123,\"endTime\":1733237128},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I guess me as well, I guess. Oh wait, here''s the an icebreaker share of fun. \",\"startTime\":1733237124,\"endTime\":1733237129},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Share a fun fact about all of it during high school that helps shape your career path in high school. \",\"startTime\":1733237129,\"endTime\":1733237139},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I.\",\"startTime\":1733237145,\"endTime\":1733237145},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"I did Spanish all four years of high school and my 4th year we didn''t have a a Spanish 4 so my teacher like set me up with a like an eld classroom at an elementary school and I went and worked there an hour a day and. \",\"startTime\":1733237148,\"endTime\":1733237164},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"That was pretty cool. I think that would probably influenced my decision to \",\"startTime\":1733237165,\"endTime\":1733237168},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"work in the classroom, but I don''t know. \",\"startTime\":1733237168,\"endTime\":1733237171},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"That''s cool.\",\"startTime\":1733237172,\"endTime\":1733237173},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I had, like most teenagers, had no freaking clue on what I wanted to do.\",\"startTime\":1733237175,\"endTime\":1733237181},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"So it would have been just outside of high school my first year or second year of college, I decided to be a girls golf coach or got lucky to be hired on to be a girls golf coach. And just teaching the game of golf really instilled a \",\"startTime\":1733237183,\"endTime\":1733237196},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Oh, fine.\",\"startTime\":1733237192,\"endTime\":1733237192},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"love and a passion for connecting with youth and teaching youth. And my wife \",\"startTime\":1733237196,\"endTime\":1733237200},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"was like, why don''t you like go get your teaching credentials? And I was like, \",\"startTime\":1733237200,\"endTime\":1733237204},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"oh, that''s a great idea. So then I did and that''s all she wrote. And it was, \",\"startTime\":1733237204,\"endTime\":1733237208},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"it was such a great. \",\"startTime\":1733237208,\"endTime\":1733237213},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"There you go. Yeah, I know. It''s funny when you think back on the pathways, \",\"startTime\":1733237212,\"endTime\":1733237219},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Experience for me and who knows, who knows what I would be doing if I didn''t do that. So. \",\"startTime\":1733237213,\"endTime\":1733237217},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"like, yeah, so you are at a tiny school, right? Am I wrong? Mid, mid size school. \",\"startTime\":1733237219,\"endTime\":1733237227},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I would say yeah, we''re, we''re small. You know, we''re, we''re a single \",\"startTime\":1733237229,\"endTime\":1733237234},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"high school district, right. So we have our last P223 for October, we''re at \",\"startTime\":1733237234,\"endTime\":1733237239},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"9099 through 12. So pretty, pretty small in comparison to to many of the like \",\"startTime\":1733237239,\"endTime\":1733237244},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"That''s kind of nice, yeah, Yeah. Do you have do a lot of your students out there \",\"startTime\":1733237244,\"endTime\":1733237249},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"3A or 4A high schools. \",\"startTime\":1733237244,\"endTime\":1733237249},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"access running start programs? \",\"startTime\":1733237249,\"endTime\":1733237253},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"We do. It''s gone down significantly. I would say from about two years ago, we \",\"startTime\":1733237257,\"endTime\":1733237263},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"had upwards of 90 students that would go to running start. Now this year we''re \",\"startTime\":1733237263,\"endTime\":1733237269},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"down to 30. So it''s gone down significantly, partly because we''ve added so many \",\"startTime\":1733237269,\"endTime\":1733237275},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237274,\"endTime\":1733237275},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"colleges in the high school classes, which has been a super, super big lifesaver. \",\"startTime\":1733237275,\"endTime\":1733237282},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Because kids are accessing college level content but also passing the classes which is super big. Or as running start they don''t. \",\"startTime\":1733237283,\"endTime\":1733237290},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"So it''s, it''s been, it''s been a huge headache relief. I''m sure the community \",\"startTime\":1733237291,\"endTime\":1733237294},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"colleges of Spokane doesn''t really appreciate it, but that''s where we''re at. \",\"startTime\":1733237294,\"endTime\":1733237298},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"How about you? \",\"startTime\":1733237298,\"endTime\":1733237302},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Too bad. Yeah, we have. So we in a budget cut shifted from a four period AB \",\"startTime\":1733237302,\"endTime\":1733237307},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"rotation schedule that we''ve been in for like 8 years. \",\"startTime\":1733237307,\"endTime\":1733237312},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"To a just traditional six period day this year and we had a huge we already have a lot of kids accessing Wenatchee Valley College is a pretty robust system and just proximity wise so close. \",\"startTime\":1733237313,\"endTime\":1733237326},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Inaccessible so this year we have almost 400 students in running start out of our 2000 sorry my dog wants in and and next year projected to be closer to almost 500 if the if we continue on that trend. So we actually are right in the works \",\"startTime\":1733237328,\"endTime\":1733237344},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1733237335,\"endTime\":1733237336},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"of creating a high school through central. \",\"startTime\":1733237344,\"endTime\":1733237349},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Come on, let''s go an A A program with college and the high school like we''re almost matriculated to where we can do it within the next year. So we''re really. \",\"startTime\":1733237352,\"endTime\":1733237360},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"Working to pull that back and the state is now saying that you can offer one full credit for a semester class at college and the high school semester class. \",\"startTime\":1733237361,\"endTime\":1733237371},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"So we are actually offering next year an opportunity for kids to come to our campus and take 3 college and the high school courses and then have release for the rest of the day, which only is going to give us only going to give us half half an FTE for them but it''s. \",\"startTime\":1733237371,\"endTime\":1733237390},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, it''s something, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733237387,\"endTime\":1733237391},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"We feel like the offset will be good. And Sam, and just like what you said, \",\"startTime\":1733237392,\"endTime\":1733237396},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"families are kids are gonna be more supportive. I mean most of the community \",\"startTime\":1733237396,\"endTime\":1733237400},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"classes, college classes that we have are online still. So it''s it''s just not \",\"startTime\":1733237400,\"endTime\":1733237404},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"a great way for our kids to be learning at at least at high levels for the 1st 17 year, 1617 year old. I don''t think so. Yeah. So we''re kind of in the process \",\"startTime\":1733237404,\"endTime\":1733237412},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"of figuring out that and that I have nothing to do with that. It''s all our CTE \",\"startTime\":1733237412,\"endTime\":1733237416},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"director, but. \",\"startTime\":1733237416,\"endTime\":1733237420},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"That''s cool. I would say, I would say as you''re as you''re going into it, I know, \",\"startTime\":1733237420,\"endTime\":1733237426},{\"speaker\":\"11472\",\"text\":\"It''s been pretty cool.\",\"startTime\":1733237421,\"endTime\":1733237422},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I know Zilla doesn''t does a really good job, right. They were like kind of the \",\"startTime\":1733237426,\"endTime\":1733237431},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"the sort of first people to do it as far as giving a as we, we partner with Eastern Washington University, Central Washington University and UW. \",\"startTime\":1733237431,\"endTime\":1733237442},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"I would say by far, Eastern Washington University is 10 out of 10.\",\"startTime\":1733237444,\"endTime\":1733237449},{\"speaker\":\"10896\",\"text\":\"As far as course offerings making it accessible for teach