me\":1733842666,\"endTime\":1733842669},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"like that. Oh, that''s fun. \",\"startTime\":1733842669,\"endTime\":1733842672},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep, and then we''ll do March Madness attendance during basketball season.\",\"startTime\":1733842672,\"endTime\":1733842676},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So about what? About once a quarter we run a positive attendance. You know, \",\"startTime\":1733842680,\"endTime\":1733842684},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"high schools, PBIS is a bad word, but PBIS ish, nerdy, cutesy, whatever you want to call it. \",\"startTime\":1733842684,\"endTime\":1733842693},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Because I I do happy texts so I can through our system text parents and I will pull just random lists of good data. And hey, your kid, you know, it has the \",\"startTime\":1733842695,\"endTime\":1733842707},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"GPA above this that''s awesome. Or your kid has this attendance or your on the \",\"startTime\":1733842707,\"endTime\":1733842713},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"list of kids that has straight A''s or just random data point. \",\"startTime\":1733842713,\"endTime\":1733842719},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I do AI do a personal phone call to every straight A kid between now and Christmas break OK. \",\"startTime\":1733842720,\"endTime\":1733842726},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1733842724,\"endTime\":1733842724},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"We do postcards at the Bath meet. Each staff member writes a postcard to a kid. \",\"startTime\":1733842729,\"endTime\":1733842735},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"We''re starting to collect student into our data system so that we can start texting students. \",\"startTime\":1733842735,\"endTime\":1733842745},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733842742,\"endTime\":1733842742},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Now you''re back.\",\"startTime\":1733842752,\"endTime\":1733842752},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Oh, we started calling the phone number students.\",\"startTime\":1733842753,\"endTime\":1733842757},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"All right, we''re ready for our next.\",\"startTime\":1733842762,\"endTime\":1733842765},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Yep, practical ways to involve.\",\"startTime\":1733842767,\"endTime\":1733842772},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Technology and virtual cultural relevant. What do you got for this one?\",\"startTime\":1733842784,\"endTime\":1733842790},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So I think this is one of our holes like when we do our grade distribution pattern, our non dominant culture males are not passing at a disproportionately high rate because we don''t think they see the relevance in high school or post secondary. \",\"startTime\":1733842795,\"endTime\":1733842807},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"So we don''t have. \",\"startTime\":1733842807,\"endTime\":1733842810},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"I''m losing you. Yeah, we''re struggling with this as well. I mean, in terms of \",\"startTime\":1733842816,\"endTime\":1733842821},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"But we really see this as a hole in the unconvincing kids and parents about post secondary opportunities and lifelong impact. Good morning. \",\"startTime\":1733842819,\"endTime\":1733842829},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"we have the regular post secondary nights and curriculum nights and things like that. \",\"startTime\":1733842821,\"endTime\":1733842829},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Morning, Stephanie.\",\"startTime\":1733842833,\"endTime\":1733842834},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Virtual school tours we haven''t done that might be kind of cool. We do we''ve \",\"startTime\":1733842856,\"endTime\":1733842862},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"done parent nights utilizing some of our cultural liaisons we have we have culturally \",\"startTime\":1733842862,\"endTime\":1733842867},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"for some of our larger cultural groups and we go to our community for some of our like our King County Housing Authority development and do different things bring. \",\"startTime\":1733842867,\"endTime\":1733842884},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733842881,\"endTime\":1733842881},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Court cards, we did that last. Last. They delivered report cards. All right. \",\"startTime\":1733842891,\"endTime\":1733842894},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Want to move to the next? \",\"startTime\":1733842894,\"endTime\":1733842898},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Sure.\",\"startTime\":1733842904,\"endTime\":1733842904},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Consider tools. We have a college and career counselor that sits down with any \",\"startTime\":1733842931,\"endTime\":1733842935},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"of our families and will sit down and use translation or translation tools to work with our families one-on-one with everything from financial aid forms. \",\"startTime\":1733842935,\"endTime\":1733842944},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"We do our financial aid forms and our financial aid presentations in multiple languages. \",\"startTime\":1733842944,\"endTime\":1733842952},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Umm and we pair with like central Rendu to support our larger groups. And so \",\"startTime\":1733842961,\"endTime\":1733842966},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"in these particular cases, we would pair with like our culturally and our college and career counselor to support. \",\"startTime\":1733842966,\"endTime\":1733842978},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Our family with filling out the tool one-on-one. Oh.\",\"startTime\":1733842980,\"endTime\":1733842985},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"That I just read, Washington State Ledge is proposing no FAFSA, but you get all the financial aid from it. It broke yesterday because there''s such a low \",\"startTime\":1733842987,\"endTime\":1733842998},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"FAFSA completion rate. Ledge is looking at eliminating that barrier, guaranteeing \",\"startTime\":1733842998,\"endTime\":1733843004},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"that your sophomore year. \",\"startTime\":1733843004,\"endTime\":1733843009},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Oh, interesting.\",\"startTime\":1733843015,\"endTime\":1733843016},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1733843017,\"endTime\":1733843017},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Well, you know what? For two kids this year and I''m college educated and I still \",\"startTime\":1733843018,\"endTime\":1733843021},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"cuss at the stupid thing. \",\"startTime\":1733843021,\"endTime\":1733843024},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Well, so I have.\",\"startTime\":1733843026,\"endTime\":1733843028},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"I don''t wanna over share but we have $60,000 a year in out of pocket college expenses this year and I don''t know how families would do it unless you have really good jobs because that is an entire job going to my kids. \",\"startTime\":1733843030,\"endTime\":1733843046},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I I have to put through college. I get it. Totally understand.\",\"startTime\":1733843050,\"endTime\":1733843055},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Yep, OK.\",\"startTime\":1733843056,\"endTime\":1733843057},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Next.\",\"startTime\":1733843057,\"endTime\":1733843058},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Thank you, partner.\",\"startTime\":1733843063,\"endTime\":1733843065},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Thank you. And I wrote down all sorts of ideas about your naughty and nice list \",\"startTime\":1733843064,\"endTime\":1733843069},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"and 12 days of attendance and March Madness and I like it. Oh, awesome. Which \",\"startTime\":1733843069,\"endTime\":1733843074},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"If you shoot me, if you shoot me an e-mail, I''ll send you our our 12 Days templates on Canva chris.shellin@ksd.org. \",\"startTime\":1733843071,\"endTime\":1733843082},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"school are you at? chrisksd.org. OK, got it. Thank you. \",\"startTime\":1733843074,\"endTime\":1733843080},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Kennewick School District. Yep, Yep.\",\"startTime\":1733843091,\"endTime\":1733843092},{\"speaker\":\"10899\",\"text\":\"Cool beans later.\",\"startTime\":1733843095,\"endTime\":1733843097}]"', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.154961+00', '2025-05-08 03:17:44.154961+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 762, "created_at": "2025-05-08T03:17:44.123Z", "session_title": "Family/Parental Involvement in Post-Secondary Access", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1428", "name": "Family/Parental Involvement in Post-Secondary Access", "tags": [{"name": "HSLC"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('edcb30d7-be9d-4d00-b72d-1845f0741deb', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', '78010', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:40:27.163132+00', '2025-05-06 19:40:27.163132+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 303, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:40:26.947Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('b51482d3-be14-4a0d-8ab2-4a74b9798270', '6ff6d5f4-9cc6-4a8e-9c48-608201bb392d', '137087', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"I was a high school math teacher for 12 years and now I work and facilitate the professional growth of math teachers. \",\"startTime\":1739559895,\"endTime\":1739559901},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"I''m the author of The Imperfect and Unfinished Math Teacher. I''ve done a lot \",\"startTime\":1739559901,\"endTime\":1739559904},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"of lesson study and trying to get teachers to work together and be active partners in each other''s growth. \",\"startTime\":1739559904,\"endTime\":1739559910},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"And I also work for Peter Lilly Doll right now and.\",\"startTime\":1739559910,\"endTime\":1739559914},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"I''m not building thinking classrooms facilitator.\",\"startTime\":1739559915,\"endTime\":1739559917},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Otherwise, I''m a full time nomad. I live on the road since 2020. I live out \",\"startTime\":1739559917,\"endTime\":1739559922},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"of a converted U-Haul box truck. That''s my tiny home on wheels, but it''s also \",\"startTime\":1739559922,\"endTime\":1739559927},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"a passion project of mine. It''s called the Traveling Stoop and it is a traveling \",\"startTime\":1739559927,\"endTime\":1739559932},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"porch and I like to go to gatherings and provide a space of community and storytelling. \",\"startTime\":1739559932,\"endTime\":1739559936},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"And gathering for us to be at our best as humans, which is?\",\"startTime\":1739559937,\"endTime\":1739559941},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Listening to each other''s stories and learning from each other. Anyway, that''s \",\"startTime\":1739559942,\"endTime\":1739559945},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"a little bit about me. Thanks for listening. \",\"startTime\":1739559945,\"endTime\":1739559947},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"My thought on the role of the teacher is 2 things. It''s to understand content, \",\"startTime\":1739559982,\"endTime\":1739559985},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"but it''s also to help foster a child''s relationship with that content knowledge. \",\"startTime\":1739559985,\"endTime\":1739559989},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Like so for example, with mathematics, we want them to learn math, but they need to be able to see themselves as math people and, and, and have a healthy relationship with mathematics, something I call a math story. And so as teachers, \",\"startTime\":1739559989,\"endTime\":1739560000},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"we work in a system that really sometimes only cares about content. And that''s \",\"startTime\":1739560000,\"endTime\":1739560004},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"something that gets in our way and needs to change. And as teachers, we need \",\"startTime\":1739560004,\"endTime\":1739560007},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"to learn to really focus on the human data. \",\"startTime\":1739560007,\"endTime\":1739560010},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"In our classrooms that.\",\"startTime\":1739560010,\"endTime\":1739560012},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Tell us that our students are thriving and that requires us as teachers to as teachers to share authority with with our students. \",\"startTime\":1739560012,\"endTime\":1739560020},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"And elevate their voice and help them seem feel seen and valued for what they do have to offer. And the role of the learners, to be curious is to be engaged, \",\"startTime\":1739560022,\"endTime\":1739560029},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"to learn how to be patient, to learn about what they''re good at and what they need to work on. And learn about their social skills in addition to their academic \",\"startTime\":1739560029,\"endTime\":1739560036},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"skills. \",\"startTime\":1739560036,\"endTime\":1739560039},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"And they need to be as much as they can be, to be present and to be there in the moment and to be open. \",\"startTime\":1739560039,\"endTime\":1739560046},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"To learning.\",\"startTime\":1739560047,\"endTime\":1739560048},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Yeah. So I think that''s, uh, wraps it up.\",\"startTime\":1739560050,\"endTime\":1739560053},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"My work puts me in slow. I love facilitating the learning of of adult learners \",\"startTime\":1739560074,\"endTime\":1739560078},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"and and also students like teaching puts me in the flow. \",\"startTime\":1739560078,\"endTime\":1739560082},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Nothing, nothing makes time fly by than a good math lesson that I''m able to facilitate joy and thinking for for the humans that are in the room and so. \",\"startTime\":1739560082,\"endTime\":1739560093},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Most of my work right now is with adult teachers and SO.\",\"startTime\":1739560093,\"endTime\":1739560096},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"And facilitating their learning. And I love that work. It puts me in the flow. \",\"startTime\":1739560100,\"endTime\":1739560104},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Personally.\",\"startTime\":1739560104,\"endTime\":1739560105},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Put me in the flow. I love to play chess.\",\"startTime\":1739560107,\"endTime\":1739560109},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"I will play chess a lot throughout the day, online and in person and solving puzzles and studying lessons. \",\"startTime\":1739560110,\"endTime\":1739560117},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"And so I think chess is a good example. I love driving. I would drive for countless \",\"startTime\":1739560118,\"endTime\":1739560122},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"hours and be. \",\"startTime\":1739560122,\"endTime\":1739560125},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Pleasantly engage in my own thinking and reflection.\",\"startTime\":1739560126,\"endTime\":1739560129},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Playing music also puts me on the flow.\",\"startTime\":1739560130,\"endTime\":1739560132},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"And playing sports and being outdoors and hiking and also.\",\"startTime\":1739560134,\"endTime\":1739560138},{\"speaker\":\"11873\",\"text\":\"Do a similar thing all right.\",\"startTime\":1739560138,\"endTime\":1739560140}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:27.847313+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:27.847313+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 207, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:27.790Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
