{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"OK, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736261745,\"endTime\":1736261747},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"They said we''re poor and we can''t go to school and we don''t find out about financial aid until our junior, senior year. At that point in time, it''s too late. We''ve \",\"startTime\":1736261750,\"endTime\":1736261760},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"kind of written off college. And so if you gave us that information our freshman \",\"startTime\":1736261760,\"endTime\":1736261764},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"year, we won''t have written it out. It kind of predetermined our path so early \",\"startTime\":1736261764,\"endTime\":1736261769},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"in our high school career, and we think we would apply. \",\"startTime\":1736261769,\"endTime\":1736261774},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"And, and reroute our, our, our goals differently. And so it''s really important \",\"startTime\":1736261779,\"endTime\":1736261784},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah. Aren''t kids awesome?\",\"startTime\":1736261782,\"endTime\":1736261785},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"information that they were sharing with me. I love them. Oh my God, My principal \",\"startTime\":1736261784,\"endTime\":1736261789},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Advisory Council is incredible. Yeah, exactly. \",\"startTime\":1736261789,\"endTime\":1736261794},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh, aren''t they awesome? You know? Yeah. You know, if you gave this information \",\"startTime\":1736261794,\"endTime\":1736261798},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"to me sooner, I might know it was possible and I might do something about it. \",\"startTime\":1736261798,\"endTime\":1736261803},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh, gosh. Oh, all right.\",\"startTime\":1736261807,\"endTime\":1736261810},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Let''s see next one.\",\"startTime\":1736261811,\"endTime\":1736261812},{\"speaker\":\"10902\",\"text\":\"Read the scena