s. It''s 114. \",\"startTime\":1731964490,\"endTime\":1731964494},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Doesn''t apply to us. I think we should skip it, but you can read a second just \",\"startTime\":1731964502,\"endTime\":1731964505},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"to see what I had hoped everyone would get before your last Salkirk adventure. \",\"startTime\":1731964505,\"endTime\":1731964508},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Oh, yeah, yeah, there we go. There we go. And I did. I did listen to anybody \",\"startTime\":1731964506,\"endTime\":1731964511},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Alright. \",\"startTime\":1731964508,\"endTime\":1731964512},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"who had gotten on on Tuesday this week. All right, dude, you got to run. The \",\"startTime\":1731964511,\"endTime\":1731964515},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"other one I will say is my favorite adoption, and that was when I learned Geogebra and on Friday, Thursday, whatever it was when I learned about it, or Friday when I was gone all day teaching or whatever. Yeah, Thursday I learned about \",\"startTime\":1731964515,\"endTime\":1731964528},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"it. Friday I was giving tests and thought it should be grading the next class \",\"startTime\":1731964528,\"endTime\":1731964532},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"period test from last period and just played on Geogebra all day long. \",\"startTime\":1731964532,\"endTime\":1731964536},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Ditched my Lesson plan late Sunday night that I had for Monday morning and gave him some prompts in a note file notebook file of AB CS how to open up Geogebra and do some graphs and tangent curves and drag along and introduce them to the integral symbol. By the end of two days of playing in Geogebra, I had a student \",\"startTime\":1731964540,\"endTime\":1731964557},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"describing to me the fundamental theorem of calculus without having done any more than plain because I gave him some tools and showed him how to do the stuff and visualize what they had learned about. \",\"startTime\":1731964557,\"endTime\":1731964570},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"And introduce this new thing called the integral and did nothing. Then show \",\"startTime\":1731964571,\"endTime\":1731964575},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"that it provides a value and the graphical interface of what it looks like. \",\"startTime\":1731964575,\"endTime\":1731964580},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"What that tells me like, like highlights for me is how you as a teacher would refuse to walk in on Monday and give not the right thing for students so much you rewrite what you had planned on Sunday night. Like we as teachers care so \",\"startTime\":1731964581,\"endTime\":1731964593},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"much about showing up with the right thing for the for the actual kids in front of you at the right time based on our best thinking that we won''t accept anything else. So curriculum creators have it really cut out for them. That''s a hard \",\"startTime\":1731964593,\"endTime\":1731964606},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1731964603,\"endTime\":1731964604},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"job. How could you possibly? \",\"startTime\":1731964606,\"endTime\":1731964610},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"How could you know? But you know what? You know what the best was, is because \",\"startTime\":1731964612,\"endTime\":1731964616},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I had done what I had done personally, and it couldn''t stop playing with jojoba. \",\"startTime\":1731964616,\"endTime\":1731964619},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"I had to embrace the reality as being a human being that that''s what I wanted to do. More than the other stuff, more than grading papers, more than hanging \",\"startTime\":1731964619,\"endTime\":1731964627},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"on the other meetings. I wanted to play with it. And why not give the kids that \",\"startTime\":1731964627,\"endTime\":1731964630},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"same joy? And how could I curate that space for them? That''s what I came down \",\"startTime\":1731964630,\"endTime\":1731964634},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"to. \",\"startTime\":1731964634,\"endTime\":1731964638},{\"speaker\":\"8084\",\"text\":\"All right, you can have.\",\"startTime\":1731964641,\"endTime\":1731964642}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.363908+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.363908+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 775, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:40.305Z", "session_title": "Standards vs. Curriculum", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "250", "name": "Standards vs. Curriculum", "tags": [{"name": "Cothinking Classrooms"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
