:\"11331\",\"text\":\"through for my staff. \",\"startTime\":1732054809,\"endTime\":1732054814},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Yep. What makes you an effective leader?\",\"startTime\":1732054810,\"endTime\":1732054813},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Awesome, should we hit next again?\",\"startTime\":1732054819,\"endTime\":1732054821},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"One piece of it, let''s do it. Let''s see how this works. Describe the next goal \",\"startTime\":1732054820,\"endTime\":1732054825},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"in your leadership journey. So I''m walking the fine line of being a Superintendent \",\"startTime\":1732054825,\"endTime\":1732054829},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"and a principal. And so I just still have a lot to learn on the superintendency \",\"startTime\":1732054829,\"endTime\":1732054833},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"and just learning more policies and procedures and getting all that to work for our district. \",\"startTime\":1732054833,\"endTime\":1732054842},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"It sounds exciting. I, I mean in the very beginning of my leadership journey \",\"startTime\":1732054847,\"endTime\":1732054851},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"as far as being a principal, I just started as assistant principal. It''s my \",\"startTime\":1732054851,\"endTime\":1732054854},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"first year. \",\"startTime\":1732054854,\"endTime\":1732054858},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Nice. Congrats.\",\"startTime\":1732054858,\"endTime\":1732054860},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Thanks. Yeah, I spent the last two years as a Dean, but you know, there''s a \",\"startTime\":1732054861,\"endTime\":1732054864},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"few different jobs as an assistant principal I kind of took on. \",\"startTime\":1732054864,\"endTime\":1732054868},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"What district are you with? N Thurston. OK, I think I have. Do you know a lady \",\"startTime\":1732054872,\"endTime\":1732054876},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"North Thurston, Yeah, absolutely.\",\"startTime\":1732054874,\"endTime\":1732054878},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"by the name of Haley Ortega? \",\"startTime\":1732054876,\"endTime\":1732054880},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"OK, she is one of my well, one of my professional friends. I got to know her \",\"startTime\":1732054884,\"endTime\":1732054888},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732054884,\"endTime\":1732054885},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"over the last couple years. She is fantastic. \",\"startTime\":1732054888,\"endTime\":1732054891},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"She is top notch. She was our athletics and activities. I don''t know if she \",\"startTime\":1732054893,\"endTime\":1732054897},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732054896,\"endTime\":1732054900},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"was assistant soup or if she''s a director. And then she''s moved into HR this \",\"startTime\":1732054897,\"endTime\":1732054902},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"year and I, I get the feeling that she''s training to be a Superintendent or maybe she even right now is working on her, her credentials. \",\"startTime\":1732054902,\"endTime\":1732054912},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"That sounds about right. I''ve got a lot of respect for her. It''s just she''s, \",\"startTime\":1732054914,\"endTime\":1732054917},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"she''s fantastic. Yeah. If you see her, you''ll have to tell her I said hi because \",\"startTime\":1732054917,\"endTime\":1732054919},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"she''s a good contact. \",\"startTime\":1732054919,\"endTime\":1732054922},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"I will, I will. And what district are you in?\",\"startTime\":1732054923,\"endTime\":1732054925},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"I''m at a really small one and it''s called Boysford School District. It''s outside \",\"startTime\":1732054926,\"endTime\":1732054929},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"of Chehalis. I''m not sure if you''re familiar with it or not. \",\"startTime\":1732054929,\"endTime\":1732054932},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I''ve heard of it. Yeah. You''re just down South of us. Yep, kind of South \",\"startTime\":1732054933,\"endTime\":1732054937},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Kinda in between, like PL. Yeah. Yep. Yep. So super tiny. Mm-hmm. Yep. Absolute \",\"startTime\":1732054936,\"endTime\":1732054942},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"and farther to the West. \",\"startTime\":1732054937,\"endTime\":1732054940},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Hwy. 6 So really, really. Let''s do it. Let''s do it Oh, you''re good. Let''s. Let''s \",\"startTime\":1732054942,\"endTime\":1732054948},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Yeah. You ready? Ready for the next question? Oops, sorry.\",\"startTime\":1732054947,\"endTime\":1732054951},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"move on to the next one. I wandered out into the hall so. \",\"startTime\":1732054948,\"endTime\":1732054954},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"I''m still in the main room, so it''s a little bit noisy in here.\",\"startTime\":1732054955,\"endTime\":1732054957},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s probably a good idea. I might try that other There''s like a room \",\"startTime\":1732054961,\"endTime\":1732054964},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"with chairs and I might try that one. OK, you ready for this question? What''s \",\"startTime\":1732054964,\"endTime\":1732054966},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"the strength of your school''s culture? \",\"startTime\":1732054966,\"endTime\":1732054969},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"All right, cool.\",\"startTime\":1732054967,\"endTime\":1732054967},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"I would say.\",\"startTime\":1732054974,\"endTime\":1732054976},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Oh, see you man. Good. Good to meet you. Thanks. Keep in touch. Sounds good. \",\"startTime\":1732054977,\"endTime\":1732054982},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Text you and stuff. Alright, see ya. Umm, I would say probably right now \",\"startTime\":1732054982,\"endTime\":1732054986},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"staff are very, very willing and hungry for change and instructional leadership. \",\"startTime\":1732054986,\"endTime\":1732054991},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"So they, they''re really taking the reins this year and really, really proud of them. How about you? \",\"startTime\":1732054991,\"endTime\":1732055000},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"I moved from a building with a lot of change, leadership change over the last few years, and now I''m in a building where the principal''s been there for like 15 years and he was a teacher in the building before that. So there''s a lot \",\"startTime\":1732055002,\"endTime\":1732055015},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"of consistency and a real love for our principal so that that''s really good. \",\"startTime\":1732055015,\"endTime\":1732055020},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Excellent.\",\"startTime\":1732055019,\"endTime\":1732055020},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Nice.\",\"startTime\":1732055024,\"endTime\":1732055024},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"And there are a lot of folks in our community that bleed green and gold, which is the Timberline colors. So the school''s really connected to the community \",\"startTime\":1732055026,\"endTime\":1732055032},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"and that shows in the building. \",\"startTime\":1732055032,\"endTime\":1732055036},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"That makes a huge difference.\",\"startTime\":1732055038,\"endTime\":1732055039},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Excellent. Next question.\",\"startTime\":1732055042,\"endTime\":1732055043},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, it''s cool to really feel it. Yeah, let''s try it.\",\"startTime\":1732055042,\"endTime\":1732055047},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"What''s in the area of work for you in regard to your school''s culture?\",\"startTime\":1732055049,\"endTime\":1732055053},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"I would say some of this just goes along with with what I just said. Even though \",\"startTime\":1732055055,\"endTime\":1732055060},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"my staff is hungry and everything, they they still need to continue to be. I \",\"startTime\":1732055060,\"endTime\":1732055065},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"say it''s in the most positive way, but just still be critical of their instructional practices and strive to meet all the needs of of all of our kids. \",\"startTime\":1732055065,\"endTime\":1732055075},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"And not not make excuses. And we''re starting to do some John Hattie work around \",\"startTime\":1732055077,\"endTime\":1732055081},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"visible learning. We''re doing a book study there. And that has opened up some \",\"startTime\":1732055081,\"endTime\":1732055085},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"great conversations for our teachers to just self reflect as a group. And so \",\"startTime\":1732055085,\"endTime\":1732055088},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"MMM.\",\"startTime\":1732055087,\"endTime\":1732055087},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"actually collaborating has been a huge focus this year. And so I''m seeing their \",\"startTime\":1732055088,\"endTime\":1732055092},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"walls come down. \",\"startTime\":1732055092,\"endTime\":1732055096},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Cool. A couple of things come to mind. One of one of them is feel like there''s \",\"startTime\":1732055096,\"endTime\":1732055100},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"The most positive way and we really are just together on this journey. So that''s \",\"startTime\":1732055097,\"endTime\":1732055101},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"a kind of a culture of that, I don''t want to say haves and have nots, but there are a lot of our teachers that are really connected to school and then a number of teachers in the building that kind of feel like they''re on the outs or on the B team or something. I''m still learning about it to try to give it a name, \",\"startTime\":1732055100,\"endTime\":1732055115},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"where we''re at. How about you guys? \",\"startTime\":1732055101,\"endTime\":1732055106},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"but trying to find a way to be inclusive to those teachers that don''t feel like they''re included. \",\"startTime\":1732055115,\"endTime\":1732055122},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"And and then I think we have some work to do around PLC.\",\"startTime\":1732055134,\"endTime\":1732055138},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Efficacy, just growing our PCs, moving through some of the stages of development to where they''re really collaborating rather than just planning together or delivering information to each other. Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1732055140,\"endTime\":1732055155},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732055143,\"endTime\":1732055143},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"That''s hard work. That''s really hard work.\",\"startTime\":1732055155,\"endTime\":1732055157},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Next question.\",\"startTime\":1732055163,\"endTime\":1732055165},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Hey, thanks, David. It''s really good to chat with you in such a small world \",\"startTime\":1732055167,\"endTime\":1732055168},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"of education, right? \",\"startTime\":1732055168,\"endTime\":1732055170},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Right, Yeah, it''s great to great to meet you virtually and down the hall.\",\"startTime\":1732055172,\"endTime\":1732055177},{\"speaker\":\"11331\",\"text\":\"Awesome. All right. Thanks, man.\",\"startTime\":1732055179,\"endTime\":1732055180},{\"speaker\":\"11322\",\"text\":\"Later.\",\"startTime\":1732055181,\"endTime\":1732055182}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.14756+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.14756+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 436, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:40.084Z", "session_title": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1416", "name": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "tags": [{"name": "BEL"}, {"name": "LSL"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('9c9fd589-cdc7-42cc-9798-7a4ffcb7ec49', '86f608d8-be4a-47b2-9c8a-b0b3fb52dabb', '134592', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Hi, my name is Michael Catman. I am the assistant principal at Wallen Junior \",\"startTime\":1732054346,\"endTime\":1732054351},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"High School in Mattawa, WA. This is my eighth year of being administrator. \",\"startTime\":1732054351,\"endTime\":1732054356},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"And I managed kids and it''s.\",\"startTime\":1732054360,\"endTime\":1732054364},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"Hi, my name is Michael Kampman. I am Assistant principal Wallet Junior High \",\"startTime\":1732054381,\"endTime\":1732054385},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"School in Malta, Washington. It''s a six through 8 school. \",\"startTime\":1732054385,\"endTime\":1732054390},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"I spend most of my day doing little kids and adults and families and all the the fun stuff. Prior to that I was in special education, taught a little bit \",\"startTime\":1732054390,\"endTime\":1732054401},{\"speaker\":\"11328\",\"text\":\"of ELA, some elementary, so it''s been diverse. \",\"startTime\":1732054401,\"endTime\":1732054407}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.34432+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.34432+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 34, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:40.284Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
