	('120e0d78-607f-412c-877a-fcb1c241e780', 'a6fe7091-c114-4491-afa2-274e51afbe8c', '137086', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Hey, I''m Skyler and I will be teaching Lovable at the end of this.\",\"startTime\":1739491712,\"endTime\":1739491717},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Hey and Sky.\",\"startTime\":1739491746,\"endTime\":1739491747},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"And when this is all?\",\"startTime\":1739491747,\"endTime\":1739491749},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Said and done. I''m sure I''ll be ready, willing and able to teach Lovable.\",\"startTime\":1739491749,\"endTime\":1739491753},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Hey, I''m Skylar and pretty soon.\",\"startTime\":1739491786,\"endTime\":1739491788},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Be able to teach lovable.\",\"startTime\":1739491788,\"endTime\":1739491790},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"My stance on teaching and learning well.\",\"startTime\":1739491833,\"endTime\":1739491836},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Teaching is not only one of the most selfless, enriching things you can do for others, but. \",\"startTime\":1739491837,\"endTime\":1739491843},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"In addition, it''s a great way to learn something and.\",\"startTime\":1739491846,\"endTime\":1739491849},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"I should say, learn all about something and continue to learn.\",\"startTime\":1739491852,\"endTime\":1739491856},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"The subject yourself.\",\"startTime\":1739491857,\"endTime\":1739491859},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"By teaching.\",\"startTime\":1739491861,\"endTime\":1739491862},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Primary flow activity is definitely skiing, downhill skiing, and Backcountry skiing. \",\"startTime\":1739491886,\"endTime\":1739491893},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"When it''s not snowy I would say.\",\"startTime\":1739491895,\"endTime\":1739491897},{\"speaker\":\"11875\",\"text\":\"Mushroom hunting.\",\"startTime\":1739491899,\"endTime\":1739491900}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:27.856421+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:27.856421+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 67, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:27.807Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('efbbcb23-be77-447b-ae18-5fad1fbac3e4', '4f2c17d9-95b8-4de7-8b97-ea6e0874f465', '134650', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Hi.\",\"startTime\":1732054825,\"endTime\":1732054825},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Hello.\",\"startTime\":1732054827,\"endTime\":1732054828},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"How are you doing? Great, this is weird.\",\"startTime\":1732054829,\"endTime\":1732054832},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Good. How are you?\",\"startTime\":1732054830,\"endTime\":1732054830},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Extremely. Oh, we''re right next to each other.\",\"startTime\":1732054834,\"endTime\":1732054836},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Charlie, where are you calling somebody? Oh, perfect. Yeah. He''s moving away \",\"startTime\":1732054838,\"endTime\":1732054841},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"from me. Moving away? All right? He''s running away from me. I don''t know if \",\"startTime\":1732054841,\"endTime\":1732054844},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"that''s awesome or not. Oh, there he is. \",\"startTime\":1732054844,\"endTime\":1732054847},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"I''m right here. We''ll get feedback. So yeah, second on there. Click partner, \",\"startTime\":1732054849,\"endTime\":1732054853},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"ready. Yeah, there we go. You answer that question with them. Don''t hit next \",\"startTime\":1732054853,\"endTime\":1732054856},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"What''s a fun fact about you?\",\"startTime\":1732054853,\"endTime\":1732054854},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"until you don''t answer them. OK, AJ? \",\"startTime\":1732054856,\"endTime\":1732054860},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"We did the we did the one that you and I did the one back in September.\",\"startTime\":1732054867,\"endTime\":1732054872},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Or August, is that you? Yeah, yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732054873,\"endTime\":1732054875},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"The question Are you asking me the question? I think.\",\"startTime\":1732054878,\"endTime\":1732054881},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"What makes you an effective leader? I don''t know.\",\"startTime\":1732054883,\"endTime\":1732054885},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Like me personally, I''ll just say clear communicate, clear communication and being intentional. \",\"startTime\":1732054888,\"endTime\":1732054894},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1732054896,\"endTime\":1732054897},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"I think I hit.\",\"startTime\":1732054899,\"endTime\":1732054901},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"And then do I answer it? Is that how that''s supposed to go? Mine says what makes \",\"startTime\":1732054901,\"endTime\":1732054904},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"What is your say?\",\"startTime\":1732054903,\"endTime\":1732054905},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"an effective leader. \",\"startTime\":1732054904,\"endTime\":1732054907},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"OK so mine says share so I shared and I think we click next.\",\"startTime\":1732054908,\"endTime\":1732054911},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1732054912,\"endTime\":1732054912},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Says take turns. Describe the next goal in your leadership journey. Go for it. \",\"startTime\":1732054917,\"endTime\":1732054922},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Yep.\",\"startTime\":1732054923,\"endTime\":1732054923},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"So.\",\"startTime\":1732054924,\"endTime\":1732054925},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Building systems, that''s my goal.\",\"startTime\":1732054927,\"endTime\":1732054929},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1732054931,\"endTime\":1732054931},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"I think just continue to build relationships and.\",\"startTime\":1732054935,\"endTime\":1732054938},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"So I''m at a new school this year as the principal, so just continuing to build relationships and. \",\"startTime\":1732054939,\"endTime\":1732054944},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"I can meet myself to the school and we''re already moving on a few different things, so just continuing the the work we started. \",\"startTime\":1732054947,\"endTime\":1732054954},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732054953,\"endTime\":1732054954},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"What does your say?\",\"startTime\":1732054961,\"endTime\":1732054963},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Mine says, What is a strength in your school''s culture?\",\"startTime\":1732054963,\"endTime\":1732054967},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"OK, so I think I''m sharing then umm, umm, a lot of the, the staff is relatively veteran and they''ve been there for a while. Umm and there''s like a true like \",\"startTime\":1732054967,\"endTime\":1732054980},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"pride and in teaching it Sacagawea. And along with that, they''re we''re very \",\"startTime\":1732054980,\"endTime\":1732054986},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"connected to our community and have a strong PTA and. \",\"startTime\":1732054986,\"endTime\":1732054992},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"So just kind of the togetherness.\",\"startTime\":1732054995,\"endTime\":1732054997},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"I guess we''ll describe our culture.\",\"startTime\":1732054997,\"endTime\":1732055000},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"And then do we hit next? Oh, mine says partner ready.\",\"startTime\":1732055004,\"endTime\":1732055010},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"I think so.\",\"startTime\":1732055005,\"endTime\":1732055006},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"So you click that.\",\"startTime\":1732055010,\"endTime\":1732055011},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"And then it says what is an area of work for you in regards to your school culture? \",\"startTime\":1732055015,\"endTime\":1732055020},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"So we need to work on just working together towards common goals because we have a lot of stuff that are like tattletales. \",\"startTime\":1732055020,\"endTime\":1732055030},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1732055032,\"endTime\":1732055032},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Claro, toca.\",\"startTime\":1732055033,\"endTime\":1732055034},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s, it''s an interesting dynamic for sure.\",\"startTime\":1732055034,\"endTime\":1732055037},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Gotcha.\",\"startTime\":1732055038,\"endTime\":1732055038},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Ours I guess would be around what we''re working on is just barely like PLC capacity and data-driven conversations to help kind of close the gap. \",\"startTime\":1732055044,\"endTime\":1732055057},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"And just elevating.\",\"startTime\":1732055062,\"endTime\":1732055065},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Yeah. And I would say we also need to work on like teacher collective efficacy \",\"startTime\":1732055063,\"endTime\":1732055066},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"and like believing in kids as a whole. \",\"startTime\":1732055066,\"endTime\":1732055070},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Teachers capacity to do interventions and to support every one of our students. \",\"startTime\":1732055067,\"endTime\":1732055072},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Ours isn''t necessarily like I think our efficacy for the most part is pretty high, but it''s more like for a while they haven''t had to have data conversations and they haven''t like there hasn''t been a a expectation. So just kind of resetting \",\"startTime\":1732055082,\"endTime\":1732055095},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"that. Yep. \",\"startTime\":1732055095,\"endTime\":1732055099},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Jihad, thank you and share one thing that you learned from them. So thank you. \",\"startTime\":1732055101,\"endTime\":1732055106},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"And one thing that I learned is that you''re building learning strategies with your building and with your teachers. \",\"startTime\":1732055106,\"endTime\":1732055115},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Great.\",\"startTime\":1732055106,\"endTime\":1732055106},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"All right.\",\"startTime\":1732055110,\"endTime\":1732055110},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1732055113,\"endTime\":1732055113},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"And thank you. One thing I learned, yeah, one thing I learned is some work to \",\"startTime\":1732055124,\"endTime\":1732055128},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"be done and and teacher efficacy. \",\"startTime\":1732055128,\"endTime\":1732055132},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1732055134,\"endTime\":1732055135},{\"speaker\":\"11335\",\"text\":\"All right, see you.\",\"startTime\":1732055136,\"endTime\":1732055137},{\"speaker\":\"11351\",\"text\":\"All right.\",\"startTime\":1732055137,\"endTime\":1732055137}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.383606+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:40.383606+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 319, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:40.320Z", "session_title": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1416", "name": "School Leadership: Describing the Work(BEL LSL)", "tags": [{"name": "BEL"}, {"name": "LSL"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('4b47be0e-12ea-4926-8803-da70d70dfcbf', '369c68b2-4de2-4ba9-884c-a26d3e5a426d', '136585', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Hi everyone, my name is Dale Berry. I am a special education teacher in Madison, \",\"startTime\":1737999115,\"endTime\":1737999119},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"WI. \",\"startTime\":1737999119,\"endTime\":1737999122},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I work at a public independent charter school in Madison.\",\"startTime\":1737999122,\"endTime\":1737999127},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Umm, and I really enjoy my work. I love working with kids who, uh, who need \",\"startTime\":1737999129,\"endTime\":1737999132},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"extra support. \",\"startTime\":1737999132,\"endTime\":1737999135},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And I enjoy my work.\",\"startTime\":1737999135,\"endTime\":1737999137},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Before that I helped started an El.\",\"startTime\":1737999138,\"endTime\":1737999141},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Education school out in Nevada City in California.\",\"startTime\":1737999142,\"endTime\":1737999145},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"For about 9 years.\",\"startTime\":1737999146,\"endTime\":1737999147},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I was a founding teacher out there. I created their Adventure Field work program. \",\"startTime\":1737999148,\"endTime\":1737999152},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Umm, which I''m really, really proud of. And uh, we created a magical school \",\"startTime\":1737999154,\"endTime\":1737999157},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"out there that is still. \",\"startTime\":1737999157,\"endTime\":1737999160},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Doing wonderfully today.\",\"startTime\":1737999161,\"endTime\":1737999163},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And so yeah, for about the last 1213 years I''ve been in education and I love my work. \",\"startTime\":1737999166,\"endTime\":1737999172},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I''m here to learn more about.\",\"startTime\":1737999172,\"endTime\":1737999173},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And to share some of the things that I''ve learned to help in my role as a special Ed teacher. \",\"startTime\":1737999175,\"endTime\":1737999180},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I am an adult learner. I think I I learn every day and I try to learn every \",\"startTime\":1737999216,\"endTime\":1737999221},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"day. I''m certainly in the world of AI. I''m certainly learning every day. \",\"startTime\":1737999221,\"endTime\":1737999226},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"But I feel like.\",\"startTime\":1737999226,\"endTime\":1737999228},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"If I''m going to spend time with kids and trying to educate kids, then I need to continue to learn. \",\"startTime\":1737999229,\"endTime\":1737999236},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And grow and refine my practice.\",\"startTime\":1737999237,\"endTime\":1737999240},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Umm, and my skills so I can, uh, best support my kids, Umm.\",\"startTime\":1737999241,\"endTime\":1737999245},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And I think when I''m learning.\",\"startTime\":1737999245,\"endTime\":1737999247},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Umm, and feel empowered through my learning. I feel like I''m at my happiest. \",\"startTime\":1737999248,\"endTime\":1737999252},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"And I think when you''re happiest, you''re obviously doing a better job with kids and, and they feel that. So umm. \",\"startTime\":1737999252,\"endTime\":1737999259},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"I would say that continuing to learn is something that I care about and.\",\"startTime\":1737999259,\"endTime\":1737999265},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Strive for.\",\"startTime\":1737999267,\"endTime\":1737999268},{\"speaker\":\"11773\",\"text\":\"Come on.\",\"startTime\":1737999277,\"endTime\":1737999278}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.273738+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.273738+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 134, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:28.058Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('7eb17171-6619-40ae-832b-ba4afa5b52ed', '31f25266-25f6-40c6-b809-30b6e6bc2301', '136123', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Hey, how are you, Nick?\",\"startTime\":1736467438,\"endTime\":1736467440},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Hey, Annie. Good. I''m Nick Hayes. I work at Happy Valley in Bellingham. Oh, \",\"startTime\":1736467439,\"endTime\":1736467443},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"nice. \",\"startTime\":1736467443,\"endTime\":1736467446},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Oh, I love Bellingham. I went to Western, so I did. Yeah. I''m Annie Parker. \",\"startTime\":1736467444,\"endTime\":1736467449},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"I am a principal over in Renton. I just, I have to pause myself because I''ve \",\"startTime\":1736467449,\"endTime\":1736467453},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Oh, you did fantastic, Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467449,\"endTime\":1736467451},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"been two years in Renton. Before that I was in Seattle for a good long time. \",\"startTime\":1736467453,\"endTime\":1736467457},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"So yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467457,\"endTime\":1736467461},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Oh, nice. That''s awesome. Which school are you at in Renton? OK, not that I \",\"startTime\":1736467462,\"endTime\":1736467466},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"know a ton about Renton, but, you know, I am elementary also. Yeah. Happy Valley \",\"startTime\":1736467466,\"endTime\":1736467471},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Bryn Mawr Elementary, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467466,\"endTime\":1736467469},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Elementary. Yeah, yeah, yeah. So two years of Bryn Mawr, you said. Awesome. \",\"startTime\":1736467471,\"endTime\":1736467475},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"What level are you at?\",\"startTime\":1736467472,\"endTime\":1736467473},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"That. \",\"startTime\":1736467475,\"endTime\":1736467480},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"You are? Oh, it''s elementary school. OK, got it. Awesome.\",\"startTime\":1736467476,\"endTime\":1736467480},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yes, this is my second year.\",\"startTime\":1736467484,\"endTime\":1736467485},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"And a lot right now, yeah. What about you? How long have you been at Happy Valley? \",\"startTime\":1736467488,\"endTime\":1736467495},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467491,\"endTime\":1736467491},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"This is my 8th year at Happy Valley.\",\"startTime\":1736467495,\"endTime\":1736467498},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Wow, that''s amazing.\",\"startTime\":1736467499,\"endTime\":1736467501},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, Yeah. Then I was. You can do it, Annie. It takes a lot. It takes a lot. \",\"startTime\":1736467501,\"endTime\":1736467507},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"I hope I can survive that long.\",\"startTime\":1736467503,\"endTime\":1736467505},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"You know, often what I do is I''ll just go on like jobs.com and look at all the \",\"startTime\":1736467507,\"endTime\":1736467512},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Oh, no, man. Yeah, yeah, yeah. It''s true. It''s true.\",\"startTime\":1736467509,\"endTime\":1736467516},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"other jobs and be like, yeah, actually I don''t want to do those either. \",\"startTime\":1736467512,\"endTime\":1736467518},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"That convinces me. I''m like, it''s really hard but I am in the right place. Nothing \",\"startTime\":1736467525,\"endTime\":1736467529},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"else would be that interesting or fulfilling for me so. \",\"startTime\":1736467529,\"endTime\":1736467532},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Well, good for you. Maybe it''s after the maybe three or five year mark \",\"startTime\":1736467531,\"endTime\":1736467535},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"where you start to feel settled. Is that about it? OK. \",\"startTime\":1736467535,\"endTime\":1736467539},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. You know, not to pontificate too much on my own career, but I think \",\"startTime\":1736467539,\"endTime\":1736467543},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"it you just become unsettled in different ways. Like there''s things that I feel \",\"startTime\":1736467543,\"endTime\":1736467548},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"really confident in now that when I think about when I started out, I was like, you''re just, I felt like just frankly terrified most of the time because of the gravity of the situations that you''re dealing with and like the things that you''re trying to support people through that you''ve never done before. \",\"startTime\":1736467548,\"endTime\":1736467567},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467560,\"endTime\":1736467561},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467564,\"endTime\":1736467564},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"You know, now, like my unsettled is how have I not like changed that teacher''s practice to be any better at all right now? Or how am I still like dealing with \",\"startTime\":1736467570,\"endTime\":1736467579},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"this, you know, employee issue or like, how have I gotten so sideways with this family and I can''t work my way out of it? And so, you know, I don''t worry so \",\"startTime\":1736467579,\"endTime\":1736467588},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467588,\"endTime\":1736467589},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"much about like process and procedure and like, am I going to mess somebody up? But more like just, well, I''ve made this bed. \",\"startTime\":1736467588,\"endTime\":1736467597},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"The only one I can blame for it.\",\"startTime\":1736467599,\"endTime\":1736467601},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, so true. I guess I''m I''m right there with you with a lot of those aspects \",\"startTime\":1736467600,\"endTime\":1736467604},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"of of the work. So that makes me feel better actually hearing you say that. \",\"startTime\":1736467604,\"endTime\":1736467607},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"So thank you for sharing that. \",\"startTime\":1736467607,\"endTime\":1736467611},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Good. Yeah, Yeah. What are we talking about today?\",\"startTime\":1736467612,\"endTime\":1736467615},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"I don''t know, it just dinged at me.\",\"startTime\":1736467615,\"endTime\":1736467617},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah. Oh, nice.\",\"startTime\":1736467618,\"endTime\":1736467620},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Share recent positive experience with a colleague or community member that made you feel appreciated. \",\"startTime\":1736467620,\"endTime\":1736467625},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Oh, is that a question for me or do you say that?\",\"startTime\":1736467628,\"endTime\":1736467630},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Oh, I don''t know. Actually, it doesn''t say.\",\"startTime\":1736467632,\"endTime\":1736467635},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1736467636,\"endTime\":1736467637},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"It says partner ready. I don''t, I don''t know what that means. Oh, OK, OK, click \",\"startTime\":1736467642,\"endTime\":1736467647},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Well, no, I see. That was that was the icebreaker. We were supposed to do that. \",\"startTime\":1736467642,\"endTime\":1736467646},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Oh, yeah. So we''re both supposed to do that. Alright, go ahead and then save \",\"startTime\":1736467646,\"endTime\":1736467650},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"partner ready or say the thing. Say the thing. You know, I recently had a sweet \",\"startTime\":1736467647,\"endTime\":1736467653},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"the thing. Yeah. Yep. \",\"startTime\":1736467650,\"endTime\":1736467654},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"e-mail from our director of special education services and she said something to the effect of happy New Year. \",\"startTime\":1736467653,\"endTime\":1736467664},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"You know, I can''t believe we''re back in this way because we were dealing with an issue back and forth. We were emailing just like the first day back from \",\"startTime\":1736467673,\"endTime\":1736467679},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"break. And she was like, thank you for doing what you do. You do it so well. \",\"startTime\":1736467679,\"endTime\":1736467683},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"And I was like, wow, thank you. Like I just really needed to hear that you can \",\"startTime\":1736467683,\"endTime\":1736467686},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"do a good job. And it''s other people see that even though I feel like a failure \",\"startTime\":1736467686,\"endTime\":1736467689},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467686,\"endTime\":1736467687},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"as you know sometimes. So that was really nice. \",\"startTime\":1736467689,\"endTime\":1736467693},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, awesome.\",\"startTime\":1736467694,\"endTime\":1736467695},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"What about you?\",\"startTime\":1736467695,\"endTime\":1736467696},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think for me, umm, right before break. So we this year started a, a \",\"startTime\":1736467696,\"endTime\":1736467700},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"elementary black student union at our school, uh, which is kind of a, a process, umm, to get through. And then they, that umm group wanted to host a dinner at \",\"startTime\":1736467700,\"endTime\":1736467710},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Nice.\",\"startTime\":1736467704,\"endTime\":1736467704},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"our school and that was a whole another process to get through. \",\"startTime\":1736467710,\"endTime\":1736467715},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"But during that dinner, you know, just the conversations that I had with people and the appreciation from our Black community around creating that space for our kids. \",\"startTime\":1736467717,\"endTime\":1736467727},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"And for our community to come into a school and feel, you know, elevated and represented in a really important way was it was pretty amazing. And I mean, \",\"startTime\":1736467728,\"endTime\":1736467736},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467729,\"endTime\":1736467732},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"I, you know, it was like I was just sort of, you know, trying to remove the gatekeepers from out of the way. But, you know, it feels good to to have a group \",\"startTime\":1736467736,\"endTime\":1736467744},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Right, right. That is amazing. How many what''s your demographic of students \",\"startTime\":1736467744,\"endTime\":1736467748},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"like that in your school and to. Yeah. So that was really fun. \",\"startTime\":1736467744,\"endTime\":1736467748},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"in in? Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467748,\"endTime\":1736467753},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"We''re very white. We''re we''re very white school. We have probably 30% of our \",\"startTime\":1736467754,\"endTime\":1736467762},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"students are Hispanic or Latino. And then we do have probably like 30, not 30, \",\"startTime\":1736467762,\"endTime\":1736467769},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1736467765,\"endTime\":1736467765},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"like 20 children who are all from Afghanistan and they''re all sort of from a big extended family. And then we have just a handful of Native American or indigenous. \",\"startTime\":1736467769,\"endTime\":1736467784},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"How about you? Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467778,\"endTime\":1736467780},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1736467787,\"endTime\":1736467787},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Families. And then we have. I just made this list. So 32 children who identify \",\"startTime\":1736467787,\"endTime\":1736467793},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"as black. Yeah. How about yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467793,\"endTime\":1736467798},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"OK. I was, I was asking how many that''s, that''s great to hear that even in small \",\"startTime\":1736467795,\"endTime\":1736467799},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"pockets they''re getting opportunities to really come together as a community and be seen and know each other. So I think that''s great. \",\"startTime\":1736467799,\"endTime\":1736467807},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah. And I think that was, you know, part of what was powerful is, you \",\"startTime\":1736467807,\"endTime\":1736467812},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"know, Bellingham in general is a very white community. And, you know, the history \",\"startTime\":1736467812,\"endTime\":1736467816},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"of Bellingham is sort of created that very carefully. And so for our, you know, \",\"startTime\":1736467816,\"endTime\":1736467821},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"residents here who are black, they often feel like, well, people just don''t even see us. Like we''re just an invisible part. \",\"startTime\":1736467821,\"endTime\":1736467830},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Of this community because there aren''t necessarily any, you know, big pockets anywhere to be found. So yeah, it was good, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467832,\"endTime\":1736467841},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, totally.\",\"startTime\":1736467837,\"endTime\":1736467839},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Good. That''s awesome car. Are we moving to the next? Should we just hit the \",\"startTime\":1736467841,\"endTime\":1736467845},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"button? OK, I''m going to hit the partner ready button. \",\"startTime\":1736467845,\"endTime\":1736467849},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"I''m supposed to ask you, what are some ways you wow? What are some ways you''ve \",\"startTime\":1736467850,\"endTime\":1736467855},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"seen trust erode in a school setting? \",\"startTime\":1736467855,\"endTime\":1736467859},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Then ask Nick to add to my answer. OK?\",\"startTime\":1736467861,\"endTime\":1736467864},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Some ways you''ve seen trust erode in a school setting. I mean, there''s so many \",\"startTime\":1736467866,\"endTime\":1736467870},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"different levels of that. Are we talking about admins with teachers, teachers \",\"startTime\":1736467870,\"endTime\":1736467875},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"with teachers, colleagues among, you know, different levels, I would say. \",\"startTime\":1736467875,\"endTime\":1736467880},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467877,\"endTime\":1736467878},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"The biggest thing I have seen is that people.\",\"startTime\":1736467884,\"endTime\":1736467887},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"The culture isn''t there and people aren''t ready to talk to each other or confront \",\"startTime\":1736467889,\"endTime\":1736467894},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"issues head on and so the, you know, talking behind backs, spreading rumors and gossip, I feel like that is a huge erosion to the school setting and just the general culture of a building. I''ve also seen ways where admin, other teachers, \",\"startTime\":1736467894,\"endTime\":1736467909},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"maybe teacher leaders, things to that effect even. \",\"startTime\":1736467909,\"endTime\":1736467914},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Central office leaders a road trust by saying one thing and doing another.\",\"startTime\":1736467915,\"endTime\":1736467919},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"That''s a huge problem, I think, where things sound really good and then you hope to see it in practice and it is a real let down. So yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736467920,\"endTime\":1736467930},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467928,\"endTime\":1736467930},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Absolutely, yeah, Yeah, I mean, I would add to that that I think, you know, thinking about that, that that back channeling and all the talking behind people''s backs often comes from unclear or a lack of communication. \",\"startTime\":1736467931,\"endTime\":1736467946},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467942,\"endTime\":1736467942},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Where it leaves, it leaves space to create stories. And so I think from a, a \",\"startTime\":1736467948,\"endTime\":1736467952},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yes.\",\"startTime\":1736467951,\"endTime\":1736467951},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"leadership perspective, like as much like when I feel, you know, trust as low as when I can then say, oh, well, here''s some issues that I haven''t communicated really clearly on. And so I need to get some really clear. \",\"startTime\":1736467952,\"endTime\":1736467964},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Communication out now. And just like you said from central office, it can feel \",\"startTime\":1736467966,\"endTime\":1736467970},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"the same way for us administrators. Like something comes out to our group and \",\"startTime\":1736467970,\"endTime\":1736467974},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"we''re like, what is happening on this issue? And then we all just start, you \",\"startTime\":1736467974,\"endTime\":1736467979},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Right, right.\",\"startTime\":1736467975,\"endTime\":1736467976},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"know, making up our story about what we think it is. And, you know, that person \",\"startTime\":1736467979,\"endTime\":1736467983},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736467980,\"endTime\":1736467981},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"who''s doing that thing is obviously no good. Yeah. Yeah. All right. Oh. \",\"startTime\":1736467983,\"endTime\":1736467987},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"So true.\",\"startTime\":1736467985,\"endTime\":1736467986},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Did you know there was a more button that that gives you ideas? I just clicked \",\"startTime\":1736467988,\"endTime\":1736467992},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"it just out of curiosity and yeah, I learned something. OK, I''m gonna click \",\"startTime\":1736467992,\"endTime\":1736467995},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Look at that. What? Yeah, OK.\",\"startTime\":1736467995,\"endTime\":1736467997},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"next. \",\"startTime\":1736467995,\"endTime\":1736467999},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Take turn sharing What are effective strategies to rebuild trust after it''s been lost? Press for more ideas. \",\"startTime\":1736468004,\"endTime\":1736468010},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm. Uh-huh. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468016,\"endTime\":1736468019},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Do you wanna go first on this one or you want me to go first?\",\"startTime\":1736468017,\"endTime\":1736468019},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"I''m happy to talk 1st and SO.\",\"startTime\":1736468020,\"endTime\":1736468022},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"One of the like having worked at this building through COVID when, you know, things were just wildly all over the place. One of the practices that we had, \",\"startTime\":1736468025,\"endTime\":1736468035},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"and I think most of us were doing it as I was meeting with every staff member at least twice a week on Zoom for like an hour because we had, and I mean, I''d meet with them in teams, like I''d meet with grade level teams. \",\"startTime\":1736468035,\"endTime\":1736468049},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Wow.\",\"startTime\":1736468047,\"endTime\":1736468048},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"But I think having and then when we came back, I sort of maintained that practice in person where like, you know, the beginning and end of day, I was always just popping into classrooms saying hello. And so I think one of the ways to like \",\"startTime\":1736468052,\"endTime\":1736468065},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468053,\"endTime\":1736468053},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"one of the ways that I work really hard to maintain trust or when it''s gone to build it like if I hear like, oh, this team is in this place with this issue, then I''m going to just spend a ton of time with them face to face. \",\"startTime\":1736468065,\"endTime\":1736468078},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468078,\"endTime\":1736468079},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"You know, just asking questions like what you know, what do you need to know about this? How are you feeling about this particular issue? And so I think. \",\"startTime\":1736468079,\"endTime\":1736468085},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Umm, you know the, the quickest way to get back to that is, is to have those face to face interactions and then just like you said, to follow through on whatever it is we say we''re going to do. \",\"startTime\":1736468087,\"endTime\":1736468096},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s great.\",\"startTime\":1736468099,\"endTime\":1736468101},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"There''s some context for me there with I''m the third principal in four years and that''s four years because I''ve been my second year. And so a lot of trust \",\"startTime\":1736468104,\"endTime\":1736468114},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"was eroded over over that time. And the the reason I brought up the back channeling \",\"startTime\":1736468114,\"endTime\":1736468118},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"was because that happened all the time. And I had to really sit down with staff \",\"startTime\":1736468118,\"endTime\":1736468123},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"over the last two years and rebuild that culture around what are our norms as a team? What is a positive work environment? How do we. \",\"startTime\":1736468123,\"endTime\":1736468132},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Position ourselves to do those things with our actions, with our words. So we''ve \",\"startTime\":1736468133,\"endTime\":1736468138},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468137,\"endTime\":1736468137},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"been working a lot on that. And to your point, I''ve had to be very clear on \",\"startTime\":1736468138,\"endTime\":1736468143},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"my expectations around communication and around how we engage in dialogue, how we talk about students, how we talk about families, how we talk about each other in our practice. So really building those norms. My big thing was just bringing \",\"startTime\":1736468143,\"endTime\":1736468157},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"back joy, bringing back like togetherness and trying to build it''s been. \",\"startTime\":1736468157,\"endTime\":1736468161},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Super challenging. We''re we''re definitely on an upward trajectory, but.\",\"startTime\":1736468162,\"endTime\":1736468165},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"When it''s that much turnover in a building, I''m in a title one school. So like \",\"startTime\":1736468166,\"endTime\":1736468171},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"there''s a lot of different things happening all the time. It''s it''s high impact \",\"startTime\":1736468171,\"endTime\":1736468175},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468174,\"endTime\":1736468175},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"as all these things. So yeah, that was that was the biggest thing I think I''ve \",\"startTime\":1736468175,\"endTime\":1736468179},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"I''ve done just being clear on expectations, building norms together, really bringing it out in the open, talking about it, tackling it head on and working as a team to remedy some of those things. Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736468179,\"endTime\":1736468191},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468185,\"endTime\":1736468187},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I think the bringing joy is a really good constant reminder and can be really hard from our like, from our positions. Based on what you see across \",\"startTime\":1736468192,\"endTime\":1736468202},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468199,\"endTime\":1736468200},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"the whole thing, you''re like, how am I supposed to feel joy right now? \",\"startTime\":1736468202,\"endTime\":1736468207},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yes, yeah, I I make them do Yeah, I make them do those, those things every time where I mean, we have last year we did what was the IT was kind of like A2 truths and a lie. All staff just to build on some of that. We now have an annual biannual \",\"startTime\":1736468209,\"endTime\":1736468224},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"But then yeah, we also, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468211,\"endTime\":1736468214},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"at this point, maybe three times rock, paper, scissor contest with a trophy. \",\"startTime\":1736468224,\"endTime\":1736468229},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"We always talk about how what are, you know, what''s going well, we always start meetings with like what are the highlights? \",\"startTime\":1736468229,\"endTime\":1736468239},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Awesome. Yeah, Yeah. Fun. That''s awesome. Perfect. Perfect. That''s right. That''s \",\"startTime\":1736468233,\"endTime\":1736468239},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"a good idea. \",\"startTime\":1736468239,\"endTime\":1736468244},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"What are kudos that we want to give to each other and our students and staff? \",\"startTime\":1736468240,\"endTime\":1736468245},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"And then a new one this year we''re doing is trivia. So they get really pumped \",\"startTime\":1736468245,\"endTime\":1736468249},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"about the trivia. And if the trivia is about them, like, it''s not, it''s not \",\"startTime\":1736468249,\"endTime\":1736468253},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"anything like in the world. It''s literally about these different colleagues. \",\"startTime\":1736468253,\"endTime\":1736468257},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"And then they have to guess. And then I get random points and they''re very competitive. \",\"startTime\":1736468257,\"endTime\":1736468262},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"So it works for them. And it''s pretty fun. Yeah. But it it is it is hard, Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736468262,\"endTime\":1736468266},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"I like the trivia one. That''s one I would love to do with our staff. They would \",\"startTime\":1736468267,\"endTime\":1736468269},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"get into that. \",\"startTime\":1736468269,\"endTime\":1736468271},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Oh it''s hilarious. I just did a Google survey.\",\"startTime\":1736468271,\"endTime\":1736468274},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"With a bunch of random questions, like if this was your last day on earth, what would what''s your favorite meal that you would eat? Do you have pets? What''s \",\"startTime\":1736468274,\"endTime\":1736468283},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Oh yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468282,\"endTime\":1736468283},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"the silliest pet story you have? I mean, just random stuff. And then I just \",\"startTime\":1736468283,\"endTime\":1736468287},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"put that on a slide and we just have trivia after at the beginning of every meeting. And it''s always a different person rotates. Yeah. It''s pretty fun. \",\"startTime\":1736468287,\"endTime\":1736468295},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"That''s really fun.\",\"startTime\":1736468293,\"endTime\":1736468293},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"You should, yeah. Let me know if you need the template. \",\"startTime\":1736468295,\"endTime\":1736468299},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Awesome. I''m totally doing that. Thank you.\",\"startTime\":1736468297,\"endTime\":1736468299},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Of the Google survey.\",\"startTime\":1736468303,\"endTime\":1736468304},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"They''re cool.\",\"startTime\":1736468306,\"endTime\":1736468307},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"OK, 30, great scenario.\",\"startTime\":1736468310,\"endTime\":1736468313},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"OK, what''s the next?\",\"startTime\":1736468311,\"endTime\":1736468313},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"OK.\",\"startTime\":1736468318,\"endTime\":1736468319},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468320,\"endTime\":1736468320},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Oh gosh.\",\"startTime\":1736468324,\"endTime\":1736468325},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Wait, we we enacted it? Or the district did?\",\"startTime\":1736468331,\"endTime\":1736468334},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"It sounds like district policy was enacted without consulting. So it''s it''s \",\"startTime\":1736468336,\"endTime\":1736468340},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"just the great world we live in, Annie where we are middle manager and the above a bunch of stuff without talking to people below us or us and then we get to problem. \",\"startTime\":1736468340,\"endTime\":1736468353},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"We are middle managers.\",\"startTime\":1736468347,\"endTime\":1736468348},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468354,\"endTime\":1736468355},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, I don''t know. I mean.\",\"startTime\":1736468358,\"endTime\":1736468359},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"So much of it is dependent on the politics, right? Like how are teachers feeling \",\"startTime\":1736468363,\"endTime\":1736468367},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"about it? What, what is the policy and how does it impact them? What''s the policy? \",\"startTime\":1736468367,\"endTime\":1736468372},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468367,\"endTime\":1736468367},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"How does it impact families and kids? Like kind of underlying figuring out what \",\"startTime\":1736468372,\"endTime\":1736468377},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"is it that is impacting teachers around it and parents around it. And then addressing \",\"startTime\":1736468377,\"endTime\":1736468382},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"that. There''s no like one-size-fits-all for these kinds of questions in my mind. \",\"startTime\":1736468382,\"endTime\":1736468386},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, totally.\",\"startTime\":1736468382,\"endTime\":1736468383},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and I think too, it''s like the steps to clarify the reasons and rebuild truck is again just face to face conversations. I mean, I I tried to send emails \",\"startTime\":1736468389,\"endTime\":1736468399},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468398,\"endTime\":1736468399},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"out to our school or our community and I just feel that that is such an ineffective way. Like once people have made a decision about something, they need to enter \",\"startTime\":1736468399,\"endTime\":1736468409},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"into dialogue in order. \",\"startTime\":1736468409,\"endTime\":1736468414},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468410,\"endTime\":1736468411},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Maybe they don''t even change their mind about it, but in order to come to peace with whatever the situation is going to be. \",\"startTime\":1736468420,\"endTime\":1736468426},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah, I.\",\"startTime\":1736468426,\"endTime\":1736468427},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"You know, I think where this has come up the most in our district is around. \",\"startTime\":1736468430,\"endTime\":1736468435},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Policies supporting LGBTQ youth, you know, and also curriculum where we in our, in our health curriculum. And yes, like we, we could send out emails until we''re \",\"startTime\":1736468437,\"endTime\":1736468446},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Oh.\",\"startTime\":1736468440,\"endTime\":1736468441},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"blue in the face. But those parents that are really pissed off at you are just \",\"startTime\":1736468446,\"endTime\":1736468451},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"going to sit at home and get more mad that you''re doing that thing until they get into the office. And until we can sit down and they can blow off some steam \",\"startTime\":1736468451,\"endTime\":1736468460},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"and then we can get into a real conversation like you''re not getting anywhere. \",\"startTime\":1736468460,\"endTime\":1736468465},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468461,\"endTime\":1736468462},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, it''s so true. And a lot of it is like I just want to be heard and seen \",\"startTime\":1736468470,\"endTime\":1736468474},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"and that I have an issue with this thing. The other thing that you just reminded \",\"startTime\":1736468474,\"endTime\":1736468478},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"me of is that I struggle sometimes with. \",\"startTime\":1736468478,\"endTime\":1736468483},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"How to maintain my own?\",\"startTime\":1736468485,\"endTime\":1736468487},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Not Facade, but like, how do I remain neutral in that position where I''m also frustrated with the district and I also don''t like the decision. How do I then \",\"startTime\":1736468489,\"endTime\":1736468500},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"say to the people, hey, I''m really sorry this happened. Here''s my understanding \",\"startTime\":1736468500,\"endTime\":1736468505},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468505,\"endTime\":1736468507},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"of policy and the impacts of it. And let''s talk through these pieces I have \",\"startTime\":1736468505,\"endTime\":1736468510},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"because I''m I''m very like I wear my feelings outward on my sleeve and like. \",\"startTime\":1736468510,\"endTime\":1736468516},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"It''s hard for me to hide because I try to live authentically. Like I''m not faking \",\"startTime\":1736468518,\"endTime\":1736468522},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"the funk. If I am feeling a certain way, you''re going to know it and I''m not \",\"startTime\":1736468522,\"endTime\":1736468525},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"going to be rude or unprofessional, but you''re going to know. \",\"startTime\":1736468525,\"endTime\":1736468529},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468526,\"endTime\":1736468526},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"So how do you, how do you grapple with that? I just have such a hard time with \",\"startTime\":1736468529,\"endTime\":1736468532},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"that because there''s so many things right now that the district does that I''m like, this is nonsensical. I don''t get it. \",\"startTime\":1736468532,\"endTime\":1736468538},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Right. Yeah, Well, it''s interesting. I mean, you talk about like having situations \",\"startTime\":1736468539,\"endTime\":1736468544},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"in special Ed where I feel like against that all the time. You know, great example \",\"startTime\":1736468544,\"endTime\":1736468548},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468546,\"endTime\":1736468546},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Mm-hmm.\",\"startTime\":1736468548,\"endTime\":1736468549},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"is where, you know, maybe we feel that we want to have a student who''s assigned some individual paraeducator minutes and our special Ed director is saying you can''t do that. We don''t have the money for it. What what am I say sitting in \",\"startTime\":1736468548,\"endTime\":1736468561},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"this IEP meeting and say we don''t have money to support your child? \",\"startTime\":1736468561,\"endTime\":1736468565},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Right.\",\"startTime\":1736468563,\"endTime\":1736468564},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"You know, so I like it is it is definitely a conundrum because I mean, those are. \",\"startTime\":1736468567,\"endTime\":1736468572},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468570,\"endTime\":1736468570},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"People that we need to have good relationships with and like be in good standing with. And there''s times when you''re just like that. This is not OK. I haven''t \",\"startTime\":1736468572,\"endTime\":1736468582},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468581,\"endTime\":1736468582},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"figured that one out. All that is to say I''ve not figured out. So yeah, so I''ve \",\"startTime\":1736468582,\"endTime\":1736468587},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"I was really hoping eight years in, you had some solid advice for me around that issue. \",\"startTime\":1736468586,\"endTime\":1736468591},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"had I guess like 5 different supervisors since I''ve been here. The supervisor \",\"startTime\":1736468587,\"endTime\":1736468592},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"I have, I have a relation like she''s been my supervisor for the last two years. \",\"startTime\":1736468592,\"endTime\":1736468597},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah, that''s a lot.\",\"startTime\":1736468596,\"endTime\":1736468598},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"And I can like bring issues to her and be like, hey. \",\"startTime\":1736468597,\"endTime\":1736468602},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"I really think that what''s happening right here is bullshit like help, help me ''cause I ''cause I just don''t like this isn''t working. And so we can have \",\"startTime\":1736468610,\"endTime\":1736468617},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s.\",\"startTime\":1736468613,\"endTime\":1736468614},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"those really good back and forth conversations. So I''ve sort of become that \",\"startTime\":1736468617,\"endTime\":1736468620},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"angry parent in the meeting and then she can so I can get into a slightly better place. But then through that I can figure out, so how am I gonna communicate \",\"startTime\":1736468620,\"endTime\":1736468627},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"this with our team? Like what are the Nuggets here? What''s the that can feedback \",\"startTime\":1736468627,\"endTime\":1736468630},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"to them? \",\"startTime\":1736468630,\"endTime\":1736468633},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468634,\"endTime\":1736468635},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"That''s nice. I, I''m still getting to know my supervisor. She''s new this year, \",\"startTime\":1736468637,\"endTime\":1736468641},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"not, not new to the district, just new to me. They did some, you know, reshuffle \",\"startTime\":1736468641,\"endTime\":1736468645},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"last year for budget and stuff and she''s already broken my trust a couple times. \",\"startTime\":1736468645,\"endTime\":1736468649},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468645,\"endTime\":1736468646},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"So that''s the tricky I, I don''t know that person. \",\"startTime\":1736468649,\"endTime\":1736468653},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, great. That''s just great.\",\"startTime\":1736468651,\"endTime\":1736468655},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"I know, I know. So I I, but that''s good though. Like so finding a person to \",\"startTime\":1736468657,\"endTime\":1736468661},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"get that energy out so that you can process it and then kind of move forward. \",\"startTime\":1736468661,\"endTime\":1736468665},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"I could try that. \",\"startTime\":1736468665,\"endTime\":1736468669},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah, and it could be.\",\"startTime\":1736468667,\"endTime\":1736468668},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"If you have and I think like, you know, special Ed director is a great person to talk to about that kind of stuff because they''re constantly churning and all of that throughout the district office and trying to navigate politics on behalf of students they''re trying to advocate for. So that''s, you know, I''ve \",\"startTime\":1736468668,\"endTime\":1736468684},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1736468683,\"endTime\":1736468684},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"I talked to a lot about issues, but and we''re lucky to have somebody great. \",\"startTime\":1736468684,\"endTime\":1736468688},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that''s so true.\",\"startTime\":1736468686,\"endTime\":1736468687},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah. \",\"startTime\":1736468688,\"endTime\":1736468691},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that is lucky. All right, I''m going to hit the next. Here we go. That''s \",\"startTime\":1736468694,\"endTime\":1736468696},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"it. \",\"startTime\":1736468696,\"endTime\":1736468699},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"Yeah. Oh, thank you, Andy. I learned that I''m going to do this last survey. \",\"startTime\":1736468699,\"endTime\":1736468703},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"Thanks, Nick. It was so nice to talk with you. Do it, man. It''s fun and it''s \",\"startTime\":1736468703,\"endTime\":1736468706},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"I''m going to do some trivia. We''re going trivia. \",\"startTime\":1736468703,\"endTime\":1736468707},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"silly and it makes them laugh and get excited and take random points. Like sometimes \",\"startTime\":1736468706,\"endTime\":1736468710},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"I just award points because I like the color blue that day. And so everyone \",\"startTime\":1736468710,\"endTime\":1736468714},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"that''s the team that are wearing someone''s wearing blue, I''m going to give you an extra point. Like it''s it''s silly. It''s fun. Yeah. Well, so nice to talk \",\"startTime\":1736468714,\"endTime\":1736468722},{\"speaker\":\"11318\",\"text\":\"with you. \",\"startTime\":1736468722,\"endTime\":1736468725},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"That''s so fun. That''s great. Cool. It''s so good. Yeah. I hope that you have \",\"startTime\":1736468724,\"endTime\":1736468728},{\"speaker\":\"11341\",\"text\":\"a good rest of your day. All right, Bye. \",\"startTime\":1736468728,\"endTime\":1736468733}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.457511+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.457511+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1308, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:28.372Z", "session_title": "The Currency of Trust: Rebuilding and Strengthening Relationships", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1436", "name": "The Currency of Trust: Rebuilding and Strengthening Relationships", "tags": [{"name": "BEL"}, {"name": "LSL"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('8dc61020-48f2-47f9-bf93-f0c78accfdd4', '713b8455-cc3b-4ab1-bcfb-255f93bf56b0', '74399', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:40:27.130529+00', '2025-05-06 19:40:27.130529+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 1157, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:40:26.926Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('bdcd8c3f-39a5-4ead-9443-b53aeb70ffd1', 'a3d62eb9-a287-4962-83ad-36d2e6f079b3', '68533', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:40:30.841597+00', '2025-05-06 19:40:30.841597+00', '{"type": "PAIR", "duration": 322, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:40:30.789Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('d906cc60-e8f4-455e-9261-bac5caeff50a', 'e5a67ee9-d30e-4f26-bafd-bf20b9ba4ab6', '137040', '"[{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Hi, my name is Mike and I teach artificial intelligence mostly to teachers and leaders of teachers. I''ve taught precalculus section. I''m currently teaching \",\"startTime\":1739388509,\"endTime\":1739388515},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"precalculus at the moment. \",\"startTime\":1739388515,\"endTime\":1739388517},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"I''m teaching video production at the moment as well. Those are two courses I''m \",\"startTime\":1739388517,\"endTime\":1739388520},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"teaching at the high school level. \",\"startTime\":1739388520,\"endTime\":1739388523},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"And I hope to learn more about.\",\"startTime\":1739388524,\"endTime\":1739388526},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"I hope to learn more about what students should learn now that we have tools to do some of our traditional thinking for us. \",\"startTime\":1739388529,\"endTime\":1739388537},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"So like.\",\"startTime\":1739388538,\"endTime\":1739388539},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Umm, if we ignore the concept of cheating.\",\"startTime\":1739388542,\"endTime\":1739388545},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"In umm.\",\"startTime\":1739388546,\"endTime\":1739388548},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"In the conversation about artificial intelligence, what becomes possible and what are the real repercussions of like skipping some steps? So like my son? \",\"startTime\":1739388548,\"endTime\":1739388556},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Could learn how to type, but if you can just talk and that''s more natural than typing. Do I get to skip that step in his learning so that he can move on to \",\"startTime\":1739388559,\"endTime\":1739388567},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"other things? And the answer is probably yes. \",\"startTime\":1739388567,\"endTime\":1739388570},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"But yeah, I guess I wanna hear about people''s opinions. What to definitely not \",\"startTime\":1739388573,\"endTime\":1739388576},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"stuck with what to definitely not, umm, skip, etcetera. \",\"startTime\":1739388576,\"endTime\":1739388579},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"What else would I like to learn?\",\"startTime\":1739388581,\"endTime\":1739388582},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"I think I''ll start with just that.\",\"startTime\":1739388587,\"endTime\":1739388588},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"My stance when it comes to learning is.\",\"startTime\":1739388804,\"endTime\":1739388807},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"I want to say it''s very learner centered and what I mean by that is I like to let the learner. \",\"startTime\":1739388808,\"endTime\":1739388813},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Become curious and accelerate them towards wherever they''re curious about.\",\"startTime\":1739388816,\"endTime\":1739388819},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"I am balanced by like having respect for the standards. Like those things were \",\"startTime\":1739388821,\"endTime\":1739388823},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"really thoughtful. \",\"startTime\":1739388823,\"endTime\":1739388826},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"So when we think about like my history as a math teacher, like, I don''t know everything there is to know about what every person needs to know about quantitative thinking, and people have done a really good job to write that down. \",\"startTime\":1739388827,\"endTime\":1739388839},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Over generations and so.\",\"startTime\":1739388840,\"endTime\":1739388843},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"So the teacher''s job.\",\"startTime\":1739388846,\"endTime\":1739388848},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Is to know the standards UMM and align them to natural interest and ability level. \",\"startTime\":1739388848,\"endTime\":1739388854},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Which means starting with the line, so taking the learner from where they are to where they want to go. But. \",\"startTime\":1739388855,\"endTime\":1739388860},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"But also letting the standard play a role.\",\"startTime\":1739388860,\"endTime\":1739388861},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"I''m tech forward, so I think that we should use the tools of our time.\",\"startTime\":1739388864,\"endTime\":1739388869},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Umm, and.\",\"startTime\":1739388872,\"endTime\":1739388873},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"I work to help make that happen. So one of the parts of my stance is I''m ex. \",\"startTime\":1739388873,\"endTime\":1739388876},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"I''m accelerating. \",\"startTime\":1739388876,\"endTime\":1739388878},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"That piece through my work again, I teach at.\",\"startTime\":1739388880,\"endTime\":1739388884},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"North Tahoe High School in.\",\"startTime\":1739388886,\"endTime\":1739388888},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"Tahoe City, CA. I''m historically a math teacher.\",\"startTime\":1739388889,\"endTime\":1739388893},{\"speaker\":\"11872\",\"text\":\"And I have in the past been a curriculum and instruction coordinator, and I''ve also played various roles in technology companies. \",\"startTime\":1739388894,\"endTime\":1739388902}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.136644+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:28.136644+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 190, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:27.939Z", "session_title": "Welcome to sideby!", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "22", "name": "Welcome to sideby!", "tags": [{"name": "Active"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "Leaders of Color"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('be12c420-107e-47a0-8d5d-1a0b0387dba6', '8e138eac-83e4-4b99-b829-8ac2428030c2', '80755', '"[]"', '2025-05-06 19:40:27.279157+00', '2025-05-06 19:40:27.279157+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 75, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:40:27.080Z", "session_title": "Understanding and Utilizing GPT and AI Threads", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "197", "name": "Understanding and Utilizing GPT and AI Threads", "tags": [{"name": "Dream Camp"}, {"name": "ColumbiaSelkirk"}, {"name": "AI in Education"}, {"name": "Freemium"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('2b42b9d5-50cd-427b-a5b6-e366575ea01e', '4734e9cf-74b7-4e89-b92c-8dc6f49c5b2a', '137125', '"[{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Oh man, there''s a number of ways I''ve seen trust Rd. in a school setting.\",\"startTime\":1739890025,\"endTime\":1739890028},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And with his teacher. Teacher staff to school leaders, school leader to school \",\"startTime\":1739890028,\"endTime\":1739890030},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"leader. \",\"startTime\":1739890030,\"endTime\":1739890033},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I think the bottom line is is.\",\"startTime\":1739890033,\"endTime\":1739890035},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Rust was built upon honesty.\",\"startTime\":1739890037,\"endTime\":1739890039},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And trust is built on on getting to know other people.\",\"startTime\":1739890039,\"endTime\":1739890044},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And then getting to know you and and how you work and how you act and how you think. \",\"startTime\":1739890044,\"endTime\":1739890048},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Also reminded of assignments. Senate quote.\",\"startTime\":1739890049,\"endTime\":1739890051},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"That trust isn''t isn''t when you do things for people. And I''m not getting it \",\"startTime\":1739890053,\"endTime\":1739890056},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"all correct but. \",\"startTime\":1739890056,\"endTime\":1739890058},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Trust is when you ask people to do things for you and with you.\",\"startTime\":1739890058,\"endTime\":1739890062},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Because you''re acknowledging who they are and what they bring to the table.\",\"startTime\":1739890062,\"endTime\":1739890066},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"But I think really it''s just all about integrity and getting stuff done.\",\"startTime\":1739890066,\"endTime\":1739890070},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"People want to see you doing the work. People want to make sure that you follow \",\"startTime\":1739890070,\"endTime\":1739890072},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"through. \",\"startTime\":1739890072,\"endTime\":1739890074},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"People want to make sure that you take care of them in some way, shape or form and what they need and the support that they need. \",\"startTime\":1739890075,\"endTime\":1739890080},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"People want to see that you''re visible when you''re not visible. Trust roads. \",\"startTime\":1739890081,\"endTime\":1739890085},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Yeah, those are probably about the different ways.\",\"startTime\":1739890087,\"endTime\":1739890089},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"What an effective strategy to rebuild trust after has been lost.\",\"startTime\":1739890108,\"endTime\":1739890111},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And it''s tough, ''cause as a leader you.\",\"startTime\":1739890112,\"endTime\":1739890115},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You know, it''s difficult to acknowledge to groups or acknowledge to certain pieces of your faculty or community members or whoever that. \",\"startTime\":1739890116,\"endTime\":1739890124},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You know what? I''ve lost your trust. But I think that''s critically important \",\"startTime\":1739890124,\"endTime\":1739890127},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"to regaining it. \",\"startTime\":1739890127,\"endTime\":1739890129},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"It''s acknowledging the recognition that everybody knows what everybody knows what everybody feels. \",\"startTime\":1739890131,\"endTime\":1739890136},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"The trust has been lost.\",\"startTime\":1739890136,\"endTime\":1739890137},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And then you you share that.\",\"startTime\":1739890137,\"endTime\":1739890140},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"In a public setting, Umm, acknowledge it.\",\"startTime\":1739890141,\"endTime\":1739890144},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Be vulnerable. And then you describe the ways you''re gonna, you''re gonna rebuild \",\"startTime\":1739890144,\"endTime\":1739890146},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"that. \",\"startTime\":1739890146,\"endTime\":1739890148},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And that you need umm.\",\"startTime\":1739890149,\"endTime\":1739890150},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Those around you to to.\",\"startTime\":1739890151,\"endTime\":1739890153},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Assist in holding you accountable just like the norms in in in whatever you have your working norms in your building. \",\"startTime\":1739890154,\"endTime\":1739890160},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"But I think it, you know, it''s.\",\"startTime\":1739890160,\"endTime\":1739890162},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Effective strategies to rebuild is really turning around.\",\"startTime\":1739890163,\"endTime\":1739890167},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"The reasons why trust has been lost.\",\"startTime\":1739890167,\"endTime\":1739890169},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"It was because you''re not following through. Well, start following through.\",\"startTime\":1739890169,\"endTime\":1739890173},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"What''s the system that''s gonna help you do that? If it''s communication?\",\"startTime\":1739890174,\"endTime\":1739890178},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"So there''s communication gaps which can lead to the loss of trust.\",\"startTime\":1739890179,\"endTime\":1739890182},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"How you''re gonna increase communication, I think it''s important to probably strategy wise to to ask staff. \",\"startTime\":1739890182,\"endTime\":1739890189},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You know what are some ways with which we can make this work to rebuild trust, not only between? \",\"startTime\":1739890189,\"endTime\":1739890195},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Well, yeah, how can we rebuild the trust?\",\"startTime\":1739890196,\"endTime\":1739890199},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"It''s a great scenario.\",\"startTime\":1739890243,\"endTime\":1739890244},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You know, sometimes we think any, any.\",\"startTime\":1739890244,\"endTime\":1739890246},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"This is just a small change, but even the smallest change is just a great reminder that even the smallest changes can. \",\"startTime\":1739890246,\"endTime\":1739890251},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Can upset many and be seen as as unilateral and.\",\"startTime\":1739890252,\"endTime\":1739890256},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And not good because.\",\"startTime\":1739890256,\"endTime\":1739890258},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Knowing your staff, knowing their individual context, knowing the process of political context about making decisions is critically important too, as as a leader. \",\"startTime\":1739890259,\"endTime\":1739890267},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And there''s times when those when the unilateral decision just has to be made. \",\"startTime\":1739890268,\"endTime\":1739890272},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"But there''s other times where it''s critically important to get the input of your staff. \",\"startTime\":1739890273,\"endTime\":1739890277},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And community members and others, and this is certainly one of those times when you''re going to have such a massive effect on the entire system. \",\"startTime\":1739890277,\"endTime\":1739890283},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I think it goes back to what I shared earlier in in regards to.\",\"startTime\":1739890284,\"endTime\":1739890287},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Just acknowledging it.\",\"startTime\":1739890288,\"endTime\":1739890289},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Just flat out saying I screwed up and then working with those around you to. \",\"startTime\":1739890290,\"endTime\":1739890296},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Take the steps necessary to rectify it.\",\"startTime\":1739890298,\"endTime\":1739890300},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Acknowledge that.\",\"startTime\":1739890303,\"endTime\":1739890304},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I went against our building norms or whatever that might be.\",\"startTime\":1739890304,\"endTime\":1739890307},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"But the sooner you you acknowledge, and the sooner you can do that.\",\"startTime\":1739890308,\"endTime\":1739890312},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Then the hope is that it stops the erosion of trust.\",\"startTime\":1739890313,\"endTime\":1739890318},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Umm, if teachers feel blindsided and students are concerned about reduced access to counselors. \",\"startTime\":1739890319,\"endTime\":1739890325},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"How can you increase that? How you gonna make that happen?\",\"startTime\":1739890325,\"endTime\":1739890327},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"But again, when we think about the maintaining professionalism and empathy.\",\"startTime\":1739890330,\"endTime\":1739890333},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"I think you just, you just step right into it, you own it, you acknowledge it and you identify the steps to move forward from there. \",\"startTime\":1739890334,\"endTime\":1739890341},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Along with that though.\",\"startTime\":1739890342,\"endTime\":1739890343},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You know, we can clarify reasons as well all we want.\",\"startTime\":1739890344,\"endTime\":1739890346},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"But it doesn''t take away what the staff felt, it doesn''t take away what the students feel, it doesn''t take away what the community feels around the decision being made. \",\"startTime\":1739890346,\"endTime\":1739890354},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Umm, you can share why, but a lot of times the why doesn''t matter.\",\"startTime\":1739890355,\"endTime\":1739890360},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You have to lean into the emotions that people are feeling.\",\"startTime\":1739890360,\"endTime\":1739890363},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"You have to listen to them, you have to acknowledge that you''ve heard them, and you have to identify clear steps moving forward. \",\"startTime\":1739890363,\"endTime\":1739890369},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Because that''s the way that you''re going to be able to rebuild the trust and you have to involve them in that process. You know, you can''t just isolate yourself \",\"startTime\":1739890370,\"endTime\":1739890376},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"and. \",\"startTime\":1739890376,\"endTime\":1739890379},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"And and commit the same error that you had earlier. You have to.\",\"startTime\":1739890381,\"endTime\":1739890384},{\"speaker\":\"8437\",\"text\":\"Umm, you have to involve the stakeholders in that process.\",\"startTime\":1739890384,\"endTime\":1739890387}]"', '2025-05-06 19:02:27.841227+00', '2025-05-06 19:02:27.841227+00', '{"type": "SINGLE", "duration": 319, "created_at": "2025-05-06T19:02:27.775Z", "session_title": "The Currency of Trust: Rebuilding and Strengthening Relationships", "knowledgeNodes": [{"id": "1436", "name": "The Currency of Trust: Rebuilding and Strengthening Relationships", "tags": [{"name": "BEL"}, {"name": "LSL"}]}], "manually_stored": true}'),
	('866ca94d-fea9-408c-b78f-8b750feac470', 'f75f7f16-84b9-41ce-b842-2a77a9dd70b8', '135740', '"[{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Hey, hey, hey. I can''t. Can''t. Good. We got matching hats.\",\"startTime\":1734552160,\"endTime\":1734552165},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"How''s it going?\",\"startTime\":1734552162,\"endTime\":1734552163},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"We do have matching hats. I have barely any snow. You look like you''ve got beautiful \",\"startTime\":1734552165,\"endTime\":1734552167},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"snow. \",\"startTime\":1734552167,\"endTime\":1734552170},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"We got no snow down in Auburn. I''m in the green.\",\"startTime\":1734552170,\"endTime\":1734552174},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Oh, OK, you''re cheating. Yeah, it''s good. Well, it''s good ''cause it''s not. It \",\"startTime\":1734552173,\"endTime\":1734552177},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"How''s your break so far?\",\"startTime\":1734552177,\"endTime\":1734552178},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"starts like for true on Friday night. So it''s like the partial breaking, but \",\"startTime\":1734552177,\"endTime\":1734552181},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"really good to be able to take the some of the gas pedals down. Yeah, yeah, \",\"startTime\":1734552181,\"endTime\":1734552186},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"yeah. \",\"startTime\":1734552186,\"endTime\":1734552190},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"I feel the same way. It''s like not all the way off, but like I after dropping \",\"startTime\":1734552190,\"endTime\":1734552194},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Ella off this morning for school, I sat in the coffee shop for an hour and like talked to my neighbors and just in for the rush of like gotta give back and answer all the emails. So yeah, feeling it, but still sitting at the computer \",\"startTime\":1734552194,\"endTime\":1734552205},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yes, agreed.\",\"startTime\":1734552205,\"endTime\":1734552208},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"a bunch. \",\"startTime\":1734552205,\"endTime\":1734552209},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"You want to share a fun fact about yourself?\",\"startTime\":1734552212,\"endTime\":1734552214},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Fun fact.\",\"startTime\":1734552215,\"endTime\":1734552216},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I was on a quiz show, like middle schools all did, like the local quiz, you know, it was like your school represented and you fought against the other middle schools, whatever. And they were like, what do you want to be? And I was like, \",\"startTime\":1734552218,\"endTime\":1734552229},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"obviously, like, tiger trainer at a tiger sanctuary. \",\"startTime\":1734552229,\"endTime\":1734552232},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Obviously so I''ve said that on television.\",\"startTime\":1734552238,\"endTime\":1734552239},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Well, you got it. You''ve arrived.\",\"startTime\":1734552241,\"endTime\":1734552243},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"You know, yeah, maybe. How about you, Mike?\",\"startTime\":1734552246,\"endTime\":1734552249},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"That''s awesome.\",\"startTime\":1734552249,\"endTime\":1734552250},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"On the same thread I was on Canadian MTV Once Upon a time at the Olympics. They \",\"startTime\":1734552252,\"endTime\":1734552256},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"asked me what''s the word that sounds dirty but isn''t. That was my quiz and I \",\"startTime\":1734552256,\"endTime\":1734552261},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"didn''t say Tiger trainer. I don''t want to say it recorded but the Olympics was \",\"startTime\":1734552261,\"endTime\":1734552266},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"so cool to go to. It was the win of the Olympics was it was raining down in \",\"startTime\":1734552266,\"endTime\":1734552270},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"That''s fair. I appreciate you walking me to the line, but you didn''t take me \",\"startTime\":1734552270,\"endTime\":1734552273},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"like the village but Whistler is a vertical mile so the top for the news is all covering how rainy it was so people were. \",\"startTime\":1734552270,\"endTime\":1734552279},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"across the 5th. \",\"startTime\":1734552273,\"endTime\":1734552276},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Great. Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734552279,\"endTime\":1734552282},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734552288,\"endTime\":1734552289},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Just like sitting in the village drinking and partying and we were able to go to the top and have the mountain to ourselves and it was beautiful. It was like \",\"startTime\":1734552291,\"endTime\":1734552298},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"world class up there. So it''s like the whole world was there to party, which \",\"startTime\":1734552298,\"endTime\":1734552301},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"was amazing. And then we also got like a really good skiing adventure. Core \",\"startTime\":1734552301,\"endTime\":1734552305},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734552304,\"endTime\":1734552305},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"memory for sure. \",\"startTime\":1734552305,\"endTime\":1734552308},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"So cool. Yeah, yeah, I definitely want to go to the Olympics.\",\"startTime\":1734552309,\"endTime\":1734552313},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"They''ve got the next two are Italy and then LA kind of like reasonable like like you can picture one of those. \",\"startTime\":1734552314,\"endTime\":1734552321},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yep, yes, I''m on the list for tickets for both. We''ll see what that means, but \",\"startTime\":1734552322,\"endTime\":1734552325},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"on the list for tickets. \",\"startTime\":1734552325,\"endTime\":1734552329},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Nice, Well done. We did not get the AI innovation session, but this will be \",\"startTime\":1734552328,\"endTime\":1734552332},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, OK, got it.\",\"startTime\":1734552332,\"endTime\":1734552334},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"fun to do together in the context. Yeah, I''d love to follow your lead on this \",\"startTime\":1734552332,\"endTime\":1734552336},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"one if you don''t mind. \",\"startTime\":1734552336,\"endTime\":1734552339},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"I''m gonna take John Shannon. What are students that are mean to you?\",\"startTime\":1734552338,\"endTime\":1734552342},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, that I trying to think of like when did I first hear that term? I think \",\"startTime\":1734552348,\"endTime\":1734552351},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"what''s interesting is coming from like my best learning experiences in high school were sport experiences and you would always be athlete centered because there was really no other way. Like you wouldn''t like we''re all gonna do a workout \",\"startTime\":1734552351,\"endTime\":1734552361},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"that makes no sense for anyone on the team. Like So I think that there was just \",\"startTime\":1734552361,\"endTime\":1734552364},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"an element of seeing really great coaching where it''s like, of course you''re gonna. \",\"startTime\":1734552364,\"endTime\":1734552371},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Differentiate a bit, of course you''re gonna focus like the throwers are not gonna do the same workout as the distance runners. Like that just makes no sense. \",\"startTime\":1734552372,\"endTime\":1734552380},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"And so it was very there was just like a normalization of you support what people might need and and meet them where they are. But always believing this constant \",\"startTime\":1734552380,\"endTime\":1734552389},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like belief. Of course you can get there. Of course you can go. So I I think \",\"startTime\":1734552389,\"endTime\":1734552393},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"like core wise that stuck with me of that was how learning could be and then becoming a teacher. And we did talk about student centered. \",\"startTime\":1734552393,\"endTime\":1734552402},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Just because of the learning model. So some of the language in El came through \",\"startTime\":1734552402,\"endTime\":1734552406},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"of like we''re, we''re and then look like sound like feel like students talk more, teachers talk less was something like right away that was just like just flip it simple. And then it''s like exploration and discovery versus filling up of \",\"startTime\":1734552406,\"endTime\":1734552418},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"a like the banking model. And so there were those little terms. Yeah, yeah. \",\"startTime\":1734552418,\"endTime\":1734552422},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"I''m hearing three things so far, just to keep it straight. Like the first thing \",\"startTime\":1734552419,\"endTime\":1734552425},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"you share was about differentiation. The second thing that you shared was around. \",\"startTime\":1734552425,\"endTime\":1734552430},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Like the the active person in the teacher learner relationship. And the third \",\"startTime\":1734552430,\"endTime\":1734552434},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"was around the like the expectation for where learning comes from. Like it''s \",\"startTime\":1734552434,\"endTime\":1734552438},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"not like I have the right words for that one yet, but the, the empty bucket versus stimulation of motivation and whatever The thing is that has under that part. Those feel like 3 important components for sure. And they''re they''re not \",\"startTime\":1734552438,\"endTime\":1734552452},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"the same as each other or close to it, if you think ab