nd like another again, I''m just quoting the library of books you gave me early on. It was like real learning, real work. The authenticity \",\"startTime\":1734552875,\"endTime\":1734552884},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"of the challenge isn''t isn''t just the hard math problem, but it''s the navigating to a place where getting an answer to a complex math problem has value in the world. And and that''s a very that''s that is a different kind of dynamic system \",\"startTime\":1734552884,\"endTime\":1734552897},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah.\",\"startTime\":1734552888,\"endTime\":1734552889},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"that kids, adults can navigate in different for different levels. \",\"startTime\":1734552897,\"endTime\":1734552901},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Different calibrate levels. Umm cool, so the.\",\"startTime\":1734552904,\"endTime\":1734552908},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"I need help like getting the words right. Is it liberatory?\",\"startTime\":1734552910,\"endTime\":1734552913},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Yeah, liberatory. It''s spelled like liberatory, liberatory. And that''s, yeah, \",\"startTime\":1734552913,\"endTime\":1734552917},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Laboratory.\",\"startTime\":1734552915,\"endTime\":1734552915},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"hooks and like Paulo Freire, who, you know, pedagogy of the oppressed. \",\"startTime\":1734552917,\"endTime\":1734552921},{\"speaker\":\"283\",\"text\":\"Like some of these, you''ve heard the terms or you''ve heard the people, but when you really start digging, it''s it''s also just especially so that not just like make a positive impact in the world so you understand how the world works. \",\"startTime\":1734552922,\"endTime\":1734552935},{\"speaker\":\"262\",\"text\":\"Like to navigate our society and science within it or and mathematics within it. And yeah, not yeah, it''s not in a in a lab is a good word, like a sterile \",\"startTime\":1734552937,\"endTime\":1734552